<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- Rohingya Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Torah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Torah Foidah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Torah</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tor</para>
  <para style="mt1">Torah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Sirišṭir Šuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1"/>Šurut maze Allaye asman edde zobin sirišṭi goijje. <verse eid="GEN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2"/>Duniyai akarsara edde hali aššil, hiyanor uwore aššil andare guijja goin fani. Ar Allar Ruh fanir uwottu sola fira gorat aššil.<verse eid="GEN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3"/>Toi Allaye hodde, "Fohor ok," henot fohor oiye. <verse eid="GEN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4"/>Allaye sadde fohor bala oiye, toi Allaye fohorottu andarore zuda goijje. <verse eid="GEN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5"/>Allaye fohorore nam diye "din," ar andarore hibaye nam diye "rait." Toi heṛe hazinna oiye edde binna oiye, ar hiyan aššilde foila din.<verse eid="GEN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6"/>Allaye hodde, "Fanit maze ekkan gũitor ḍoil fák zaga ok, ar fani dui bag oi aleda ok." <verse eid="GEN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7"/>Ei bafe Allaye fanit maze ekkan fák zaga goijje, nisor fani edde uworor fani aleda goijje. Ar henot hen oiye. <verse eid="GEN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8"/>Bade Allaye he gũitor ḍoil fák zagaganor nam diye asman. Toi heṛe hazinna oiye edde binna oiye, ar hiyan aššilde dusora din.<verse eid="GEN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9"/>Bade Allaye hodde, "Asmanor nisor hár fani ek zagat zoma ok, ar deha zok fuwana zaga." Ar henot hen oiye. <verse eid="GEN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10"/>Allaye he fuwana zagar nam diye zobin, ar he fani zoma oiyede hiyanor nam diye doriya. Ar Allaye sadde hin bala oiye.<verse eid="GEN 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11"/>Allaye hodde, "Zobine háil ker, biz fodai gorede lota-fata, edde šobzi zar zar zat mozin dana loi gula dorade gula gas okkol, zobinor uwore fuṛaok." Ar henot hen oiye. <verse eid="GEN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12"/>Toi zobine háil ker, biz fodai gorede lota-fata, edde šobzi zar zar zat mozin dana loi gula dorade gula gas okkol, fuṛaiye. Ar Allaye sadde hin bala oiye. <verse eid="GEN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13"/>Toi heṛe hazinna oiye edde binna oiye, ar hiyan aššilde tisera din.<verse eid="GEN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14"/>Bade Allaye hodde, "Raitottu dinore aleda goribolla asmanot gũitor ḍoil fák zagat fohor okkol ok, ar hin okkol sinno ok, boro din okkololla, din okkololla edde bosorolla, <verse eid="GEN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15"/>ar hin okkole duniyait fohor dibolla asmanot gũitor ḍoil fák zagat takok." Ar henot hen oiye. <verse eid="GEN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16"/>Toi Allaye dinor uwore razagiri goribolla ekkan beši ḍõr fohor, ar raitor uwore razagiri goribolla hiyanottuwaro ekka šoṛo fohor, ei beši ḍõr fohor duniyan edde tara banaiye. <verse eid="GEN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17"/>Ar Allaye hinore asmanot gũitor ḍoil fák zagat buwaiye, <verse eid="GEN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18"/>din edde raitor uwore razagiri goribolla, edde andarottu fohorore aleda goribolla. Ar Allaye sadde hin bala oiye. <verse eid="GEN 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19"/>Ar heṛe hazinna oiye edde binna oiye, ar hiyan aššilde sair lomboror din.<verse eid="GEN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20"/>Bade Allaye hodde, "Fani nanan ḍoilla zandaror zãke bori uṛok, edde duniyair uwore asmanot maze faik okkol urok." <verse eid="GEN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21"/>Toi Allaye doriyar he ḍõr ḍõr zanuwar okkol edde fanit zãk bandi solede nanan zator ze hár zandar okkol ase, hin okkolore, edde nanan zator faik okkol sirišti goijje. Ar Allaye sadde hin bala oiye. <verse eid="GEN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22"/>Allaye hin okkolore duwa goijje, edde hodde, "Fólwala o edde beši o, ar doriyar fanire furon goro, duniyait faik okkol o beša beši ok." <verse eid="GEN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23"/>Ar heṛe hazinna oiye edde binna oiye, ar hiyan aššilde faš lomboror din.<verse eid="GEN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24"/>Tarfore Allaye hodde, "Zobinottu hár ḍoilla zandar zanuwar okkol niyoli aiyok: górot falede edde buke aṛede zandar, abanaiya fahari hár ḍoilla zandar okkol." Ar henot hen oiye. <verse eid="GEN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25"/>Allaye zar zar zat mozin fahari zanuwar edde zar zar zat mozin górot falede zanuwar edde zar zar zat mozin zobinot hár ḍoilla buke aṛede zandar okkol banaiye. Ar Allaye sadde hin bala oiye.<verse eid="GEN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26"/>Tarfore Allaye hodde, "Ãra ãrar súrot loi, ãrar ḍoilla manuš banai. Hitara doriyar mas, asmanor faik, górot falede edde fahari zanuwar, ar duniyair hár ḍoilla buke aṛede zandar okkolor uwore šašon goribo."<verse eid="GEN 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27"/>Toi Allaye manušore nizor súrote sirišti goijje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 1:27">Allar súrote hibare sirišti goijje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 1:27">maya edde morod gori hibaye hitarare sirišti goijje.<verse eid="GEN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28"/>Allaye hitarare duwa goijje edde hitarare hodde, "Fólwala o edde zono šoinkaye beši o edde duniyai furon goro, ar duniyaire nizor šašonor tole ano. Ar doriyar mas okkol, asmanor tole faikor okkol, edde duniyair hár ḍoilla buke aṛede zandar okkolor uwore razagiri goro."<verse eid="GEN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29"/>Tarfore Allaye hodde, "So, ãi duniyait asede hár ḍoilla biz fodai gorede lota-fata edde hár ḍoilla dana loi gula dorade gas okkol tũwarare dilam, hin okkol tũwarar haiddo oibo. <verse eid="GEN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30"/>Ar duniyair hár zandar okkolore, asmanor uworor hár ḍoilla faik edde buke aṛede zandar okkolore, mani zeduggun zandar šiz ase hinolla adar hisabe hail fata gas gusola dilam." Ar henot hen oiye. <verse eid="GEN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31"/>Toi Allaye hibar foida goijja hár kiššur uzu saiye, ar so, hin beši bala oiye. Toi hazinna oiye edde binna oiye, ar hiyan aššilde so lomboror din.<verse eid="GEN 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1"/>Endilla gori asman edde zobin ar hinor butore hár kissu tiyar gora šeš oiye.<verse eid="GEN 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2"/>Ar Allaye hãt dinor din hibaye gorat aššilde hamore šeš goijje; he hãt dinor din hibar hár hamottu ziraiye. <verse eid="GEN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3"/>Toi ei hãt dinor dinware Allaye duwa goriyore fobitro din goijje, kiyollahoile he dinot hibar sirišti edde goijjilde hár hamottu ziraiye.<verse eid="GEN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adom edde Hawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4"/>In oiyede asman edde zobinor sirišṭi kahani zẽtte hinore sirišṭi gora oil, zẽtte <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye asman edde zobin banaiye.<verse eid="GEN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5"/>Hẽtte duniyair zobinot hono zõl, gas gusola nu aššil, ar maṛot hono lota-fata no fuṛe, kiyollahoile <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye hẽtte o duniyait hono zór no defeṛa edde zobinot saš goribolla o hono manuš nu aššil. <verse eid="GEN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6"/>Kintu meṛir tolottu fani uṛiyore zobinor uworor muk agagura bizito. <verse eid="GEN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye meṛir dúil loi manuššuwar forma banaiye edde hibar nak sai fu diyore butore zibon niyaš golai diye edde manušwa ek ziyãta zandar oiye.<verse eid="GEN 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8"/>Ar <char style="nd">Mabud </char> Allaye fuke Edenot ekkan bagan lagaiye; edde hibar tiyari manušware hibaye heṛe raikke. <verse eid="GEN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9"/><char style="nd">Mabud </char> Allaye meṛittu hár zator gas okkol fuṛi uṛabaiye, zin saite o šundor, edde háite o bala, ar baganor maze zibon gas edde neki bodi aholor gas.<verse eid="GEN 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10"/>Ar baganot fani dibolla Edenottu ekkan hal niyolle; edde hiyanottu sairgan muk oiye. <verse eid="GEN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11"/>Foilaganor nam oilde Fišon; iyan oilde hiyan ziyan fura Havilah deš guriyore giye, heṛe zeṛe šuna fa za. <verse eid="GEN 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12"/>(Ar he dešor šuna bala, ar heṛe bedullium edde šoham fattor o ase.) <verse eid="GEN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13"/>Dusora halor nam oilde Gihon; iyan oilde hiyan ziyan fura Kuš deš guriyore giye. <verse eid="GEN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14"/>Tisera halor nam oilde Hiddekol; iyan oilde hiyan ziyan Asšur dešor fukottu di giye. Ar sair lombor hal oilde Efurat.<verse eid="GEN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15"/>Bade <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye manušware loi Eden baganot saš goribolla edde hiyanor dehafuna goribolla heṛe raikke. <verse eid="GEN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye manušware endilla hokum diye, "Tui ei baganor hár gasor gula issa mozin hái faribi; <verse eid="GEN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17"/>kintu neki bodi ahol gasottu no há foribo, kiyollahoile ze din tui hibattu háibi, he din tui moribi moribi."<verse eid="GEN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18"/>Bade <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye hodde, "Manušwalla ekela takonan iyan bala no, ãi hitalla hitar laikka ekzon modot goroya zuri banaiyum."<verse eid="GEN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye meṛittu hár fahari zanuwar edde asmanor faik okkolore tiyar goijje; bade manušwaye hinore ki ki name ḍake, hiyan saibolla hin okkolore hibar hãse ainne, henot manušwaye ze zandar zanuwarore ze name ḍaikke, hibar he nam oiye. <verse eid="GEN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20"/>Manušwaye hár górot falede zanuwar edde asmanor hár faik okkol edde fahari zanuwar okkolor nam raikke.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:20">Kintu he manušwalla hibar laikka ekzon modot goroya zuri fa no za. <verse eid="GEN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye manušwar uwore bári gum forefan goijje; toi hiba gumot maze Allaye hibar šaiṭṭanar ãḍḍittu ekkan loiye edde hiyanot bodole gusto loi borai diye. <verse eid="GEN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22"/><char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye manušwattu kuli loilde aḍḍigan loi ek mayafuwa goijje, edde hibare manušwar hãse ainne.<verse eid="GEN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23"/>Hetunot manušwaye hodde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">"Ebar oiye! Iba ãr aḍḍir aḍḍi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 2:23">ãr gustor gusto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">hibare 'mayafuwa' ḍaka oibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 2:23">kiyollahoile ibare manušwar butottu lowa oiye."<verse eid="GEN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24"/>Hetolla manuše hitar bab mare erizagoi edde hitar bou loi ek o, ar hitara duizon ek ga o.<verse eid="GEN 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25"/>Hẽtte manušwa edde hibar bou hitara dunizon lenḍa aššil, ar hiyanot hitarattu hono šorom nu aššil.<verse eid="GEN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Manušor omainnota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye banaiyede zobinor hár fahari zandar zanuwar okkolottuwaro beši salak aššilde oilde haf, toi hite mayafuwaware hodde, "Allaye ki hãsa hoiye, 'Tũwara baganor hono gasor gula no háiyo'?"<verse eid="GEN 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2"/>Mayafuwawaye hafware hodde, "Ãra baganor gas okkol beggunor gula hái fari; <verse eid="GEN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3"/>kintu baganor maze ze gas ase, hibar gular babute Allaye hoiye, 'Tũwara hibattu no háiyo, hin no suiyo, hen gorile moriba.'"<verse eid="GEN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4"/>Toi hafe mayafuwaware hodde, "No, tũwara no moriba, <verse eid="GEN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5"/>kiyollahoile Allaye zane ze, ze din tũwara hibattu háiba, hedin tũwarar suk kuli zaiboide edde neki bodi aholor giyan fai tũwara Allar ḍoil oizaibagoi."<verse eid="GEN 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6"/>Toi mayafuwawaye dekedde, he gasor gulawa háite bala oibo, ar hiba suke saite o šundor, hin bade giyan faibolla hoi oile o hon sa. Toi hibaye ho uggwa gula fari loi háiye, ar fũwati aššilde hibar zamai, hibare o diye, hibaye o háiye. <verse eid="GEN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7"/>Henot hitara dunizonor suk kuli giyeoi, ar hitara ulongode hiyan buzi faijje; toi hitara ḍũir fata gãtiyore ga guijje.<verse eid="GEN 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8"/>Bade hazinnar ṭanḍa hawar ṭaimot <char style="nd">Mabude</char> bagonot gurafira goredde abaz hitara fuinne, toi manušwa edde hibar bou <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allar sarmottu baganor gas okkolor butore lukai taikke. <verse eid="GEN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9"/>Kintu <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye manušware ḍaki hodde, "Tui hoṛe?"<verse eid="GEN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10"/>Manušwaye hodde, "Ãi baganot tũwar abas fuinni, edde ãi ḍoraiyi; kiyollahoile ãi ulongo, ar ãi lukaiyi."<verse eid="GEN 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye hodde, "Tui ze ulongo iyan tore hone hoiye? Ze gasottu no háibolla mana goijjilam, tui ki hibattu gula háiyos?"<verse eid="GEN 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12"/>Henot manušwaye hodde, "Ze mayafuware tũi eṛe ãr fũwati diyo, hibaye ãre gasottu diye, ar ãi háiyi."<verse eid="GEN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye he mayafuware hodde, "Tui in ki goijjos?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Mayafuwawaye hodde, "Hafe ãre dúha diye, edde ãi háiyi."<verse eid="GEN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14"/>Bade <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye hafore hodde, "Tui ei ham goijjosde hetolla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:14">"Hár górowa zanuwar, edde fahari zandar zanuwar okkolor butore</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:14">bodduwa tore!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:14">feṭ loi tor sola fira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:14">ar háibi tui dúil</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:14">tor zibonor hár din okkolot.<verse eid="GEN 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15"/>Ãi tui edde mayafuwar maze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:15">tor bonšo edde hibar bongšor maze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:15">dušmonai golai diyum;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:15">hite tor mata fiši dibo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:15">ar tui hitar formurit kuṭ maribi."<verse eid="GEN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16"/>Hibaye mayafuwaware hodde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:16">"Ãi tui hamilor ṭaimot mosibot baraidiyum.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:16">tui beši zontrona loi fuwa biyaibi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:16">Ar tor zamair uzu tottu issa oibo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:16">Ar hite tor uwore šašon solaibo."<verse eid="GEN 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17"/>Ar hibaye manušware hodde, "Tui tor bouwor hota doijjos, edde ze gasor babute ãi tore hokum dilam, 'Tui hibattu no háis,' hibattu gula háiyos,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:17">"Tor zoriya zobinore bodduwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:17">beši duk hošto gori, hiyanottu há foribo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:17">tor zibonor hár din okkolot.<verse eid="GEN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18"/>ar hiyane keṛa edde agasa okkol tolla fuṛaibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:18">ar maṛot zin baribo hin tui háibi.<verse eid="GEN 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19"/>mukottu gam zóraiyore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">haiddo háibi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">meṛit firi nu aiyos foijjonto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">tore to hentu lowa oiye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:19">Kiyollahoile tui oilde dúil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">ar dúilot tui firizaibi."<verse eid="GEN 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20"/>Bade manušwaye hibar bouwor nam diye Hawa, kiyollahoile hiba hár zinda okkolor ma oiye.<verse eid="GEN 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21"/>
    <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye Adom edde hibar bouwolla samrar hor banaiye edde hitarare findai diye. <verse eid="GEN 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22"/>Tarfore <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye hodde, "So, neki bodi aholor giyan fai manuš ãrar ekzonor ḍoil oiye, bala edde horaf zaner. Ebar hite zene hat barai diyore zibon gasor gula háiyore azibon basi tai no fare." <verse eid="GEN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye manušware zentu lowa oil, Eden baganottu he meṛit saš goribolla niyolai diye. <verse eid="GEN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24"/>Endilla gori hibaye manušware hentu niyolai diye, edde zibon gasor heṛe zaibar fõtot fahara dibolla Eden baganor fuk ḍakottu Karubi firista okkolore raikke, ar he fũwati heṛe ekkan zolonto toluwar raikke ziyan azibon guri guri taikke.<verse eid="GEN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Habil edde Kabil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1"/>Adome hibar bou Hawa loi mille, toi hiba hamil oiye edde Kabilore zormo diye. Hibaye hodde, "<char style="nd">Mabudor</char> modote ãi ekzon manuš zormo di faijji." <verse eid="GEN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2"/>Tarfore hibaye Kabilor bái Habilore zormo diye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:2">Habil sool soroya, ar Kabil zobin saš goroya oiye. <verse eid="GEN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3"/>Bade ek šome Kabile <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> hãse hodun zobinor fošol aniyore kurbani goijje. <verse eid="GEN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4"/>Ar Habile o hitar nizor zanuwaror zákottu hougguwa foila zormor soolor sore ani hinor sorofwala gustore loi <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> hãse kurbani goijje. <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Habilore edde hitar kurbanire goisse, <verse eid="GEN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5"/>kintu Kabil edde hitar kurbanire no gose. Henot Kabil kub beši gušša oiye ar hite nak muk hala gori roiye.<verse eid="GEN 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye Kabilore hodde, "Tui gušša kiyolla oiyos, ar nak muk kiyolla hala goijjos? <verse eid="GEN 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7"/>Tui o soiyigan goitti boli torgan o gosa no oito ne? Ar zodi soiyigan no goros, henoile to gunaye tore faibolla dorozat ai boi roiye, kintu tottu hiyanor uwore šašon sola foribo."<verse eid="GEN 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8"/>Tarfore ekdin Kabile Habilore hodde, "Aio, ãra bilot zai." Bade hitara bilot aššilde šomot, Kabile Habilore hamela goijje edde mari felaiye.<verse eid="GEN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9"/>Hetunot <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Kabilore hodde, "Tor bái Habil hoṛe?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Kabile hodde, "Ãi hoi no fari, ãi ki ãr bái soroya ne hono?"<verse eid="GEN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10"/>
    <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hodde, "Sa, tui in ki goijjios! Tor báiyor lou zobinottu tai ãr hãse hander. <verse eid="GEN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11"/>Tor uwore gozob foijje. Tor báiyor lou tor hatottu ze zobine suišše he zobinor bodduwa ehon tor uwore foijje. <verse eid="GEN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12"/>Tui zẽtte alsaš goribi hẽtte hine tore heto fól no dibo. Tui duniyait ziransara edde musafer oibi."<verse eid="GEN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13"/>Toi Kabile <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allare hodde, "Ei šaza ãlla bordašor bare oibo. <verse eid="GEN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14"/>So, aijja tũi ãre enttu lorai dila, ziyanor zoriya ãi tũwar sukor arguwale oi zaiyumboi. Ãi zẽtte ziransara musafer oi duniyait gúriyum hẽtte zar sarme foriyum hite ãre kun gori faribo."<verse eid="GEN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15"/>Kintu <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Kabilore hodde, "Etolla tore ze maribo, hitar uwore hãt gun daiya lowa oibo." Ar <char style="nd">Mabude</char> ekkan nišana diye, toi zene ze honokiye hitare faile no mare. <verse eid="GEN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16"/>Bade Kabile <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> sarmottu zaigoi Eden baganor fuk ḍakottu Nod dešot taka šuru goijje.<verse eid="GEN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kabilor bongšo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17"/>Bade Kabile hitar bouwor hãse giye, toi hiba hamil oiye edde Honnukore zormo diye. Bade Kabile ekkan šohor bainde edde hitar futor nam mozin hiyanor nam Honnuk raikke. <verse eid="GEN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18"/>Honnuke fut Iradore faiye, ar Irad Mehuyaelor baf oiye, Mehuyael Metúšayaelor baf oiye, ar Metúšayael Lemekor baf oiye.<verse eid="GEN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19"/>Lemeke dui bou loiye, ekzonor nam Adah, oinno ar ekzonor nam Šilla. <verse eid="GEN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20"/>Adaye Jabalore biyaiye. Hite aššilde ṭambu mari zanuwar faloya okkolor bongšor foila manuš. <verse eid="GEN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21"/>Hitar báiyor nam oilde Jubal. Hite hanai edde baši bazoya bongšor foila manuš. <verse eid="GEN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22"/>Ar Šillar feṛot Tubal-Kabil zormo oiye. Hite fitol edde lowar bout ḍoilla zontro okkol banaito. Tubal Kabilor boinor nam oilde Naamah.<verse eid="GEN 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23"/>Toi Lemeke hitar bouwainde hodde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">"Oh Adah edde Šilla, tũwara ãr hota funo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">Lemekor bouwain, ãr hota funo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Ãre ze ek manuše zohom diye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">ze zuwane ãr gat hat tuille, hitare ãi marifelaiyi.<verse eid="GEN 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24"/>Zodi Kabilor kunor bodola hãtgun o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:24">toile Lemekolla hoitor hãtgun."<verse eid="GEN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25"/>Bade adome abar hibar bouwor hãse giye, ar hibaye ar ek futore zormo diye edde hitar nam raikke Set, "kiyollahoile Kabile Habilore kun goijje boli Allaye hitar zagat ãre ar ugguwa fuwa diye." <verse eid="GEN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26"/>Setottu o ek fut zormo oiye, ar hite hitar nam raikke Enuš.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:26">Hẽtte manuš okkole <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allar nam ḍaka šuru goijje.<verse eid="GEN 4:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Adomor bongšo nama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1"/>Adomor bongšo nama oilde endilla.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 5:1"/>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 5:1">Allaye manušware banailde šomot, hibaye hibare nizor ḍoilla gori sirišti goijje. <verse eid="GEN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2"/>Maya edde morod goriyore hibaye hitarare širišti goijje, ar sirišti gora oiyede hedin hibaye hitarare duwa goijje edde "Adom" nam diye.<verse eid="GEN 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3"/>Bade Adom ekšo tiriš bosor boyošot, hibar nizor ḍoilla edde hibar nizor súrotor ḍoilla ek fut oiye, ar hibar nam raikke Set. <verse eid="GEN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4"/>Set zormo oi bade, adom aro aštošot bosor duniyait basi aššil edde aro bout futziyain okkol oil. <verse eid="GEN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5"/>Adom muṭ nošo tiriš bosor baisse, toi bade hibar moron oiye.<verse eid="GEN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6"/>Set ekšo fãs bosor boyošot, hiba Enušor baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7"/>Enuš zormo oi bade, Set aro aštošo hãt bosor basi aššil edde aro futziyain okkol oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8"/>Set muṭ nošo baro bosor baisse, toi bade hibar moron oiye.<verse eid="GEN 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9"/>Enuš nobboi bosor boyošot, hiba Kenanor baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10"/>Kenan zormo oi bade, Enuš aro aštošo fundro bosor basi aššil edde aro futziyain okkol oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11"/>Beggun mili nošo fãs bosor baisse, toi bade hibar moron oiye.<verse eid="GEN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12"/>Kenane hoittor bosor boyošot, hiba Mahalalelor baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13"/>Mahalalel zormo oi bade, Kenan aro aštošo sališ bosor basi aššil edde aro futziyain okkol oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14"/>Beggun mili nošo doš bosor baisse, toi bade hibar moron oiye.<verse eid="GEN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15"/>Mahalalel haiṭ fãs bosor boyošot, hiba Yaredor baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16"/>Yared zomo oi bade, Mahalalel aro aštošo tiriš bosor basi aššil edde aro futziyain okkol oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17"/>Beggun mili Mahalalel aštošo nobboi fãs bosor baisse, toi bade hibar moron oiye.<verse eid="GEN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18"/>Yared ekšo haiṭ dui bosor boyošot, hibaye Honnukor baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19"/>Honnuk zormo oi bade, Yared aro ašṭo šot bosor basi aššil edde aro futziyain okkol oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20"/>Beggune mili Yared nošo haiṭ dui bosor baisse, toi bade hibar moron oiye.<verse eid="GEN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21"/>Honnuk haiṭ fãs bosor boyošot, hibaye Metúšalar baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22"/>Metúšalah zormo oi bade, Honnuk Allah loi tin šot bosor aza goijje edde aro futziyain okkol oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23"/>Beggun mili Honnukor boyoš tinšo haiṭ fãs bosor oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24"/>Honnuk Allah loi solito; tarfore hiba ar no takil, kiyollahoile Allaye hibare hibar hãse loigiyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25"/>Metúšalah ekšo aši hãt bosor boyošot, hibaye Lemekor baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26"/>Lemek zormo oi bade, Metúšalah aro hãtšo aši dui bosor basi aššil edde aro futziyain okkol oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27"/>Beggun mili Metúšalah nošo haiṭ no bosor baisse, toi bade hibar moron oiye.<verse eid="GEN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28"/>Lemek ekšo aši dui bosor boyošot, hibattu ek fut oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29"/>Ar hibaye hibar nam raikke Nuh, edde hodde, "<char style="nd">Mabude</char> bodduwa goijjede he meṛit ãrar ham edde hator koṭin haṛonit ite ãrare šantona dibo." <verse eid="GEN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30"/>Nuh zormo oi bade, Lemeke aro fãs šo nobboi fãs bosor basi aššil edde aro bout futziyain okkol oiye. <verse eid="GEN 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31"/>Beggune Lemek hãt šo hoittor hãt bosor baisse, toi bade hibar moron oiye.<verse eid="GEN 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32"/>Tarfore Nuh fãs šot bosor oi bade, hibaye Šem, Ham, edde Yafetor baf oiye.<verse eid="GEN 5:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Duniyait naformani bari giyegoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1"/>Ei bafe zehon duniyait manušor šoinkka beši owa šuru goijje edde bout mayafuwain okkol zormo oiye, <verse eid="GEN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2"/>toi Allar futain okkole mainšor ziyain okkolore šundor dekiyore, zattu zare issa, hite hibare biya goijje. <verse eid="GEN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3"/>Henot Mabude hodde, "Ãr Ruh insanor butore hamiša taki no zaibogoi, kiyollahoile hitara lou edde gustor; hitarar aiyu oibo ekšo kuri bosor."<verse eid="GEN 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4"/>Hẽtte, edde hiyar bade o duniyait folowan okkol aššil, Allar futain okkole mainšor ziyain okkol loi zehon mille, hitarattu fuwain okkol oiye, hitara zara aššil he furan hailla nam gora beši ḍõr ḍõr bir okkol.<verse eid="GEN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5"/>
    <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye sadde, duniyait manušor naformani beši ḍõr, edde hitarar dilor hár sinta bafona hár šomot bolke horafir uzu. <verse eid="GEN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6"/>Hetolla, <char style="nd">Mabude</char> duniyait manuš banaiyede hiyan loi bezar oiye, edde dile duk faiye. <verse eid="GEN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hodde, "Ãi ze manuš zati sirišti goijji, hinore duniyaittu fũsi felaiyum; manušottu loti zandar zanuwar foijjonto, buke aṛede zandar edde asmanor tole faik okkolore o; kiyollahoile ãi hitarare sirišti goriyore ãr dile duk far." <verse eid="GEN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8"/>Kintu Nuhuye Allar torfottu doya faiye.<verse eid="GEN 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9"/>In oilde Nuhur bongšor kahani. Nuh ekzon forhesgar manuš aššil. He šomot manuš okkolor butore hiba aššilde ekzon haṭi manuš. Nuhuttu Allar loi aza zugazug aššil. <verse eid="GEN 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10"/>Nuhuttu Šem, Ham edde Yafet name tin fut aššil. <verse eid="GEN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11"/>Hẽtte Allar nozorot duniyaigan horaf oigiyegoi edde zai-zulume boriuiṭṭe. <verse eid="GEN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12"/>Allaye duniyair mikka saiye, ar so, hiyan horaf oigiyegoi, haron duniyair hár mainše hitarar kufõt giyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13"/>Toi Allaye Nuhure hodde, "Hár zandaror šeš hal ãr sarme aišše, kiyollahoile hitarar duwara duniyai zulume boriuiṭṭe; ar sa, ãi duniyair fũwati hitarare dongšo gorifelaiyum. <verse eid="GEN 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14"/>Tui gupér gas diyore ekkan zahaz tiyar gor; hiyanor butore kamera okkol goribi, edde hiyanor butore baire kuldar ḍoli dibi. <verse eid="GEN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15"/>Endilla gori hiyan tiyar gora foribo: Zahazsan lamba tin šot hat, fatari šoṛa fõnzaš hat, ar hiyan usol oibo tiriš hat. <verse eid="GEN 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16"/>Ar zahazor sanir ek hat tolottu zanala tiyar goribi edde zahazor ḍakottu doroza rakibi; hiyanor foila, dusora, edde tisera ṭala gori tiyar gora foribo. <verse eid="GEN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17"/>Ar sa, asmanor tole zeto ḍoilla zandar niyaš foran loi basi ase, hitara beggun dongšo oibolla ãi duniyait ek fanir tuwan aniyum, Duniyair hár zandar mori zaiboi. <verse eid="GEN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18"/>Kintu tor loi ãi ãr wadar sukti buwaiyum. Tui zai zahazot gólibi. Ar tor fũwati tor futain okkol edde tor bou edde tor futaindor bouwain okkol takibo. <verse eid="GEN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19"/>Ar lou gustowala zandar miyala modda zura zura tor fũwati zinda takibolla zahazot loibi. <verse eid="GEN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20"/>Hár zator faik okkolottu, hár zator zandar zanuwar okkolottu edde hár zator buke aṛede zandar okkolottu foran basaibolla ek ek zura tor hãse aibo. <verse eid="GEN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21"/>Tui háibar hár ḍoilla ziniš okkol loi dola gori rakibi. Hin oibode tor edde hitarar haiddo."<verse eid="GEN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22"/>Nuhuye hendilla goijje, Allaye hokum dilde mozin hibaye hár kissu goijje.<verse eid="GEN 6:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Bor tuwan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Nuhure hodde, "Tui edde tor fura gór ṭiya beggune zahazot golo, kiyollahoile ei halor manuš okkolor butore ãr sarme šude tore forhesgar lot faiyi. <verse eid="GEN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2"/>Tottu fotti zator paki zanuwar okkolottu, zur milai, hãt zura gori, ar fotti zator napaki zanuwar okkolottu, zur milai, ek zura gori lowa foribo. <verse eid="GEN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3"/>Ar asmanor faik okkolottu o hendilla gori, zur milai, hãt zura gori tor fũwati lowa foribo. Duniyait hitarar bongšo basai rakibolla hendilla goribi. <verse eid="GEN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4"/>Kiyollahoile ar hãt din bade ãi duniyait sališ din sališ rait zór diyat rakium. Henot ãr sirištir hár zandar okkolore duniyaittu fũsi felaiyum."<verse eid="GEN 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Nuhure hokum dilde mozin hibaye hár kissu goijje.<verse eid="GEN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6"/>Duniyait fanir tuwan šuru oilde šomot Nuhur boyoš so šot bosor. <verse eid="GEN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7"/>Fanir bottuwanottu uddar faibolla Nuhuye hibar bou, futain ar futaindor bouwain okkol loi zahazot góille. <verse eid="GEN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8"/>Ar paki zanuwar okkolottu, napaki zanuwar okkolottu, faik okkolottu edde meṛit buke aṛede hár kissu, <verse eid="GEN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9"/>zur zur Nuhur hãse aiyore zahazot góille, Allaye Nuhure hokum dilde mozin. <verse eid="GEN 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10"/>Ar he hãt din farai zaigoi bade duniyait tuwanor fani aišše.<verse eid="GEN 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11"/>Nuhur boyoš sošot bosor furaiyede he bosoror dui maš hõtoro dinor din, atikka meṛir tolottu beša beši fani uṛa šuru goijje, ar zóror fani zen asmanot faṛon doijje. <verse eid="GEN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12"/>Sališ din sališ rait dori duniyair uwore zór forat roiye.<verse eid="GEN 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13"/>He din Nuh, Šem, Ham, Yafet name Nuhur futain okkol, edde hitarar fũwati Nuhur bou edde futor bouwain okkol zahazot góille. <verse eid="GEN 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14"/>Ar hitarar fũwati fotti zator ek ek zura gori fahari edde górwali zanuwar edde buke aṛede zandar, ar hár ḍoilla faik okkol o aššil. <verse eid="GEN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15"/>Zibon niyaš loi basi roiyede hár zandar okkol zura zura Nuhur hãse zai zahazot goillil. <verse eid="GEN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16"/>Hár zanuwar okkol, zandar ziniš okkol miyala edde morod mili zahazot uiṭṭe, ode ode Allaye Nuhure hokum dilde mozin. Toi <char style="nd">Mabude</char> zahazor dorozagan bon gori diye.<verse eid="GEN 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17"/>Bade sališ din mula duniyait maze tuwanor fani bariuṛat roiye. Tuwanor fani barizaiyore zahazsan meṛir uwottu fanit baši uiṭṭe. <verse eid="GEN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18"/>Toi fani uiṭṭe edde duniyait beša beši fani bari giyegoi ar zahazsan fanir uwore baša šuru goijje. <verse eid="GEN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19"/>Duiniyair uwore tuwanor fani eto beši uiṭṭe, hinor duwara asmanor nisor ḍõr ḍõr fahar okkolore beggunore ḍufaifelaiye. <verse eid="GEN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20"/>Fahar okkol ḍufi bade o fani aro fundro hat uworor mikka uiṭṭe. <verse eid="GEN 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21"/>Henor zoriya duniyait solafira gorede hár zandar, faik, górot falede edde fahari zanuwar okkol, duniyait zãk bandi sorede šoṛo zandar okkol, ar hár manuš okkol mori giyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22"/>Fuwana zobinor uwore zibon niyaš loi basi aššilde zandar okkol beggun mori giyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23"/>Endilla gori hibaye zobinor bukor hár zandar fũsifelaiye, manuš, zanuwar, buke aṛede zandar okkol edde asmanor faik duniyaittu saf oigiyegoi. Šude Nuh edde hibare fũwati zara zahazot aššil hitara basi roiye.<verse eid="GEN 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24"/>Tuwanor faniye duniyai ek šo fõnzaš din ḍufi aššil.<verse eid="GEN 7:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1"/>Kintu Allaye Nuh edde hibar fũwati zahazot aššilde hár zandar okkolore monot raikke, Allaye duniyait bataš ba baiye, henot fani homa šuru goijje. <verse eid="GEN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2"/>Ar meṛir tolottu fani uṛa edde asmanor faṛa okkol bondo oi giyegoi, asmanottu zór diya o tamigilgoi. <verse eid="GEN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3"/>Ar fani meṛir uwottu lami zat taikke; ekšo fõnzaš din šeše fani bout homigiyegoi, <verse eid="GEN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4"/>edde hãt maš hõtoro dinor din zahassan Ararot faharor uwore bazigiyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5"/>Bade doš maš foijjonto fani homat roiye; he doš mašor foila dinot faharor tuli okkol dehagiye.<verse eid="GEN 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6"/>Ar sališ din faraizaigoi bade, Nuhuye zahazot ze zanala goijjil, hiyan hibaye kuille, <verse eid="GEN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7"/>edde uggwa hawa baire defeṛaiye, henot hiba meṛir uwottu fani fuwai no zagoi foijjonto aiya zat gorat roiye. <verse eid="GEN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8"/>Bade meṛir uwottu fani homigiyegoi ne, hiyan saibolla, hibaye uggwa hoitor baire defeṛaiye. <verse eid="GEN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9"/>Kintu hẽtte o šara duniyair uwore fani aššil boli hoitorguwaye hono mikka ṭeng rakibar zaga no fa, hetolla hibar hãse zahazot uwafes firi aišše. Ar hibaye hat niyolaidiyore hibare doijje edde zahazor butore nizor hãse raikke. <verse eid="GEN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10"/>Toi hibaye aro hãt din entezar goijje, bade he hoitorguware zahazottu abar baire defeṛaiye. <verse eid="GEN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11"/>Hazinna hoitorguwa hibar hãse firi aišše; ar so, hibar ṭuṛot ugguwa tottoza zaitun fata aššil; iyanot Nuhuye buzi faijje, ze meṛir uwottu fani homi giyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12"/>Toi hibaye aro hãt din entezar goijje, he hoitorguware abar baire defeṛaiye, edde hiba hibar hãse ar uwafes firi nu aiye.<verse eid="GEN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13"/>Nuhor boyoš sošo ek bosoror foila mašor foila dinor din meṛir uwottu fani fuwaigiyegoi; Toi Nuhuye zahazor sáni kulifelaiye edde baire saiye, ar so, meṛir tola fuwaigiyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14"/>Bade dusora mašor ek kuri hãt dinor din meṛi fuwaigiyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15"/>Toi Allaye Nuhure hodde, <verse eid="GEN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16"/>"Tui tor bou ar tor futain edde hitarar bouwain okkolore loi zahazottu niyoli zagoi. <verse eid="GEN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17"/>Ar tor fũwati asede hár faik, zanuwar edde buke aṛede zandar, zeto zandar zanuwar ase, hin beggunore tor fũwati niyolai loiai, hitara duniyaire bori tulok, edde fólwala ok edde beši ok."<verse eid="GEN 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18"/>Toi Nuhuye hibar bou ar futain edde hitarar bouwain okkol beggunore loi zahazottu niyoli aišše. <verse eid="GEN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19"/>Ar zar zar zat mozin hár fahari zanuwar edde hár gorwali zanuwar, hár faik, ar meṛir uwore buke solafira gorede hár kissu, zahazottu niyoli aišše.<verse eid="GEN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20"/>Tarfore Nuhuye <char style="nd">Mabudolla</char> ekkan kurbangah tiyar goijje edde fotti zator paki zanuwar edde faik okkolottu hougguwa loi hiyanor uwore fura-kurbani okkol kurbani goijje. <verse eid="GEN 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21"/><char style="nd">Mabud</char> he kurbanir kušbot kuši oiye edde mone mone hodde: "Manušolla ãi ar hono din meṛire bodduwa no diyum, zodi o manušor dil zuwan hale loti horaf. Ar zendilla ãi ehon goijji, hendilla ãi ar hár zandarore dongšo no goriyum.<verse eid="GEN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22"/>"Zetodin duniyai takibo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">niyom mozin biz owa edde fošol haṛa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">ṭanḍa edde gorom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">šit hal edde gorom hal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">din edde rait,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">owa honodin no tamibo."<verse eid="GEN 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Nuh loi Allar wadar sukti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1"/>Allaye Nuh edde hibar futaindore duwa goriyore hodde, "Fólwala o, edde beši o edde duniyai furon goro. <verse eid="GEN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2"/>Duniyair hár zandar zanuwar okkol, edde asmanor hár faik okkol, ar zobinot buke aṛede zandar okkol, ar doriyar hár mas okkol tũwarar ḍor edde bóiye sola fira goribo; ar hin okkolore tũwarar hatot diya oiye. <verse eid="GEN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3"/>Hár kissu ziyãta edde lorasora gorede zanuwar okkol tũwaralla haiddo oibo. Ãi age zendilla tũwarare hak šobzi haiddo hisabe diyilam hendilla ehon in okkol o dilam.<verse eid="GEN 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4"/>"Kintu foranwala gusto mani lou šoho gusto no há foribo. <verse eid="GEN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5"/>Honokiye zodi tũwarare kun gore toile ãi hameka tũwarar louwor bodole hitar lou mani hitar foranor dabi goriyum. Hiba fokšu ok ba manuš ok. Ar manušor foran ze manuše lo, hitar foran o lowa oibo, iyan ãr dabi.<verse eid="GEN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6"/>"Manušor lou ze bair gore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:6">manuše o hitar lou bair goribo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:6">kiyollahoile Allaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:6">manušore nizor súrot loi banaiye.<verse eid="GEN 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7"/>Ar tũwara fólwala o, edde beši o, duniyair sairo mikka šiṛi foro edde heṛe o aro beši o."<verse eid="GEN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8"/>Bade Allaye Nuh edde hibar futaindore hodde: <verse eid="GEN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9"/>"So, tũwara edde tũwarar bongšo okkol loi edde tũwarar fũwati asede hár zandar zanuwar okkol, <verse eid="GEN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10"/>faik fokšu, górwali zanuwar edde fahari zanuwar, duniyait zeto ḍoilla zandar zanuwar okkol zahazottu niyoli aišše, hitara loi ãi ãr wadar sukti buwaiyum. <verse eid="GEN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11"/>Ãi tũwarar loi ãr wadar sukti buwair: Ar honodin endilla no oibo; fanir bottuwanor duwara hár foranwala zandar okkolore dongšo gora no oibo. Ar duniyaire dongšo gorifelaibolla ar hono din fanir bottuwan no oibo."<verse eid="GEN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12"/>Allaye aro hodde, "Tũwara edde tũwarar fũwati asede hár zandar zanuwar okkol edde ãr maze ze wadar sukti buwair, hiyanor sinno oilde iyan, ziyan bongšor bade bongšo dori solat takibo, <verse eid="GEN 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13"/>he bebostar sinno hisabe miyulat, ãi ãr donu dehaiyum. Hiyan oibo duniyai loi, ãr he wadar suktir sinno. <verse eid="GEN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14"/>Ãi zẽtte duniyair uwore miyula dola goriyum, hẽtte donugan miyulat deha dibo, <verse eid="GEN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15"/>henot tũwara edde hár zandar zanuwar loi, ãr ei wadar hota ãi monot goriyum. Ar hono din hár zandar dongšo oibolla fanir tuwan no oibo. <verse eid="GEN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16"/>Miyulat zehon donugan deha zaibo, henot ãi hiyanor mikka saiyum, henot duniyair hár zandar okkol loi, ãr azibonor wadare monot goriyum."<verse eid="GEN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17"/>Tarfore Allaye Nuhure hodde, "Duniyait hár zandar okkol loi ãi buwaiyide wadar suktir sinno oilde iyan."<verse eid="GEN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhur futain okkol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18"/>Nuhur ze futain okkol zahazottu niyoli aišše, hitara oilde Šem, Ham edde Yafet. (Ham aššilde Kenanor baf.) <verse eid="GEN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19"/>Itara oilde Nuhur futain okkol; itarar bongšo šara duniyai sorai gilgoi.<verse eid="GEN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20"/>Bade Nuhuye al saš gora šuru goijje edde ekkan ãngur keti goijje. <verse eid="GEN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21"/>Hibaye ekdin šoraf fiyore matal oiye edde nizor ṭambur butore lenḍa oi fori roiye. <verse eid="GEN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22"/>Kenanor baf Hame hitar bafor ei abosta deikke edde baire zai hitar dui báiyore hin zanaiye. <verse eid="GEN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23"/>Kintu Šem edde Yafete ekkan hor handot felai loiyore fissa aṛi zaiyore hitarar bafor lenḍa gare guridiye. Hitarar muk fissa firaiya aššilde hetolla hitara bafor lenḍa gare no deke.<verse eid="GEN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24"/>Bade Nuh šorafor gúmottu uṛiyore hibar šoṛo fute hiba loi goijjede he befare zani faijje, <verse eid="GEN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25"/>hibaye hodde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">"Kenanore bodduwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:25">Hite hitar báiyaindor hãse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:25">gulamor gulam ok!"<verse eid="GEN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26"/>Hibaye aro hodde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:26">"Šemor Allah <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> tarif ok!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:26">Kenan Šemor gulam ok!<verse eid="GEN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27"/>Allaye gorok, Yafetor eleha barok;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">Hite Šemor ṭambur tole takok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">Ar Kenan hitar gulam bonok."<verse eid="GEN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28"/>Bor tuwan bade Nuhuye aro tin šo fõnzaš bosor baisse. <verse eid="GEN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29"/>Beggun mili Nuh šaro no šot bosor baisse, toi bade hibar moron oiye.<verse eid="GEN 9:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Nuhur futaindor bongšonama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1"/>In oilde Nuhur futain, Šem, Ham edde Yafetor bongšor kahani, bor tuwan bade hitara zarattu futain okkol oil.<verse eid="GEN 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2"/>Yafetor futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:2">Gumer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Mešek edde Tiraš.<verse eid="GEN 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3"/>Gumeror futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:3">Aškenaz, Ripát edde Togarmah.<verse eid="GEN 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4"/>Javanor futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:4">Elišah, Toršiš, Kittim edde Dodanim. <verse eid="GEN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5"/>(doriyar ḍiyat takoya ei bongšo okkolottu zar zar zuban, gór edde zati okkol mozin bout deš okkolot šiṛi giyegoi.)<verse eid="GEN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="s2">Hamor bongšor nam okkol</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6"/>Hamor futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:6">Kuš, Mišor, Puṭ edde Kenan.<verse eid="GEN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7"/>Kušor futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:7">Seba, Havilah, Sabta, Raamah edde Sabteka.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 10:7">Raamar futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:7">Seba edde Dedan.<verse eid="GEN 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8"/>Kuš Nimrudor baf oiye, ze duniyait foila folowan oil. <verse eid="GEN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9"/>Hite aššilde <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> sarme ek folowan šiyari; hetolla iyan endilla ho, "Nimrudor ḍoil <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> sarme ekzon folowan šiyari" <verse eid="GEN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10"/>Sinearor Babel, Erek, Akkad edde Kalneh, ei zaga okkol oilde foila hitar raijjor ongšo. <verse eid="GEN 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11"/>He dešottu hite Asšurot zaiyore Nineveh, Rehobot-Ir, Kalah <verse eid="GEN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12"/>edde Resen bainde, ziyan Nineveh edde Kalar maza mazi, ziyan oilde ekkan ḍõr šohor.<verse eid="GEN 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13"/>Mišoror bafe</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:13">Ludiyo, Anamiyo, Lehabiyo, Noftuhiyo, <verse eid="GEN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14"/>Patrušiyo, Kasluhiyo, (hitara zarattu Filistini okkol niyoli aišše.) edde Kaptíyo okkol,<verse eid="GEN 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15"/>Kenan oiyede</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 10:15">hibar foila fut Sidonor baf, tarfore Hetor, <verse eid="GEN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16"/>Zebušiyo, Amorittiyo, edde Girgašiyo, <verse eid="GEN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17"/>Hibbiyo, Arkiyo, edde Siniyo, <verse eid="GEN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18"/>Arvadiyo, Zemariyo, edde Hamatiyo.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:18">Aro bade zaiyore Kenaniyo zatir bongšo okkol sorai foijjil. <verse eid="GEN 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19"/>Sidon šohorottu Gerar gẽši giyede rastat Gaza foijjonto edde Gaza šohorottu Súdum, Gumarrah, Admah edde Zeboyim zaibar fõt Laša foijjonto Kenaniyo okkolor dešor šima aššil.<verse eid="GEN 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20"/>Itara oilde nizor nizor gušti, baša edde zati mozin Hamor bongšor manuš.<verse eid="GEN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s2">Šemor bongšonama</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21"/>Yafetor bor bái Šemottu o futziyain oiye. Šem aššilde Eberor futain okkolor fordada.<verse eid="GEN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22"/>Šemor futain oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:22">Elam, Asšur, Arpákšad, Lud edde Aram.<verse eid="GEN 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23"/>Aramor futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:23">Uz, Hul, Getér edde Maš.<verse eid="GEN 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24"/>Arpákšad Šelar baf oiye,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:24">Šelah Eberor baf oiye.<verse eid="GEN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25"/>Eberottu dui fut:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:25">Ekzonor nam aššil Feleg, kiyollahoile hitar ṭaimot duniyai bag oil; hitar báiyor nam aššil Joktan.<verse eid="GEN 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26"/>Joktan aššilde itarar baf</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:26">Almodad, Šelef, Hasarmaveth, Jerah, <verse eid="GEN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27"/>Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah, <verse eid="GEN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28"/>Obal, Abimael, Šeba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29"/>Ofir, Havilah edde Jobab. Itara beggun aššilde Joktanor futain okkol.<verse eid="GEN 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30"/>(Mešattu fuk mikka Sefar fahari eleha okkolot hitara bošobaš goitto.)<verse eid="GEN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31"/>Foribar, baša, deš edde zati hisabe itara oilde Šemor bongšor manuš.<verse eid="GEN 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32"/>Ar bongšo edde zati mozin itara oilde Nuhur futaindor bongšodor. Bor tuwan bade itararar butottu bout zati okkol duniyait sorai gilgoi.<verse eid="GEN 10:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Babelot usol gór</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1"/>Hẽttiyaror din okkolot šara duniyair mainše šude ek zubanot hota hoito edde hitarar baša aššilde o ek ḍoilla. <verse eid="GEN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2"/>Bade hitara fuk mikka agguwai zaite zaite Sinear dešot ekkan fuwainna zaga faiye edde heṛe hitara bošoti loiye.<verse eid="GEN 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3"/>Hitara ekzone ar ekzonore hodde, "Aiyo, ãra iṭ banai edde hinore furaidi doro gori!" Hen hoi hitara fattoror bodole iṭ edde mosollar bodole duna bebar goijje. <verse eid="GEN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4"/>Hitara aro hodde, "Aiyo, ãra ekkan ãralla šohor banai ar en ekkan usol gór banai ziyanor tuliye asman suibo, toi zene ãrar nam mošuhor o, edde ãrattu šara duniyait šiṛašitta oizagoi no fore!"<verse eid="GEN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5"/>Tarfore manuš okkole ze šohor edde usol gór bainde, hiyan saibolla <char style="nd">Mabud</char> nise laimme, <verse eid="GEN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6"/>edde hodde, "So, itara beggun ek zati edde ek zubanot hota hoiya okkol, itara ei ham gora šuru goijje, bade zaiyore itara ze kissu goribolla ereda loibo, ošombob kissu no oibo. <verse eid="GEN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7"/>Hetolla aiyo, ãra nise zai hitarar zubanore gulmal goridigoi toi zene hitara ekzone ar oinno zonor hota buzi no fare."<verse eid="GEN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8"/>Tarfore <char style="nd">Mabude</char> he zagattu hitarare duniyair hár mikka šiṛašitta gori diye. Henot hitarar šohor banaibar ham bondo oi giyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9"/>Etolla he zagar nam oiyede Babel, ziyanor mani gulmal, haron <char style="nd">Mabude</char> šomosto duniyair zubanot gulmal bazaidiye. <char style="nd">Mabude</char> manuš okkolore hentu duniyair hár mikka šiṛašitta gori diye.<verse eid="GEN 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Šemor bongšo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10"/>In oilde Šemor bongšo okkolor kahani.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 11:10"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 11:10">Tuwan zai dui bosor bade, Šemor boyoš ekšot bosor zẽtte oiye, hiba Arpákšador baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11"/>Ar Šem Arpákšador baf oi bade, hiba aro fãs šot bosor basi aššil edde aro bout futziyain okkol oiye.<verse eid="GEN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12"/>Arpákšad tiriš fãs bosor boyošot, hiba Šelar baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13"/>Šelar baf oi bade, Arpákšad aro sair šo tin bosor basi aššil edde aro bout futziyain okkol oiye.<verse eid="GEN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14"/>Šelah tiriš bosor boyošot, hiba Eberor baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15"/>Ar Eberor baf oi bade, Šelah aro sair šo tin bosor basi aššil edde aro bout futziyain okkol oiye.<verse eid="GEN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16"/>Eber tiriš sair bosor boyošot, hiba Felegor baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17"/>Ar Felegor baf oi bade, Eber aro sair šo tiriš bosor basi aššil edde aro bout futziyain okkol oiye.<verse eid="GEN 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18"/>Feleg tiriš bosor boyošot, hiba Reuror baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19"/>Reuror baf oi bade, Feleg dui šo no bosor basi aššil edde aro bout futziyain okkol oiye.<verse eid="GEN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20"/>Reu tiriš dui bosor boyošot, Serugor baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21"/>Serugor baf oi bade, Reu aro dui šo hãt bosor basi aššil edde aro bout futziyain okkol oiye.<verse eid="GEN 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22"/>Serug tiriš bosor boyošot, hiba Nahuror baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23"/>Nahuror baf oi bade, Serug aro dui šo bosor basi aššil edde aro bout futziyain okkol oiye.<verse eid="GEN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24"/>Nahur ek kuri no bosor boyošot, hiba Ṭerar baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25"/>Ṭerar baf oi bade, Nahur aro ekšo unnuš bosor basi aššil edde aro bout futziyain okkol oiye.<verse eid="GEN 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26"/>Ṭerah hoittor bosor boyošot, hiba Ibraim, Nahur edde Haranor baf oiye.<verse eid="GEN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ṭerar bongšo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27"/>In oilde Ṭerar bongšor kahani.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 11:27"/>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 11:27">Ṭerah aššilde Ibraim, Nahur edde Haranor baf. Ar Haran Lutor baf oiye. <verse eid="GEN 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28"/>Kintu Haran hibar baf Ṭerar sarme hibar zormostan, Kaldiyar Ur šohorot moron oiye. <verse eid="GEN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29"/>Ibraim edde Nahur dunizone biya goijjil; Ibraimor bouwor nam aššil Sarai, ar Nahuror bou aššilde Haranor zi Milka, ar Haran aššilde Milka edde Jiskar baf. <verse eid="GEN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30"/>Sarai bázá aššil, hibattu hono futziyain no o.<verse eid="GEN 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31"/>Ṭeraye hibar fut Ibraim edde hibar nati mani Haranor fut Lut edde hibar futor bou mani Ibraimor bou Saraire fũwati loiye edde itara beggune Kenan dešot zaibolla Kaldiyar Ur šohorottu ruwana diye. Ar hitara Harran foijjonto aiyore heṛe bošoti loiye.<verse eid="GEN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32"/>Ṭerah dui šo fãs bosor baisse, edde Harranot Ṭerar moron oiye.<verse eid="GEN 11:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Ibraimore ḍaker edde duwa gorer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Ibraimore hodde, "Tui tor nizor deš, tor egena gušti edde tor bafor gór sari, ãi ze dešot tore dehaiyum tui heṛe za.<verse eid="GEN 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2"/>"Ãi tore ek ḍõr zati goriyum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:2">edde ãi tore duwa goriyum;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 12:2">Ãi tor namore ḍõr goriyum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:2">edde tui oinno zonolla rahamot oibi.<verse eid="GEN 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3"/>Zara tore duwa goribo, ãi hitarare duwa goriyum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">ar zara tore bodduwa dibo, ãi hitarare bodduwa diyum.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 12:3">duniyair fotti zatiye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">tor duwara duwa faibo."<verse eid="GEN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hoiyede mozin Ibraime baisa diye, ar Lut o hibar fũwati giye. Harranottu niyoli zargoide šomot Ibraimor boyoš oilde hoittor fãs bosor. <verse eid="GEN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5"/>Ibraime hibar bou Saraire edde báiyor fut Lutore, ar hitara Harranot ze dón šombotti hamail, ze gulam okkol fail, hin beggun loiyore Kenan dešot zaibolla baisa diye, toi hitara Kenanot fõisse.<verse eid="GEN 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6"/>Ar Ibraime deš bai zaite Šekimot he Paki zaga Mure-elun gas foijjonto giye. Hẽtte Kenaniyo okkol he dešot aššil. <verse eid="GEN 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7"/>Tarfore <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Ibraimore deha diye edde hibare hodde, "Ei dešgan ãi tor bongšore diyum." Toi Ibraime hibare deha diyede he <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> mutallek heṛe ekkan kurbangah tiyar goijje.<verse eid="GEN 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8"/>Bade hibaye hentu Betelor fuke fahari elehat agguwai zaiyore fosimottu Betel ar fukottu Ai šohoror maza mazi ek zagat hibar ṭambu gãijje. Heṛe hibaye <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> mutallek ekkan kurbangah tiyar goijje edde <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> name ḍaikke.<verse eid="GEN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9"/>Tarfore Ibraime hentu baisa diyore doine Negevor mikka zat roiye.<verse eid="GEN 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mišorot Ibraimor baisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10"/>Bade dešot ek raṭ oiye, toi Ibraime lamat Mišorot forbaš goribolla baisa diye; kiyollahoile Kenan dešot koṭin raṭ oil. <verse eid="GEN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11"/>Ar Ibraim zehon Mišoror hãsa haši aišše, hibaye hibar bou Saraire hodde, "Sa, ãi zani, tui kub šundori. <verse eid="GEN 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12"/>Tore zẽtte Mišoriyo okkole dekibo, hitara hoibo, 'Iba itar bou.' Toi hitara tore zinda rakibo kintu ãre mari felaibo. <verse eid="GEN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13"/>Hetolla hitarare endilla hois ze, tui ãr boin, toi zene tor hatire hitara ãr loi bala bebohar gore, ar tor zoriya ãr foran basi zagoi."<verse eid="GEN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14"/>Ibraim zehon Mišorot góille Mišoriyo okkole deikke ze Sarai kub šundori. <verse eid="GEN 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15"/>Feruwanor ofisar okkole hibare dekiyore hitara Feruwanor hãse hibar tarif goijje; toi hibare raz moholot loi za oiye. <verse eid="GEN 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16"/>Ar hibar hatire hite Ibraim loi bala bebohar goijje, ar henot hibaye bout sool, goru, gada, gadi, uṭ edde gulam edde bandi okkol faiye.<verse eid="GEN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17"/>Kintu Ibraimor bou, Sarailla boli <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Feruwan edde hitar foribaror uwore koṭin bola okkol goṭaiye. <verse eid="GEN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18"/>Toi Feruwane Ibraimore ḍaki ainne edde hodde, "Tũi ãr loi endilla ka goijjio? Hiba tũwar boude hiyan tũi ãre kiyolla no ho? <verse eid="GEN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19"/>Tũi 'Iba ãr boin' kiyolla hoiyo, toi ãi hibare biya goribolla loi annilam? So, doro tũwar bou, hibare lo edde zogoi!" <verse eid="GEN 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20"/>Bade Feruwane hitar manuš okkolore Ibraimor babute hokum diye, ar hitara Ibraimor šombotti šoho, hibare edde hibar bouwore bidai diye.<verse eid="GEN 12:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1"/>Toi Ibraime hibar bou edde hibar hár kissu loiyore Mišorottu niyoli zai Negevot giye, ar Lut o hibar fũwati aššil. <verse eid="GEN 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2"/>Ibraim goru, soole edde šuna rufaye kub beši tuwangor aššil.<verse eid="GEN 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ibraim edde Lut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3"/>Bade hibaye doine Negevottu ek zagattu ar ek zagat zaite zaite Betel foijjonto aišše, Betel edde Aior maza mazi ze zagat age hibar ṭambu aššil, <verse eid="GEN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4"/>edde zeṛe hibaye foila kurbangah tiyar goijjil. Heṛe Ibraime <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> nam ḍaikke.<verse eid="GEN 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5"/>Ar Ibraimor fũwati giyede, Lutottu o, goru sool edde ṭambu okkol aššil. <verse eid="GEN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6"/>Kintu zagaganot hitara dunizon ekotro bošoti gora šombob no o, kiyollahoile hitarar šombotti eto oṭṭalika aššil ze hitara ekku fũwati taki no fare. <verse eid="GEN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7"/>Ar Ibraimor zanuwar soroya edde Lutor zanuwar soroya okkolor maze hoijja uiṭṭe. Ar he šomot Kenaniyo edde Perišiyo okkol o he dešot bošoti gorito.<verse eid="GEN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8"/>Toi Ibraime Lutore hodde, "Sa, tui edde ãr maze, tor zanuwar soroya edde ãr zanuwar soroya okkolor maze hono hoijja no ok, kiyollahoile ãra to egena. <verse eid="GEN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9"/>Tor sarme fura deš udda fori no take ne? Meherbani gori tui ãttu alok oizagoi! Tui zodi ban ḍaikka zos ãi den ḍaikka zaiyum, ar zodi tui den ḍaikka zos ãi ban ḍaikka zaiyum."<verse eid="GEN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10"/>Lute suk tuli sadde Zordanor fura niso zaga, Soar foijjonto hár zaga zola edde saite <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> baganor ḍoilla otóba Mišoror ḍoilla. (Iyan aššilde <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Súdum edde Gumorrare dongšo goribare age.) <verse eid="GEN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11"/>Hetolla Lute Zordanor hár elehare nizolla basi loiyore fuk mikka giyegoi. Ei bafe hitara ekzon loi arekzon alok oiye. <verse eid="GEN 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12"/>Ibraim Kenan dešot ar Lute he elehar niso zagar šohorgunot edde Súdum foijjonto ṭambu maijje. <verse eid="GEN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13"/>Súdum šohoror manuš okkol aššilde beši horaf edde <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> berudde beša beši guna gorat aššil.<verse eid="GEN 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14"/>Lut Ibraim loi alok oizaigoi bade <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Ibraimore hodde, "Tui ze zagat asos hentu suk tuli uttor doin fuk fosim beggulla sa, <verse eid="GEN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15"/>haron tui ze zaga okkol dehor hin ãi tore edde tor bongšore azibonolla diyum. <verse eid="GEN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16"/>Ar duniyair dúilor ḍoilla tor bongšo baraiyum; honokiye zodi duniyair dúilore goni fare, toile tor bongšore o gona zaibo. <verse eid="GEN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17"/>Uṭ, ei dešganor lamba edde fatari gurisa, kiyollahoile ãi tore iyan diyum."<verse eid="GEN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18"/>Toi Ibraime ṭambu hãri loiyore Hebronot asede Mamre elun gas bonor ḍake zaiyore bošoti goijje, edde heṛe <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> mutallek ekkan kurbangah tiyar goijje.<verse eid="GEN 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Ibraime Lutore uddar goijje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1"/>He hár din okkolot zẽtte Sinearor badša Amrapél, Ellasaror badša Aryok, Elamor badša Kedor-Laomer edde Goyimor badša Tidal, <verse eid="GEN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2"/>itara Súdumor badša Bera, Gumorrar badša Birša, Admaror badša Šinab, Zeboyimor badša Šemebor edde Belar (mani Soaror) badšar berudde larai goijje. <verse eid="GEN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3"/>Ei fãszon badšaye hitarar šoinno okkol beggunore ekkui fũwati gori Siddimor ḍeilot giye, (ziyanore mora doriya o ho.) <verse eid="GEN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4"/>Itara baro bosor foijjonto Kedor-Laomeror hokumotor tole aššil, kintu tero bosorot aiyore hitara beruddota goijje.<verse eid="GEN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5"/>Bade soiddo bosoror ṭaimot Kedor-Laomor edde hitar fũwajja badša okkole zaiyore Ašterot-Karnayimot Refaitiyo okkolore, Hamot Zuziyo okkolore, Šaveh Kiryatayimot Emittiyo okkolore, <verse eid="GEN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6"/>enki moidanor ḍake asede El-Paran foijjonto zaiyore Seir fahari Horittiyo okkolore, hamela goijje. <verse eid="GEN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7"/>Bade hitara hentu firi aiyore En-Mišpáṭ (ziyanore ehon Kadeš) heṛe aišše, edde hitara Amalekiyo okkolor fura dešore edde Hasseson-Tamarot takitode Amorittiyo okkolore hõṛai felaiye.<verse eid="GEN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8"/>Ar Súdumor badša, Gumorrar badša, Admar badša, Zeboyimor badša, edde Belar (ziyan ehon Soar) badša, itara niyoli giye edde zuddolla hitarar šoinno okkolore Siddim ḍeilot tiya goraiye, <verse eid="GEN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9"/>Elamor Kedor-Laomor badša, Goyimor Tidal badša, Sinearot Amrapél badša edde Ellasarot Aryok badša, fãszon sair zon badša loi zuddo goribolla. <verse eid="GEN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10"/>Siddimor ḍeilot beša beši dúnar gãra okkol aiššil; ar Súdum edde Gumorrar badša okkol dárgoide šomot, hitara heṛe fori giyegoi, ar bakigun faharor uzu dáigiyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11"/>Toi ei sair badšaye Súdum edde Gumorrar hár šombotti edde hitarar haiddo luṭ gori loi hentu giyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12"/>Ar hitara Ibraimor bái fut Lut edde hibar dón šombotti loigiyegoi, kiyollahoile hiba Súdumot bošoti gorat aššil.<verse eid="GEN 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13"/>Toi dáizaigoi fajjilde ekzone aiyore Ibroni Ibraimore hóborgan hoiye. He šomot hiba Amorittiyo Mamrer elun gas bonor ḍake bošobaš gorat goijjil, Mamre aššilde Iškol edde Aneror bái, hitara Ibraim loi ekdol aššil.<verse eid="GEN 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14"/>Ibraime zehon fuinne ze hibar báiyor futore bondi gori loi giyegoi, hetunot hibaye górot zormo oiyede tin šo aṛaro zon domaya gulamore loi Dan šohor foijjonto fisottu lorai loigiye. <verse eid="GEN 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15"/>Bade raitta hiba edde hibar manuš okkol, hitara bag oiye. Hitara hitarare hamela goijje, edde Damaskusor uttorottu asede Hoba foijjonto fisottu lorai loigiye. <verse eid="GEN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16"/>Toi hibaye hár zinišfati uwafes firai ainne, ar hibaye aro firai ainne, hibar egena Lut edde hibar dón šombotti, ar mayafuwain edde manuš okkolore.<verse eid="GEN 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Melkisedeke Ibraimore rahamot gorer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17"/>Kedor-Laomor edde oinno badša okkolore hõṛai felai zẽtte Ibrahim uwafes firi aišše, Súdumor badšaye hibar loi deha goribolla Šaveh (ziyanore Badšar Ḍeil o ḍaka o) he ḍeilot aišše.<verse eid="GEN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18"/>Ar Šalemor badša Melkisedeke ruṭi edde šoraf ainne. Hiba aššilde šorbo šoktiwala Allar ekzon imam, <verse eid="GEN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19"/>toi hibaye Ibraimore duwa goijje, hodde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 14:19">"Šorbo šoktiwala Allah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 14:19">asman edde zobin sirišṭi goroyaye Ibraimore rahamot gorok.<verse eid="GEN 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20"/>Ar šorbo šoktiwala Allar tarif ok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 14:20">ze tor dušmon okkolore tor hatot diye."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 14:20">Tarfore Ibraime hár kissur doš bag hibare diye.<verse eid="GEN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21"/>Ar Súdumor badšaye Ibraimore hodde, "Mal samanagun tũi lo, ar manuššunore ãre do." <verse eid="GEN 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22"/>Kintu Ibraime Súdumor badšare hodde, "Ãi asman zobin sirišti goroya šorbo šoktiwala <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allar mikka hat tuli wada gori hoir ze, <verse eid="GEN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23"/>ãi tũwar hono kissu no loiyum, ekgas fũta otóba ṭengor senḍalor fita o no, fore zene tũi en hoi no faro, 'Ãi Ibraimore tuwangor banaiyi.' <verse eid="GEN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24"/>Bolke ãr zuwan okkole háiyede hin bade ãi hono kissu no gosiyum. Aner, Iškol edde Mamre, zara ãr fũwati gil, hitarar fawana bag hitara fok."<verse eid="GEN 14:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Ibraim loi Allar wadar sukti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1"/>In okkol bade, <char style="nd">Mabudor </char>kalam Ibraimor hãse ek dehar duwara aišše:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 15:1">"Ibraim, no ḍorais!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 15:1">Ãi tor ḍal oiyum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 15:1">tor enam beši ḍõr."<verse eid="GEN 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2"/>Kintu Ibraime hodde, "Oh <char style="nd">Mabud</char>, ãr Malik, tũi ãre ki di fariba, ãide fuwain sara oi roiyi edde ãr šombottir mirazdar oibode oilde Damaskusor Eliyas?" <verse eid="GEN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3"/>Ar Ibraime hodde, "Tũi ãre hono futziyain no do; hetolla so, ãr góror ekzon gulam ãr šombottir mirazdar oibo."<verse eid="GEN 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4"/>Hetunot <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> kalam hibar hãse aišše, "Ite tor mirazdar no oibo, kintu tor nizor kun tor šombottir mirazdar oibo." <verse eid="GEN 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5"/>Toi hibaye Ibraimore baire loigiye edde hodde, "Ãsmanor mikka sa edde zodi faros he tara okkolore goni šeš gor." Toi Allaye hodde, "Tor bongšo o hendilla ogona oibo."<verse eid="GEN 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6"/>Ibraime <char style="nd">Mabudore</char> biššaš goijje, ar hetolla hibare hibaye forhesgar hisabe goisse.<verse eid="GEN 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7"/>Ar hibaye Ibraimore hodde, "Ãi he <char style="nd">Mabud</char>, tore ei dešore miraz dibolla, ze tore Kaldiyar Ur šohorottu niyolai ainne."<verse eid="GEN 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8"/>Toi Ibraime hodde, "Oh <char style="nd">Mabud</char>, ãr Malik, iyan ãr oibode ãi kengori zaniyum?"<verse eid="GEN 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hodde, "Tui tin bosojja uggwa gorur so, tin bosojja uggwa sool, tin bosojja uggwa faṛa berasool, edde uggwa hoitoror so, uggwa hoitor, ãr hãse angoi."<verse eid="GEN 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10"/>Bade Ibraime hin beggun hibar hãse ainne edde hinore mazottu siri dui falda gori ek faldar ulda ḍake ar ek faldare raikke, kintu faikgunore dui falda no gore. <verse eid="GEN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11"/>Toi šiyari faik okkol he mora zanuwar okkolor uwore zafi forerbar Ibraime hinore lorai diye.<verse eid="GEN 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12"/>Bade beil dufedde šomot Ibraim beši hora gumot foijje, ar so, beši ḍor edde boiyanok ekkan andar hibar uwore foijjede masus gorer. <verse eid="GEN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13"/>Hetunot <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Ibraimore hodde, "Iyan tui hameka zani lo, tor bongšodor okkol ofor dešot musaferi goribo edde bideši mainšor gulami goribo, mainše hitarare sair šot bosor foijjonto duk dibo. <verse eid="GEN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14"/>Kintu hitara ze zatir gulam bonibo, ãi hitarar bisar goriyum, toi tarfore hitara beša beši dón šombotti okkol loi he dešottu niyoli zaiboi. <verse eid="GEN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15"/>Ar tui šantiye tor bafdada okkolor hãse zaibi edde beši bura boyošot hoborot zaibi. <verse eid="GEN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16"/>Tor bongšor sair gurur manuš okkole eṛe firi aibo, kiyollahoile Amorittiyo okkolor guna ehono šaza diya forede hettor no o."<verse eid="GEN 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17"/>Bade beil ḍufizaigoi zehon ekkubare andar oi giyegoi, hetunot dũwaye boraiya uggwa sula edde ekkan zalaiya uzal deha gilo edde oi dui bag goijja gustor mazottu di giyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18"/>Hedin <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Ibraim loi ek wadar sukti buwaiye edde hodde, "Ãi Mišor dešor Nil halottu loti ḍor hal, Fúrat foijjonto ei zagagan tor bongšore dilam. <verse eid="GEN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19"/>Kenan dešitta okkol, Kenišittiya edde Kodomoniyo, <verse eid="GEN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20"/>Hetittiyo, Perišiyo edde Refaitiyo <verse eid="GEN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21"/>Amorittiyo, Kenaniyo, Girgašiyo edde Zebušiyo manuš okkolor zaga okkolore tore dilam."<verse eid="GEN 15:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16"/>
  <para style="s">Hazera edde Ismail</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1"/>Ibraimor bou, Saraiye, hiballa hono fuwain no biya. Kintu hibattu Hazera name ek Mišoriyo bandi aššil; <verse eid="GEN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2"/>toi Saraiye Ibraimore hodde, "So <char style="nd">Mabude</char> ãre fuwain feṛot lowattu dure raikke, foriyad gorir, tũi ãr bandir hãse zo; oitfare ãi hibar duwara ek fut faiyum."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:2">Ar Ibraime Sarair hotat razi oiye. <verse eid="GEN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3"/>Toi Ibraime Kenanot doš bosor taki bade, Saraiye, hibar Mišoriyo bandi Hazerare loi, hibar nizor zamai, Ibraimore diye. <verse eid="GEN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4"/>Bade hiba Hazerar hãse giye, edde hiba hamil oiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:4">Ar hibaye zehon hamil oiyede buzi faijje, hibaye hibar malik sahebare hela gora šuru goijje. <verse eid="GEN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5"/>Henot Saraiye Ibraimore hodde, "Ãr uwore ei dukkor daiyi tũi. Ãi ãr bandire tũwar bukot dilam, kintu hiba hamilde buzi fariyore hibaye ãre hela gorer. <char style="nd">Mabude</char> tũwar edde ãr bisar gorok!"<verse eid="GEN 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6"/>Ibraime Saraire hodde, "Sa, tor bandi tor hatot, tottu ziyan bala lage gor." Henot Saraiye Hazerare en duk diya šuru goijje, hiba hentu dáigiyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7"/>Bade <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> firistaye bošoti sara elehat, Soar zade fõtor kinare nol kuwa asede he nol kuwar fanir ḍake Hazerare faiye. <verse eid="GEN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8"/>Hibaye hodde, "Sarair bandi, Hazera, tui hontu aiyor edde hoṛe zor?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Hibaye zuwabe hodde, "Ãi ãr saheba Sarair hãsottu dáizairgoide."<verse eid="GEN 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabudor </char> firistaye hodde, "Tui tor saheba Sarair hãse uwafes firi zaigoi edde hibar gulami manilogoi." <verse eid="GEN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10"/><char style="nd">Mabudor</char> Firistaye hodde, "Ãi tor bongšore eto baraidiyum, hitarare goni šeš gora no zaibo."<verse eid="GEN 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11"/>
    <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> firistaye hibare aro hodde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:11">"Sa, tui hamil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:11">ar tui ek fut biyaibi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:11">Ar tui hitar nam rakibi Ismail,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:11">kiyollahoile <char style="nd">Mabude</char> tor dukkore fuinne.<verse eid="GEN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12"/>Ar hite ekzon murailla gadar ḍoilla manuš oibo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">hite beggunor berudde hat tulibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">ar beggune hitar berudde hat tulibo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:12">ar hite hitar egena okkol loi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">bezur takibo."<verse eid="GEN 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13"/>Bade hiba loi ze hota hoiye he <char style="nd">Mabudore</char> ei namman diye: "Tũi he Allah ze ãr uzu sor," haron hibaye hodde, "Ze ãr uzu sar ãi hibare dekilam neki?" <verse eid="GEN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14"/>Hetolla he kuwar nam aššil Beer-Lahai-Roi, hiba Kadeš edde Beredor maza mazi zagat ase.<verse eid="GEN 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15"/>Bade Hazeraye Ibraimolla ek futore biyaiye, ar Ibraime Hazeraye biyaiyede he futor nam diye Ismail. <verse eid="GEN 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16"/>Hazeraye Ibraimolla Ismailore biyaiyede hẽtte Ibraimor boyoš aši so bosor.<verse eid="GEN 16:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Allar wadar suktir sinno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1"/>Ibraimor boyoš zehon nobboi no bosor oiye, hẽtte <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hibare deha diye edde hodde, "Ãi he Šorbo-Šoktiwala Allah, ãr issa mozin sol edde hosuri sara o. <verse eid="GEN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2"/>Ar ãi tui edde ãr maze ãr wadar sukti buwaiyum edde tor bongšore beši baraidiyum."<verse eid="GEN 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3"/>Henot Ibraime soida foijje, toi Allaye hibare hodde, <verse eid="GEN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4"/>"Sa, iyan ãr wadar sukti tor loi: Tui bout zatir baf oibi. <verse eid="GEN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5"/>Tore ar Ibraim hoi ḍaka no oibo, kintu tor nam oibo Ibrahim, kiyollahoile ãi tore bout zatir baf goijji. <verse eid="GEN 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6"/>Ãi tore fólwala goriyum, ar tor butottu bout zati goriyum, edde tor butottu badša okkol niyoli aibo. <verse eid="GEN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7"/>Ãi tui edde ãr maze azibonor wadar sukti buwaiyum, ze wadar sukti tui edde tor bongšor bade bongšo dori sirohal solat takibo. Ãi tor edde tor bongšor manuš okkolor Allah oiyum. <verse eid="GEN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8"/>Ze Kenan dešot tui ehon bidešitta oi zibon haṛaor, hiyanore ãi tui edde tor bongšore sirohalolla šombotti hisabe diyum, edde hitarar Allah oiyum."<verse eid="GEN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9"/>Toi Allaye Ibrahimore hodde, "Tottu o ãr wadar sukti falon gora foribo, tui bade tor bongšodor okkole o. <verse eid="GEN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10"/>Iyan oilde ãr wadar sukti ziyan tui edde ãre maze, tui bade tor bongšodor okkolor maze: Tũwarar fotti furušore azomi gora foribo. <verse eid="GEN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11"/>Tũwara fottizonor bodar baror sam haṛa foribo, ar iyan oibode ãr edde tũwarar maze wadar suktir sinno. <verse eid="GEN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12"/>Bongšor bade bongšo dori tũwarar furuš fuwain okkol zormo oi ašṭo dinor din azomi gora foribo, enki zara bongšodor no, kintu tor górot zormo oiye ba hono bidešittattu kinna gulam okkolore udda. <verse eid="GEN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13"/>Tor górot zormo oiye ba tor kinna gulam, hitarare o azomi gora foribo. Ar iyan oilde tũwarar gat sirohalolla ãr wadar sukti asede sinno. <verse eid="GEN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14"/>Kintu ze hono azomi agoraiya, zarare bodar sam haṛa no o, hitare hitar nizor zatir butottu fũsifela oibo, kiyollahoile hite ãr wadar sukti bainge."<verse eid="GEN 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15"/>Allaye Ibrahimore aro hodde, "Tor bou Saraire tui Sarai name no ḍakis; hibar nam oibo Sarah. <verse eid="GEN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16"/>Ãi hibare duwa goriyum, ar hibattu o ãi tore ek fut diyum. Ãi hibare duwa goriyum toi hiba bout zati okkolor ma oibo; Hibar butottu badša okkol aibo."<verse eid="GEN 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17"/>Hetunot Ibrahime uite fori hãšše edde mone mone hodde, "Ek šot bosor oiyede ekzonottu ki fut zormo oibo? Ar nobboi bosojja Saraye ki fuwa biyaibo?" <verse eid="GEN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18"/>Bade Ibrahime Allare hodde, "Ismail tũwar rahamote basi takok!"<verse eid="GEN 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19"/>Toi Allaye hodde, "Tor bou Saraye hameka tolla ek morod fuwa biyaibo, ar tui hitar nam Isak rakibi. Ãi hitar loi ãr wadar sukti buwaiyum, ek sirohalolla zari takibode wadar sukti, hite bade hitar bongšo okkololla. <verse eid="GEN 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20"/>Ar Ismailor babute tor foriyad ãi funni: Sa, ãi hitare o duwa goriyum, ar hitare fólwala goijjum edde hitar bongšo beši baraidiyum. Hitar butottu baro sordar okkol uṛibo, ar ãi hitare ek ḍõr zati banaiyum. <verse eid="GEN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21"/>Agami bosor en šomot Saraye tolla zare biyaibo, he Isak loi kintu ãi ãr wadar sukti buwaiyum." <verse eid="GEN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22"/>Ibrahim loi hota howa šeš gori bade Allah hibar hentu uṛi giyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23"/>Allaye hoilde mozin, he ekkui dinot Ibrahime hibar fut Ismailore edde hibar górot zormo oiyede edde hibar kinna gulam, hitara beggunore, hibar góror hár furuš okkolore loi azomi goraiye. <verse eid="GEN 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24"/>Ibrahimor boyoš nobboi no bosor zẽtte hibare azomi gora oiye, <verse eid="GEN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25"/>ar hibar fut Ismailor boyoš tero; <verse eid="GEN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26"/>Ibrahim edde Ismail dunizonore ekkui dinot azomi gora oiye. <verse eid="GEN 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27"/>Ar hibar fũwati Ibrahimor góror hár furuš okkol, górot zormo oiyede edde bidešittattu kinna gulam, hitara beggunore azomi gora oiye.<verse eid="GEN 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Ibrahim edde tinzon meheman</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1"/>Bade <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Mamrer elun gas bonor hãse Ibrahimore deha diye. Ar hẽtte hiba dinor goromor ṭaimot ṭambur duwaror mukot boiṛa aššil. <verse eid="GEN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2"/>Hen šomot suk tuli sadde tinzon furuš manuš Ibrahimor sarme hoddur dure tiyai roiye. Deki mottor hibaye ṭambur duwaror mukottu hitarar hãse dũri zai meṛit uite foijje.<verse eid="GEN 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3"/>Ibrahime hodde, "Oh Malik, aroz gorir, ãi zodi tũwar nozorot doya faiyiede o, toile õne ei gulamor hãsottu no zaiyogoi. <verse eid="GEN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4"/>Ãi ekkena fani anigoi, toi zene õnora beggune ṭeng dui foro edde ei gastalat aram gori faro, <verse eid="GEN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5"/>edde kissu hána anidi, toi zene hin haiyore ga doro gori faro, bade õnora zeṛe zor heṛe zaiyo, zehon ei gulamor sarmottu rasta bai zor."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Hetunot hitara hodde, "Tui zen hor hen gor."<verse eid="GEN 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6"/>Toi Ibrahim toratori ṭambut Sarar hãse zai hodde, "Toratori gori ek bosta bala moida lo edde hinore maki hodun ruṭi banao."<verse eid="GEN 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7"/>Bade Ibrahim nize dũri zai zanuwaror zakottu uggwa barik, šundor gorur so aniyore hibare gulamor hatot diye edde hite toratori randito loigiye. <verse eid="GEN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8"/>Tarfore Ibrahime doi, dud edde rainda gusto loi hitarar sarme diye. Ar hitara hana háiye edde hiba hitarar ḍake ek gasor tole tiyai taikke.<verse eid="GEN 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9"/>Toi hitara hibare fusar goredde, "Tor bou Sarah hoṛe?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Hibaye hodde, "Uṛe, hiba ṭambur butore ase."<verse eid="GEN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10"/>Hitarar butottu ekzone hodde, "Agami bosor ei ṭaimot ãi abar hameka tor hãse aiššum, ar sa, hẽtte tor bou Sarattu ek fut takibo."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Ei hota Saraye ṭambur dorozat hibar fisottu takiyore funniye. <verse eid="GEN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11"/>Hẽtte Ibrahim edde Sarah dunizonor boyoš beši oiye edde Sarar fuwa biyaibar boyoš o farai giyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12"/>Hetolla Saraye mone mone hãšiyore hodde, "Ãr roš-hoš golizai ei bura hale ãttu abar ei kuši firi aibo neki? Ar ãr malik o bura."<verse eid="GEN 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13"/>Bade <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Ibrahimore hodde, "'Ãi ki hãsa ei bura hale fuwa biyaiyum' hoiyore kiyolla Saraye hãšer? <verse eid="GEN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14"/><char style="nd">Mabudolla</char> hono kissu koṭin ase neki? Agami bosor en šomot ãi abar tor hãse aiššum edde Sarattu ek fut takibo."<verse eid="GEN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15"/>Hetunot Saraye ḍoraiyore hodde, "Hou no! Ãi no hãši."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Kintu hibaye hodde, "Oi, tui hãššos."<verse eid="GEN 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Súdum edde Gumorralla Ibrahimor foriyad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16"/>Bade he manuššune hentu zaiboilla uiṭṭe edde hitara Súdumor mikka saiye, ar hitarare bidai dibolla hitarar fũwati Ibrahim o aṛer. <verse eid="GEN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hodde, "Ãi ziyan goitto zair hiyan ki ãi Ibrahimottu lukaium ne? <verse eid="GEN 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18"/>Ibrahim ek beši dõr edde šoktiwala zati oibo, ar duniyair hár zati okkolore hibar duwara rahamot gora oibo. <verse eid="GEN 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19"/>Kiyollahoile ãi hitare basi loiyi, toi zene hite hitar fuwain edde hitar bongšo okkolore <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> rasta mozin soiyi edde niyai ham goribolla hokum de, zene <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Ibrahimor hãse ze wada dil hin Ibrahimor uwore furon gori fare."<verse eid="GEN 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hodde, "Súdum edde Gumorrar berudde guzorani beši ḍõr, ar hitarar guna beši boiyanok, <verse eid="GEN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21"/>ze ãi ehon nise zaiyum edde hin saiyum ze guzorani ãr hãse fõisse iyan ki hendilla horaf ne naki no. Ar hen no oile, ãi zanifariyum."<verse eid="GEN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22"/>Toi he manuššune hentu firi Súdumor mikka giye, kintu Ibrahim ehono <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> sarme tiyat roiye. <verse eid="GEN 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23"/>Bade Ibrahime ḍake zaiyore hibare hodde: "Õne ki horaf okkolor fũwati forhesgar okkolore o fũsifelaiba? <verse eid="GEN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24"/>He šohoror butore zodi fõnzaš zon forhesgar take, ar heṛiyar fõnzaš zon forhesgar okkolore o ki õne he zagar mutallek rahamot no goriyore ki hiyan dongšo gorifelaiba? <verse eid="GEN 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25"/>Horaf okkolor fũwati forhesgar okkolore o dongšo gora, õnottu dure takok. Forhesgar okkolore horafor sarme ana, õnottu dure takok. Fura duniyair bisarhare ki niyai bisar no goribo ne?"<verse eid="GEN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26"/>Hetunot <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hodde, "Súdumor butore zodi fõnzaš forhesgar manuš fai, toile hitarar zoriya ãi he gũṛa zaga hiyanore basai rakiyum."<verse eid="GEN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27"/>Toi Ibrahime hodde, "So, ãi tũwar šanot dúil edde sai, ar ãi šahoš gori ãr Malik loi hota hoir, <verse eid="GEN 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28"/>zodi fõnzaš forhesgarottu fãszon hom o, toile ki ei fãszonor zoriya fura šohor dongšo gorifelaiba?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Hibaye hodde, "Ãi heṛe sališ fãszon faile hiyan dongšo no goriyum."<verse eid="GEN 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29"/>Hibaye hibare abar hodde, "Heṛe zodi sališzonore fa gile ka?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Hibaye hodde, "He sališzonor zoriya, ãi hen no goriyum."<verse eid="GEN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30"/>Tarfore hibaye hodde, "Malik ãr hotat naraz no oiyo, kintu ãre hoito do. Heṛe zodi tirišzonore fa gile ka?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Toi hibaye hodde, "Heṛe zodi ãi tirišzonore faile o ãi hen no goriyum."<verse eid="GEN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31"/>Ibrahime hodde, "So, šahoš gori ãi ãr Malik loi hota hoir, doro, heṛe zodi kurizonore fa gile ka?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Hibaye hodde, "Ei kurizonor zoriya, ãi hiyan dongšo no goriyum."<verse eid="GEN 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32"/>Toi Ibrahime hodde, "Malik ãr hotat naraz no oiyo, edde ãre šude ar ekbar hoito do. Heṛe zodi došzon fa gile ka?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Hibaye hodde, "Ei došzonor zoriya, ãi hiyan dongšo no goriyum."<verse eid="GEN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Ibrahim loi hota howa šeš gori bade hiba hentu giyegoi, ar Ibrahim hibar nizor górot firi aišše.<verse eid="GEN 18:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19"/>
  <para style="s">Súdum edde Gumarrah dongšo owa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1"/>Bade he firista dunizon hãzinna Súdum šohorot fõisse, ar he šomot Lut šohoror geiṛor hãsat boiṛa aššil. Hibaye zehon hitarare deikke, hibaye uṛiyore hitara loi deha goitto giye, edde meṛit uite fori šorman zanaiye, <verse eid="GEN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2"/>edde hodde, "Ãr malik okkol, meherbani gori õnora ei gulamor górot aiyore rait haṛao, ṭeng duwo. Bade binna sori uṛi õnorar baisar uzu zaigoi faribo."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Hitara hodde, "No, ãra šohoror butore rait haṛaiyum."<verse eid="GEN 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3"/>Kintu Lute zehon beši doddali loi zúr goijje, hitara hibar fũwati giye edde hibar górot góille. Bade Lute iš adiya ruṭi seki hitaralla hánar entezam goijje, toi hitara háiye. <verse eid="GEN 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4"/>Hitara neiṭṭo zaibar agottu Súdum šohoror zuwan edde bura, hár manuš okkole sairo ḍakottu ai Lutor gór girifelaiye. <verse eid="GEN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5"/>Hitara Lutore ḍak mari hodde, "Aijja raitta tor heṛe aiššede manušgun hoṛe? Hitarare bair goriyore ãrar hãse niyolai an, toi zene ãra hitarare ãrar issa mozin gori fari."<verse eid="GEN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6"/>Toi Lute dorozar baire niyoliyore hitarar hãse giye edde hibar fisottu dorozagan bon gori diye. <verse eid="GEN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7"/>Ar hodde, "Oh ãr báiyain okkol, meherbani gori tũwara endilla horaf ham no goijjo. <verse eid="GEN 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8"/>So, ãttu ziyain duizon ase, zitarare hono furuš mainše no suye, ãi tũwaralla hitarare anigoi edde tũwarattu hitara loi zen issa tũwara gorogoi. Šude ei manuššunore kissu no goijjo, kiyollahoile hitara ehon ãr góror salor tole assoro loiye."<verse eid="GEN 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9"/>Kintu hitara hodde, "Ator o, fõtottu lori tiya. Ei manušwa eṛe ãrar hãse aiššede bideši hisabe, tarbade oite ite ãrar uwore matabbori gorer. Ehon utarattuwaro tor loi ãra aro beši horaf bebar goriyum." En hoi hitara mummikka zai góror doroza bangifelaibolla Lut loi beša beši ṭelaṭeli gora šuru goijje.<verse eid="GEN 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10"/>Kintu butottu manuš dunizone hat barai di Lutore góror butore ṭani golai felaiye edde dorozagan bongorifelaiye. <verse eid="GEN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11"/>Ar hitara dorozar baire tiyat aššilde zuwan edde bura manuš okkolore anda gori felaiye, hiyanor zoriya hitara doroza tuwaite tuwaite oran oigiyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12"/>Toi bade manuš dunizone Lutore hodde, "Tottu ei šohorot tor zi zamaiyain, futain edde ziyain otóba ar hono kiye ase ne? Tui hitara beggunore loi ei zagattu bair oizagoi, <verse eid="GEN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13"/>kiyollahoile ãra iyan dongšo gorifelaiyum. Iyanor manuš okkolor berudde <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> hãse guzorani eto beši ḍõr, hibaye ei šohor dongšo gorifelaibolla ãrare faṭaiye."<verse eid="GEN 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14"/>Hetunot Lute baire giye edde hitara zara hibar zi zamai oibo hitarar loi hota hoiye. Hibaye hodde, "Tũwara toratori ei zaga sari zogoi, kiyollahoile <char style="nd">Mabude</char> ei šohorgan dongšo gorifelaibolla tiyar ase!" Kintu hitara mone goijje Lute fašai gorer buli.<verse eid="GEN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15"/>Binna dol fohor oiyede šomot firista okkole Lutore hodde, "Toratori goro! Tor bou edde tor dui zi, zara eṛe ase, hitarare loi entu niyoli zagoi, ar no oile ze gozob ei šohoror uwore lami aiyer tui o hinot maze fori dongšo oizaibigoi."<verse eid="GEN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16"/>Lute zaite deri goijje, kintu <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> rahamot Lutor uwore aššil buli he dui zone Lut edde hibar bou edde ziyaindore hatot dori ṭani šohoror baire loi ainne. <verse eid="GEN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17"/>Endilla gori hitarare bair gori ani bade, hitarar ekzone hodde, "Basito mone hoile dái zogoi! Fissa firi no saiyo ar ei fuwainna zagar hono mikka no tiyaiyo! Faharot dáizogoi, ar no oile tũwara o dongšo oiba!"<verse eid="GEN 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18"/>Kintu Lute hitarare hodde, "Oh malik okkol, hendilla no ok! <verse eid="GEN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19"/>So, õnor ei gulame õnor nozorot doya faiye, ar ãr zibonore basaiyore ãr uwore dõr doya dehaiyo. Tarfore o ãi faharot dáizaigoi no faijjum; ei bifodde ãr uwore zafi foribo edde ãi mori zaiyumboi. <verse eid="GEN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20"/>So, eṛe ḍake ekkan šohor ase, ziyanot dũri dáiza šombob, ar hiyan šoṛo o no ne? Ãre heṛe dáizaibolla ejazot do, toi ãr zibon basi zaiboi."<verse eid="GEN 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21"/>Toi hibaye hibare hodde, "Bala, ãi ei babute o tor foriyad rakilam edde tui ze zagar hota hoiyos hiyan dongšo no goriyum. <verse eid="GEN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22"/>Kintu toratori heṛe dáizagoi, kiyollahoile tui heṛe no fõsosgoi foijjonto ãi kissu gori no farir." (Hetolla he šohoror nam oiye Soar.)<verse eid="GEN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23"/>Lut Soarot fõissegoide šomot beil uiṭṭe. <verse eid="GEN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24"/>Tarfore <char style="nd">Mabude</char> asmanottu, <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> torfottu Súdum edde Gumorrar uwore baros edde oini šil zór felaiye. <verse eid="GEN 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25"/>Hibaye he šohor okkol edde hár fuwainna zaga šoho he šohor okkolot takitode hár manuš okkol edde zobinot zin barito, hár kissure dongšo gorifelaiye. <verse eid="GEN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26"/>Kintu Lutor bouye hibar fissa firi saiye, ar henot hiba nunor kúṛa oigiyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27"/>Tarfordin binna sore Ibrahime uṛi he zagat hiyanot giye zeṛe hibaye Allar sarme tiyai aššil. <verse eid="GEN 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28"/>Hibaye tiyai nisor Súdum edde Gumorrar hár fuwainna zagar uzu saiye, ar dekedde iṭ baṛar bambuttu dũwa uṛerfan, he elehattu dũwa uṛer.<verse eid="GEN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29"/>Ebafe Lut zeṛe takito he fuwainna zagar šohorgun dongšo goribar šomot Allaye Ibrahimor hota bafi Lutore heṛiyar mosibotor butottu lari loi ainne.<verse eid="GEN 19:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lut edde hibar dui zi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30"/>Bade Lut edde hibar dui ziyore loi Soarottu ek faharot zai heṛe bošoti loiye, kiyollahoile Lute Soarot takare ḍoraiye. Ar heṛe ek faharor gãtot hitara taka šuru goijje. <verse eid="GEN 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31"/>Bade ekdin ḍõr ziye šoṛo ziyore hodde, "Baba to bura oi zargoi. Ei elehat en hono furuš manuš o nai ze aiyore ãrare duniyair niyom mozin biya gori faribo. <verse eid="GEN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32"/>Aio! Ãra ãrar bafore šoraf habai fol gori hibar hãse zai. Henot babar duwara ãra ãrar bonšo rokka gori fariyum."<verse eid="GEN 19:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33"/>Henot hitara he raitta nizor bafore šoraf habaiye, bade Lutor ḍõr ziye baf loi gum zaito giye. Kintu hibar neṛa edde uṛa Lute ṭer no fa.<verse eid="GEN 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34"/>Tarfor din ḍõr ziye šoṛo ziyore hodde, "Sa, gelde raitta ãi babar loi gum gilam, ai, ãra aijja raitta o babare abar šoraf habai. Bade tui zai babar loi gum zaibi, endilla gori ãra ãrar bafor bongšo rokka gori fariyum." <verse eid="GEN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35"/>Ei bafe hitara he raitta o hitarar bafore šoraf habai fol goijje edde šoṛo ziye o bafor loi gum zaito giye. Kintu hibar neṛa edde uṛa Lute ṭer no fa.<verse eid="GEN 19:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36"/>Endilla gori Lutor dui ziye hitarar bafor duwara hamil oiye. <verse eid="GEN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37"/>Bade ḍõr ziyottu ek morod fuwa oiye, edde nam diye Muwab. Hite oilde ehonor Muwabiyo okkolor fordada. <verse eid="GEN 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38"/>Ar šoṛo ziyottu ek morod fuwa oiye, edde hitar nam raikke Ben-Ammi. Hite oilde ehonor Ammoniyo okkolor fordada.<verse eid="GEN 19:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Abimalek edde Ibrahim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1"/>Toi Ibrahim hentu Negevot giye edde Kadeš edde Šuror maze hale ekkan zagat bošoti loiye. Ar kissu dinolla hibaye Gerarot zai taikke. <verse eid="GEN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2"/>Ar heṛe o Ibrahime hibar bou Sarar babute hodde, "Iba ãr boin." Henot Geraror badša Abimaleke manuš defeṛaiyore Sarare hitar hãse ainne.<verse eid="GEN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3"/>Kintu raitta Allaye Abimalekore kuwafot aiyore hodde, "Sa, tui morar mukot, kiyollahoile ze maya fuwa tui loi ainnos hiba ar ekzonor bou."<verse eid="GEN 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4"/>Abimaleke kintu ehono hibar ḍake no za, ar hite hodde, "Malik, õne niduši zati oile o ki dongšo goriba? <verse eid="GEN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5"/>Hite nize ki 'ibar ãr boin,' ar hibaye nize ki 'iba ãr bái' no ho ne? Ãi šorol mone edde niduši hate ei ham goijji."<verse eid="GEN 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6"/>Bade Allaye hitare kuwafot hodde, "Oi, ãi zani tui šorol mone ei ham goijjos, ar hetolla ãr berudde guna gorattu tore dure raikki, ar hetolla ãi tore hibare suito no di de. <verse eid="GEN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7"/>Ehon tui he manušwar bouwore hitar hãse firaidifela, kiyollahoile hite ekzon nobi, ar hite tolla duwa goribo, henot tui basibi. Ar zodi firai no dos, toile iyan zani rak, tui edde tũwara beggune hameka moriba."<verse eid="GEN 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8"/>Tarfordin binna sore Abimaleke uṛi hitar gulam okkol beggunore ḍaikke, edde ei hota okkol zehon hitarare funaiye, hitara kub beši ḍoraiye. <verse eid="GEN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9"/>Bade Abimaleke Ibrahimore ḍaki ainne edde hibare hodde, "Tũi ãra loi endilla kiyolla gorila? Ãi tũwar ki hosuri goijji, ze tũi ãi edde ãr raijjor uwore ettor ḍõr guna ainno? Endilla hono kiye no gorede ham tũi ãr loi gorila." <verse eid="GEN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10"/>Toi Abimaleke Ibrahimore aro hodde, "Tũi ki saiyore endilla ham goijjilade?"<verse eid="GEN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11"/>Ibrahime zuwabe hodde, "Ãi mone goijjilam, 'ei zagat hameka hono Allar ḍor nai, ãr bouwolla boli oitefare hitara ãre mari felaibo.' <verse eid="GEN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12"/>Ar hiba ãr boinde hiyan o soiyi, ãr bafor zi zodi o hibar ãr mar boitta zi no; ar hiba ãr bou oiye. <verse eid="GEN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13"/>Ar zẽtte Allaye ãre ãr bafor górottu bair gori ainne, hẽtte ãi hibare hoilam, 'Tui ãre endilla goriyore ador dehai faribi, Ãra zeṛe zaiyum zaiyum, tottu howa foribo "Iba ãr bái."'"<verse eid="GEN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14"/>Toi Abimaleke hodun goru sool edde gulam edde bandi Ibrahimore diye, ar hinor fũwati hibar bou Sarare o hibar hãse firai diye. <verse eid="GEN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15"/>Toi Abimaleke hodde, "So, ãr deš gũṛa tũwar sarme ase, tũwattu ziyot foson lage hiyot tako."<verse eid="GEN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16"/>Ar hite Sarare hodde, "So, ãi tũwar hár mainšor sarme tũi nidušide hiyan zanefan ãi tũwar báiyore ek hazar rufar foiša dir. Henot beggunor sarme forman oibo ze tũi hono hosuri no goro."<verse eid="GEN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17"/>Tarfore Ibrahime Allar hãse duwa goijje ar henot Allaye Abimalek, hitar bou edde hitar bandi okolore aram goijje zene hitara abar fuwain owaifare, <verse eid="GEN 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18"/>kiyollahoile Ibrahimor bou Sarar zoriya <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Abimalekor góror hár mayafuwaindor fuwain owattu bad gori raikkil.<verse eid="GEN 20:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Isakor zormo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hibar kalam mozin Sarar mikka nozor diye edde hibaye ziyan goribo wada dil Saralla <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hiyan goijje. <verse eid="GEN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2"/>Sarah hamil oiye edde hibaye Allaye ze ṭaimor hota hoil, he ekkui ṭaimot Ibrahimor bura boyošot, hiballa ek futore biyaiye. <verse eid="GEN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3"/>Ar Ibrahime he fut, zare Saraye hiballa biyaiye, hitara nam diye Isak, <verse eid="GEN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4"/>Allaye hokum dilde mozin hibar fut Isak zehon ašṭo din oiye, Ibrahime hitare azomi goraiye. <verse eid="GEN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5"/>Ibrahim ekšot bosor boyošot hibar fut Isak zormo oiye.<verse eid="GEN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6"/>Saraye hodde, "Allaye ãr mukot hãši ainne, ar hár kiye ze ei babute funibo hitara o ãr fũwati hãšibo." <verse eid="GEN 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7"/>Hibaye aro hodde, "Saraye fuwaindore bukor dud habai faribo, hen Ibrahimore hone hoi farito? Otoso hibar ei bura boyošot ãi hiballa ek futore zormo diyi."<verse eid="GEN 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hazera edde Ismail</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8"/>Bade fuwawa bari uiṭṭe edde ze din dud saraiye, ar Isakore dud saraiyede he din Ibrahime ek ḍõr mela goijje. <verse eid="GEN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9"/>Ar Saraye dekedde Mišoror Hazeraye Ibrahimolla ze futore biyaiye, hite ṭaṭṭa gorer, <verse eid="GEN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10"/>Toi hibaye Ibrahimore hodde, "Ei bandi edde hibar futore dur goro, kiyollahoile ei bandir fute ãr fut Isakor fũwati honodin dón šombottir mirazdar oi no faribo."<verse eid="GEN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11"/>Ei ziniš iyan Ibrahimor nozorot beši horaf oiye, kiyollahoile hiyan hibar futor babute. <verse eid="GEN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12"/>Kintu Allaye Ibrahimore hodde, "Tor fut edde tor bandir babute mon horaf no goris. Saraye tore zen hor tui hibar hota fun, kiyollahoile iyan Isakor duwara zin tor bongšo dora oibo. <verse eid="GEN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13"/>Ãi he bandir futore o ek zati banaiyum, kiyollahoile hite o tor fuwa."<verse eid="GEN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14"/>Ibrahime binna sore uṛi kissu hána edde fani boraiya uggwa samrar hoilla Hazerar handot tulidiyore hibar fut šoho bidai gori diye. Hiba hentu niyoli zai Beer-Šebar bošoti sara elehat gura fira goijje.<verse eid="GEN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15"/>Hoillar fani zehon šeš oi giyegoi, hibaye fuwaware ek zõlor zafor tole neṛai raikke. <verse eid="GEN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16"/>Tarfore uggwa tir mela marile zeddur za heddur dure zai hiba boi taikke, "Fuwawar moron zen ãttu deha no fore" mone mone hen hoi hiba heṛe boi guzori handa šuru goijje.<verse eid="GEN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17"/>Fuwawar handani Allaye funniye edde Allar firistaye behostottu Hazerare ḍak diye edde hodde, "Hazera, tottu ki oiye? No ḍorais, kiyollahoile fuwawa zeṛe ase hentu hitar handani Allaye funniye. <verse eid="GEN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18"/>Tui fuwaware tul edde hitare tor hatot doro gori dor, kiyollahoile ãi hitare ek ḍõr zati banaiyum."<verse eid="GEN 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19"/>Tarfore Allaye Hazerar suk kuli diye, henot hibaye uggwa fanir kuwa deikke. Toi hibaye zaiyore samrar hoillat fani boijje edde fuware fani fito diye.<verse eid="GEN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20"/>Allah he fuwar fũwati aššil ar hite bari uiṭṭe. Hite bošoti sara elehat takito, edde tir maroya ustad boinne. <verse eid="GEN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21"/>Hite Faronor bošoti sara elehat bošoti goijje, ar hitar maye Mišorottu ek mayafuware loi hitare biya goraidiye.<verse eid="GEN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ibrahim edde Abimalekor maze sukti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22"/>He šomot Abimalek edde hitar foila komonḍar Fikole Ibrahimore hodde, "Tũi ze kissu goro hinot Allah tũwar fũwati ase. <verse eid="GEN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23"/>Hetolla tũi eṛe Allar sarme ãre hosom gori ho, ze tũi hono din ãi otóba ãr fuwain ba ãr bongšo loi beimani no goriba. Ar ãi zendilla tũware doya dehaiyi, tũi ãre edde ze dešot tũi bidešitta hisabe takor, ei dešor loi hendilla doya dehaiba."<verse eid="GEN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24"/>Ibrahime hodde, "Oi, ãi hosom gorilam."<verse eid="GEN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25"/>Abimalekor gulam okkole zurgori uggwa fanir kuwa dokol goijjilde babute Ibrahime Abimalekor hãse nališ goijje. <verse eid="GEN 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26"/>Kintu Abimaleke hodde, "Iyan hone goijje ãi hoi no fari. Tũi ãre iyan age o no ho."<verse eid="GEN 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27"/>Tarfore Ibrahime hodun sool edde goru ainne edde hin Abimalekore diye, ar hitara dunizone ekkan sukti goijje. <verse eid="GEN 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28"/>Ibrahime zakottu hãttuwa fãṛi bera soolor so aleda gori raikke. <verse eid="GEN 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29"/>Toi Abimaleke hibare fusar goredde, "Tũi ei fãṛi bera soolor so hãttuware aleda gori raikkode iyanor mani ki?"<verse eid="GEN 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30"/>Hibaye hodde, "Ei bera soolor so hãttuwa in tũi ãr hatottu goso, toi zene tũi ãlla goba oi faro ze ei kuwa ze ãi kujji."<verse eid="GEN 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31"/>Etolla he zagar nam oilde Beer-šeba, kiyollahoile he zagat hitara dunizone ek wadar hosom háil.<verse eid="GEN 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32"/>Hitara Beer-šebat ei sukti šeš gori bade, Abimalek edde hitar foila komonḍar Fikole Filistini okkolor dešot firigiyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33"/>Bade Ibrahime Beer-šebat maze uggwa zaugas lagaiye, edde heṛe he <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Ošeš Allar nam ḍaikke. <verse eid="GEN 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34"/>Ar Ibrahim Filistini okkolor dešot bidešitta hisabe bout din forbaš goijje.<verse eid="GEN 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22"/>
  <para style="s">Allaye Ibrahimore forikka goijje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1"/>Ei goṭonar bade Allaye Ibrahimore forikka goijje. Allaye hibare hodde, "Ibrahim!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:1">Ibrahime hodde, "Oto ãi eṛe."<verse eid="GEN 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2"/>Toi Allaye hodde, "Tũi tor fut, šude lehar fut, tor adoijja fut Isakore loi Muriah elehat za, edde heṛiyar fahar zibar hota ãi tore hoiyum, hibar uwore fura kurbani hisabe hitare kurbani gor."<verse eid="GEN 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3"/>Ibrahime binna sore uṛiyore hibar gadar fiṛot godi buwaye, ar hibar gulam okkolor butottu duizon gulamore edde hibat fut Isakore fũwati loi, fura kurbanilla darguwa haṛi loiyore Allaye hoilde he zagar mikka baisa diye. <verse eid="GEN 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4"/>Tin dinor din Ibrahime suk tuli saiye edde durottu tai he zaga deikke. <verse eid="GEN 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5"/>Toi hibaye hibar gulam okkolore hodde, "Tũwara gadawa loi eṛe tako, ar ãi edde ãr fut uṛe zai dórmo gorigoi, abar tũwarar hãse firi aiššum."<verse eid="GEN 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6"/>Toi Ibrahime fura kurbanir darguwar fuzá loi hibar fut Isakor handot diye edde hibar hator oinor dešši edde suri loi hitara dunizon ekku fũwati giye. <verse eid="GEN 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7"/>Toi Isake hibar baf Ibrahimore hodde, "Oh baba!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">"Ki hodde o fut?" hoi Ibrahime zuwab diye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Isake hodde, "Oin edde darguwa dekir, kintu fura kurbanilla bera soolor so hoṛe?"<verse eid="GEN 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8"/>Ibrahime zuwabe hodde, "Fura kurbanilla bera soolor so Allaye nize zuhai dibo, o fut!" Toi hitara dunizon fũwati giye.<verse eid="GEN 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9"/>Allaye hibare hoilde he zagat hitara fõsiyore Ibrahime heṛe ekkan kurbangah tiyar gori hiyanor uwore darguwa loi hãzaidiye, bade hibar fut Isakore kurbangar uwore, darguwar uwore raikke. <verse eid="GEN 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10"/>Ar Ibrahime futore zorgoraibolla suri hatot loiyore tuille. <verse eid="GEN 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11"/>Kintu <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> firistaye behostottu ḍak diye edde hodde, "Ibrahim, Ibrahim!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Hibaye zuwab diye, "Oto ãi eṛe!"<verse eid="GEN 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12"/>Hibaye hodde, "Fuwawar uwore tor hat no dis, hitare hono kissu no goris, kiyollahoile ãi ehon buzi faijji, tui Allare ḍoros, ãlla tor šude lehar futore kurbani dite o fisfa no goros."<verse eid="GEN 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13"/>Hetunot Ibrahime hibar suk tuli saiye, ar so, hibar fisottu uggwa faṛa sool, šingot zõl berai ãṭkiroiye; bade Ibrahime zai he faṛa soolguwa aniyore futor bodole hibare fura kurbani kurbani diye. <verse eid="GEN 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14"/>Ibrahime he zagar nam raikke "YHWH-Jireh" (Mabud ze zuhaide.) Etolla ehono endilla ho, "<char style="nd">Mabudor</char> faharot zuhaide."<verse eid="GEN 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15"/>Toi <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> firistaye behostottu dusora bar Ibrahimore ḍak maijje <verse eid="GEN 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16"/>edde hodde, "Tui tor futore kurbani dite fisfa no goros, hetolla ãi <char style="nd">Mabud</char> nize hosom hái hoir ze, <verse eid="GEN 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17"/>ãi hameka tore beši duwa goriyum, ar asmanor tara ḍoilla edde doriyar soror balur reni zedun tor bongšo hedun beši gori diyum. Tor bongšo okkole hitarar dušmon okkolor šohor okkolore dokol goribo. <verse eid="GEN 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18"/>Tor bongšor duwara duniyair hár zatiye duwa faibo, kiyollahoile tui ãr hokum mainnos."<verse eid="GEN 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19"/>Toi bade Ibrahime hibar gulam okkolor hãse firi giye, edde hitara beggune ekku fũwati hentu Beer-Šebat firi zaiboilla baisa diye. Ar Ibrahim Beer-Šebat bošoti goijje.<verse eid="GEN 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nahuror futain</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20"/>Ei goṭona goṭi bade Ibrahimore howa oiye, "So, tũwar bái Nahurolla Melkaye o futain okkol biyaiye:<verse eid="GEN 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21"/>Foila zormo Uz, hitar bái Buz,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 22:21">Aramor baf, Kamuel,<verse eid="GEN 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22"/>Kesed, Hazo, Fildaš, Jidlap edde Betuel."<verse eid="GEN 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23"/>Betuel Rebekar baf oiye.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="GEN 22:23">Ibrahimor bái Nahuror bou Melkaye ei ašṭo futore biyaiye.<verse eid="GEN 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24"/>Nahuror bandi bou zar nam Reuma, hibaye o:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 22:24">Ṭebah, Gaham, Tahaš edde Maakah, itarare biyaiye.<verse eid="GEN 22:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23"/>
  <para style="s">Sarar entehal edde dohon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1"/>Sarar boyoš ek šo hãtaiš bosor oil; hiba hetodin basi aššil. <verse eid="GEN 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2"/>Ar Kenan dešot Kiryat-Arbat (hiyan oilde, Hebronot) hibar moron oiye, ar Ibrahime Saralla handibolla edde šuk falon goribolla giye.<verse eid="GEN 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3"/>Bade Ibrahime hibar mora bouwor ḍakottu uiṭṭe edde Hetittiyo okkolor hãse zai hodde, <verse eid="GEN 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4"/>"Ãi tũwarar butore ekzon osin bidešitta; hoborstan banaibolla ãre tũwarar butore ekkan zaga beso, toi zene ãr sarme ãr mora bouwore dohon gorai fari."<verse eid="GEN 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5"/>Hetittiyo okkole Ibrahimore zuwabe hodde, <verse eid="GEN 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6"/>"Malik, ãrar hota funo, tũi ãrar butore ekzon Allar šoktišali neta. Ãrar hoborgunor butore he barik hoboror butore tũwar morare dohon gorogoi. Tũwar mora gãraibolla ãrar honokiye hitar hobor zaga sari dite ošikar no goribo."<verse eid="GEN 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7"/>Toi Ibrahime uṛiyore he dešor manuš mani Hetittiyo okkolor sarme mata niyuraiyore ijjot goijje. <verse eid="GEN 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8"/>Bade hibaye hitarare hodde, "Ãr morare ãr sarme dohon goraito diba iyan zodi tũwarar issa o, toile ãr hota funo, Soharor fut Efron loi ãlla ottor o, <verse eid="GEN 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9"/>toi zene hitar maṛor šeš šimat, Mokfelar gãt, ziba hitattu ase, hiba hite ãre de. Hite zene tũwarar sarme hiyanor fura dam loiyore hoborstan banaibolla ãr hãse besifele."<verse eid="GEN 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10"/>Ar Hetittiyo okkolor fũwati Efron o heṛe boiṛa aššil, ar Hetittiyo Efrone Ibrahimore zuwab dedde hiyan hitar šohor geiṛot góillede beggune funniye. <verse eid="GEN 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11"/>Hite hodde, "No, ãr malik, õne ãr hota funo, ãi ãr zatir manušor sarme he maṭ edde hiyanot ze gãt ase, hiba šoho ãi tũware dilam. Tũwar morare dohon gorogoi."<verse eid="GEN 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12"/>Hetunot Ibrahime abar dešor mainšor sarme mata niyuraiyore ijjot goijje. <verse eid="GEN 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13"/>Ar he dešor manuš beggunor sarme hibaye Efronore hodde, "Zodi mone ho foriyad gorir, tũi ãr hota funo, ãi maṛor dam di, meherbani gori tũi ãttu hingun goso, toi zene ãi ãr mora bouwore heṛe dohon goraifari."<verse eid="GEN 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14"/>Efrone Ibrahimore zuwabe hodde, <verse eid="GEN 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15"/>"Malik, ãr hota funo, he zagar dam oiyede sair šot rufar ṭĩya, kintu hin ãlla edde tũwalla hono kissu no, tũwar bouwore heṛe dohon gorogoi."<verse eid="GEN 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16"/>Ibrahime Efronor hota buzi faijje edde hite Hetittiyo okkolor sarme rufar ṭĩyar hota hoilde mozin, sair šot rufar ṭĩya šodor okkolor maf mozin mafiyore hitare diye.<verse eid="GEN 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17"/>Ei bafe Mamrer ḍake Mokfelat asede Efronor maṭ edde gãt, ar he maṛor sairo mikkar hár gas šoho, <verse eid="GEN 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18"/>hár Hetittiyo okkol hitar šohor geiṭor sarme goillilde hitarar sarme Ibrahimor šombotti šabbišṭo oiye. <verse eid="GEN 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19"/>Tarfore Ibrahime Kenan dešor Mamrer ḍake (ziyan Hebronot) Mokfelar maṛot asede gãtot hibar bou Sarare gãraiye. <verse eid="GEN 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20"/>Endilla gori he maṭ edde heṛe asede gãt hoborstan hisabe Hetittiyo okkolor hatottu Ibrahimor hãtot aišše.<verse eid="GEN 23:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24"/>
  <para style="s">Isak edde Rebekah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1"/>Hẽtte Ibrahim bura edde boyoš beši oiye, ar <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hibare hár kissut duwa goijjil. <verse eid="GEN 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2"/>Ibrahime hibar góror šobsaite furan gulam, zar uwore hibattu aššilde hin beggunor hár bár aššil, hitare hodde, "Tor hattan ãr ranor tole rak. <verse eid="GEN 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3"/>Ãi tore behosto edde duniyair Allah, <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> sarme hosom gorai, ze Kenaniyo okkolor butore ãi bošobaš gorir, itarar butottu ãr futolla bou no anibi, <verse eid="GEN 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4"/>kintu ãr dešot ãr nizor egena okkolor hãse zai ãr fut Isakolla bou anibi."<verse eid="GEN 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5"/>He gulame hibare hodde, "Zodi he maya fuwa ãr fũwati ei dešot aite razi no o, henoile ze deš sari tũi eṛe aigiyogoi he dešot ki abar tũwar futore loizaiyum?"<verse eid="GEN 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6"/>Ibrahime hodde, "Kiyal rakis, ãr futore tui hono mote heṛe no loizais. <verse eid="GEN 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7"/><char style="nd">Mabud </char> ze Behostor Allah, ze ãre ãr bafor gór edde ãr zormostanottu niyolai ainne, ze ãr loi hota hoiye edde hosom hái hoiye, 'Ei dešgan ãi tor bongšore diyum' hibaye tor age hibar firistare defeṛaibo, zene tui ãr futolla hentu ek bou ani faros. <verse eid="GEN 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8"/>He maya fuwa zodi tor fũwati aite razi no o, toile tui ãr hosomottu hedin azad; kintu hono mote ãr futore heṛe no loizais." <verse eid="GEN 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9"/>Toi he gulame hitar giros Ibrahimor ranor tole hat raki ei befare hibar loi hosom háiye.<verse eid="GEN 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10"/>Tarfore he gulame hitar girosor ũṭ okkolottu došwa ũṭ loi, hitar girose diyede hár ḍoilla dami zinišfati okkol loi baisa diye. Hite Aram Nahuriyamor mikka ruwana diyore Nahuror šohorot giye. <verse eid="GEN 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11"/>Hite heṛe šohoror baire uṭgunore ek fanir kuwar ḍake luṛai ejje; ar hiyan aššilde hazinna ṭaimot, zẽtte mayafuwainde fani tulito za.<verse eid="GEN 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12"/>Tarfore hite duwa gorer, "Oh <char style="nd">Mabud</char>, ãr giros Ibrahimor Allah, aijja ãre kamiyaf goro, edde ãr giros Ibrahimore doya dehao. <verse eid="GEN 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13"/>So, ãi ei fanir kuwar hãsat tiyai roiyi, ar ei šohoror mainšor ziyain okkole fani tulibolla niyoli aiyer. <verse eid="GEN 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14"/>Iyan endilla ok zẽtte ãi ek zuwan mayafuware hoi, 'Tor górawa lama, zene ãi fani fiyi fari,' ar hibaye ho, 'fiyo, ai tũwar uṭgunore o ãi fani diyum' henoile hiba tũwar gulam Isakolla tũwar basai gora ok. Ar iyanot ãi zaniyum ze tũi ãr girosore doya dehaiyo."<verse eid="GEN 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15"/>Ar so, ei duwa goijja no oite, Rebekah góra handot loi niyoli aiyer. Hiba aššilde Ibrahimor bái Nahuror bou Melkar fut Betuelor zi. <verse eid="GEN 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16"/>He zuwan maya fuwawa aššil beši šundori, ek kumari, zibare hono manuše no sue. Hiba kuwat laimme edde góra furai loi abar uwafes uṛi aišše.<verse eid="GEN 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17"/>Hen šomot gulammuwaye dũri hibar sarme zaiyore hodde, "Meherbani gori, tor górattu ãre ekka fani fito de."<verse eid="GEN 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18"/>Hibaye hodde, "Malik, fani fiyo," ar toratori górawa hibar handottu hibar hatot lamaiye edde hitare fani fito diye.<verse eid="GEN 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19"/>Ar hibaye hitare fani fito di bade hodde, "Ãi tũwar uṭgunolla o fani tuliyum, zetun hitara fani fiya šeš no gore." <verse eid="GEN 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20"/>Tarfore hibaye toratori hibar górar fanigun zanuwarore fani habade nor kulot ḍali diyore dũri abar kuwar ḍake fani tulibolla giye, edde hitar hár uṭ okkololla fani tuille. <verse eid="GEN 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21"/>Ar manušwaye nizamot hibar uzu saiye, <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hitar baisa kamiyaf goijje ne na ki no gore zanibolla.<verse eid="GEN 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22"/>Uṭgune fani fiya šeš oi bade, manušwaye adá šekel uzonor ugguwa šunar nakful, edde dui hatolla doš šekel uzonor duiyan šunar haru hibar sarme bair goijje. <verse eid="GEN 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23"/>Toi hite hodde, "Tui haro zi, meherbani gori ãre ho, tor bafor górot ãra rait haṛaibolla hono ekkan zaga ase ne?"<verse eid="GEN 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24"/>Hibaye zuwabe hodde, "Ãi Melkar fut Betuelor zi, zare Melkaye Nahurolla biyaiye." <verse eid="GEN 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25"/>Hibaye aro hodde, "Ãrar górot beša beši ker edde buši ase edde takibar zaga o ase."<verse eid="GEN 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26"/>Hetunot he manušwaye <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> soida foriyore šukuriya zanaiye, <verse eid="GEN 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27"/>ar hodde, "Hár tarif ãr giros Ibrahimor Allah <char style="nd">Mabudore</char>, zibaye ãr girosor mutallek hibar doya edde imandari dehare forai no fele. Ãre o fõtot, he <char style="nd">Mabude</char> rasta dehaiyore ãr girosor egena báiyor górot ainne."<verse eid="GEN 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28"/>Bade he zuwan mayafuwawaye dũri zaiyore hibar mar górot ei hota okkolore hoiye. <verse eid="GEN 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29"/>Ar Rebekkattu Labon name ek bái aššil, hite oi kuwar ḍake manušwar hãse dũri giye, <verse eid="GEN 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30"/>Hite zehon nakful edde hitar boinor hatot haru deikke, ar manušwaye hoilde hin hitar boine hodde funniye, hite niyoliyore he manušwar hãse giye, edde hite kuwar hãsat ũṛor ḍake tiyat lotfaiye. <verse eid="GEN 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31"/>Toi hite hodde, "Oh <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> rahamotwala manuš, aiyo! Baire kiyolla tiyai taikko? Ãi õnolla gór edde uṭgunolla zaga ṭik goijji."<verse eid="GEN 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32"/>Toi manušware górot ainne edde uṭgunottu fũza lamai loiye. Ar uṭgunore ker edde buši diye, ar manušwa edde hitar sãti mainšore ṭeng dúibolla fani diye. <verse eid="GEN 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33"/>Tarfore zehon hána ainne, hetunot manušwaye hodde, "Ãi ãr hota hoiya no o foijjonto ãi hána no háiyum."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Toi Labone hodde, "Toile ho!"<verse eid="GEN 24:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34"/>Toi hite hor, "Ãi Ibrahimor gulam. <verse eid="GEN 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35"/><char style="nd">Mabude</char> ãr girosore beša beši rahamot goijje, ehon hiba ekzon beši ḍõr manuš, ar hibaye hibare beši goru sool šuna rufa gulam edde bandi ar uṭ gada diye. <verse eid="GEN 24:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36"/>Ãr girosor bou, Saraye hibar ei bura boyošot ãr girosolla ek futore biyaiye. Hitare hibar nizor hár kissu difelaiye. <verse eid="GEN 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37"/>Ar ãr girose ãre endilla hoi hosom goraiye, 'Ãi zarar dešot bošobaš gorir, he Kenaniyo okkolor ziyain okkolottu ãr futolla bou no anibi, <verse eid="GEN 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38"/>kintu tui ãr bafor górot zaibi edde ãr nizor egenar butottu ãr futolla ugguwa bou anibi.'<verse eid="GEN 24:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39"/>"Tarfore ãi ãr girosore fusar goijjilam, 'Kintu mayafuwa zodi ãr fũwati aito no sa ka?'<verse eid="GEN 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40"/>"Hibaye ãre hoil, 'Ãi zar sarme sola fira gori he <char style="nd">Mabude</char> firistare tor fũwati defeṛaibo edde tor baisare kamiyaf goraibo, toi zene ãr bafor gór edde egena okkolor butottu ãr futolla bou ani faros. <verse eid="GEN 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41"/>Tui ãr egenar górot zai bade zodi hitara hibare no de toile tui ãr ei hosomottu azad.'<verse eid="GEN 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42"/>"Aijja ãi zẽtte kuwar ḍake aišši, ãi hoiyide, 'Oh <char style="nd">Mabud</char>, ãr giros Ibrahimor Allah, meherbani gori tũi ãr ei baisare kamiyaf goro. <verse eid="GEN 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43"/>Ar so, ãi ei kuwar ḍake tiyai roiyi. Hono zuwan maya fuwa zodi fani tulito aiye, ãi hibare hoiyum, "Meherbani gori, tũwar górattu ãre ekka fani fiyabo," <verse eid="GEN 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44"/>ar hibaye zodi ãre ho, "Fani fiyo, Ãi tũwar uṭgunolla o fani tuliyum," henoile hiba he maya fuwa ok, zibare <char style="nd">Mabude</char> ãr girosor futolla basona goijje.'<verse eid="GEN 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45"/>"Ãr dilot ei hota howa šeš no oite, Rebekah góra handot loi, niyoli aišše. Hiba kuwat laimme edde fani tuille, ar ãi hibare hoidde, 'Meherbani gori ãre ekka fani do.'<verse eid="GEN 24:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46"/>"Hibaye toratori hibar górawa handottu lamaiye edde hodde, 'Fani fiyo, ar ãi tũwar uṭgunore o fani diyum.' Toi ãi fani filam, edde hibaye uṭgunore o fani diye.<verse eid="GEN 24:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47"/>"Bade ãi hibare fusar goijji, 'Tui haro zi?'</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:47">"Hibaye hodde, 'Ãi Melkar fut Betuelor zi, zare Melkaye Nahurolla biyaiye.'</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:47">"Toi ãi hibare nakot nakful, ar hatot haru findai dilam. <verse eid="GEN 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48"/>Tarfore ãi <char style="nd">Mabudore</char> sojida goriyore šukuriya zanaiyi. Ãi ãr giros Ibrahimor Allah <char style="nd">Mabudore</char> šukurana adai goijji, kiyollahoile hibaye ãre soiyi rastat loi ainne zene ãi ãr girosor báifutor ziyore hibar futolla loi zai fari. <verse eid="GEN 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49"/>Ehon õnora zodi ãr giros loi doya edde soiyi bebar goribolla razi aso, toile ho. Ar zodi no tako, hiyan o ho, henot ãi zene ar oinno hono mikka zai fari."<verse eid="GEN 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50"/>Toi Labon edde Betuele zuwab diye, "Iyan zehon <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> torfottu oiye; ãra tũware bala edde bura kissu hoi no farir. <verse eid="GEN 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51"/>So, otiya Rebekah, hibare loi zo, <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hoilde mozin hiba tũwar girosor futor bou ok."<verse eid="GEN 24:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52"/>Ibrahimor gulame zehon hitarar ei hota fuinne, hite meṛit fori <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> sarme soida foijje. <verse eid="GEN 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53"/>Tarfore he gulame šuna rufa guwana fati hor sour bair gori hinore Rebekare diye; ar bout dami ziniš okkol o hite hibar bái edde mare diye. <verse eid="GEN 24:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54"/>Toi hite edde hitar fũwati aššilde manuš okkol, hitara beggune há fiya goijje edde heṛe rait haṛaiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:54">Bade hitara binna sore uiṭṭe, hite hodde, "Ãi ãr girosor heṛe zaiboilla bidai do."<verse eid="GEN 24:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55"/>Kintu hibar bái edde maye hodde, "Zuwan mayafuware aro ašṭo, doš din antaz ãrar fũwati takok; tarfore hiba zaibo."<verse eid="GEN 24:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56"/>Ar hite hitarare hodde, "Ãre ar eṛe raki no diyo, <char style="nd">Mabude</char> zehon ãr sofor kamiyaf goijjede dekir; ãre bidai do, ãi ãr girosor heṛe zaigoi."<verse eid="GEN 24:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57"/>Tarfore hitara hodde, "Toi zuwan mayafuwaware ḍaki, hibar mukottu ekka funi sai." <verse eid="GEN 24:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58"/>Toi hitara Rebekare ḍaikke edde fusar goijje, "Tui ei manušwar fũwati zaibi ne?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Hibaye hodde, "Ãi zaiyum."<verse eid="GEN 24:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59"/>Toi hitara hitar boin Rebekah edde hibar dáimare Ibrahimor gulam edde hitar manuš okkolor fũwati defeṛaiye. <verse eid="GEN 24:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60"/>Hitara Rebekare duwa gorer edde hibare hor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">"Oh ãrar boin, tui</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">hazar hazar futziyaindor ma o;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">tor bongšo okkole odihar adai gorok</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">hitarar dušmon okkolor šohor okkolot."<verse eid="GEN 24:60"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61"/>Bade Rebekah edde hibar bandi okkol tiyar oiye edde uṭ okkolor uwore sori manušwar fise fise giye; ar he gulame Rebekare loi giyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 24:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62"/>Ehon Isak Beer Lahai Roi kuwar hentu bai gil, kiyollahoile hiba Negevot takito. <verse eid="GEN 24:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63"/>Hazinna odde ṭaimot Isake ãṛat maze maṛot giye, ar hibaye uwor mikka sadde šomot dekedde hodun uṭ aiyer. <verse eid="GEN 24:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64"/>Ar Rebekaye o uwor mikka saiye edde Isakore deikke. Toi hiba uṛottu nise laimme <verse eid="GEN 24:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65"/>edde gulamware hodde, "Maṛottu ãṛi ãrar uzu aiyedde hiba honnuwa?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Toi gulammuwaye hodde, "Hiba ãrar giros." Toi hibaye gũwaṛa loiye edde nizore guijje.<verse eid="GEN 24:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66"/>Tarfore he gulame hite goijjilde hár kissu beggun Isakore zanaiye. <verse eid="GEN 24:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67"/>Isake hibare hibar ma Sarar ṭambut ainne, edde Isake hibare loiye, toi hiba bou oiye edde hibare Isake ador goijje; hibar ma mori bade, Rebekar adore Isakore šantona dil.<verse eid="GEN 24:67"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25"/>
  <para style="s">Ibrahimor Moron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1"/>Ibrahime ar ugguwa bou loiye, zar nam Keturah. <verse eid="GEN 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2"/>Hibaye hiballa Simron, Jokšan, Medan edde Midiyan, Išbak edde Šuah, itarare biyaiye. <verse eid="GEN 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3"/>Jokšane Šeba edde Dedan, itarare faiye; ar Dedanor bongšo okkol aššilde Asšuriyo, Letušiyo edde Leummiyo. <verse eid="GEN 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4"/>Ar Midiyanor futain okkol aššilde Efah, Efer, Hanok, Abida edde Eldaah. Itara beggun aššilde Keturar bongšo okkol.<verse eid="GEN 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5"/>Ibrahime hibar nizor hár kissu Isakore di giye. <verse eid="GEN 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6"/>Kintu Ibrahim basi taite, hibar bandi bouwaindor boitta hibar futain okkolore hadiya okkol diye, edde hibar fut Isakor hentu hitarare fuk mikka fuk dešot faṭai diye.<verse eid="GEN 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7"/>Ibrahimor zibonor bosoror din okkol oilde in: Hiba ekšo hoittor fãs bosor basi aššil. <verse eid="GEN 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8"/>Tarfore hibar boyoš oiyore edde beši bura boyošot šeš niyaš felaiye, edde hibar nizor manuš loi dola oiyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9"/>Hibar futain Isake edde Ismaile Mamrer sarme Hetittiyo Soharor fut Efronor maṭor Mokfelar gãtot hibare dohon diye, <verse eid="GEN 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10"/>ziyan Ibrahime Hetittiyo okkolottu kini loil, heṛe hibar bou Sarar fũwati Ibrahimore o dohon gora oiye. <verse eid="GEN 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11"/>Ibrahimor moron oi bade, hibar fut Isakore Allaye rahamot goijje. Ar Isak Beer Lahai Roir hãse bošobaš goijje.<verse eid="GEN 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ismailor futain okkol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12"/>Iyan oilde Ibrahimor fut Ismailor bongšo kahani, zare Sarar Mišoriyo bandi Hazeraye Ibrahimolla biyail.<verse eid="GEN 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13"/>In okkol oilde Ismailor futaindor nam okkol, hitarar zormonamat nam okkol asede mozin:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 25:13"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 25:13">Ismailor foila zormo Nebayot,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 25:13">Kedar, Adbeel edde Mibsam,<verse eid="GEN 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14"/>Mišma, Dumah, Massa,<verse eid="GEN 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15"/>Hadad, Tema, Jetur,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 25:15">Nafiš edde Kedmah.<verse eid="GEN 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16"/>In okkol aššide Ismailor futain okkol, edde hitarar fara okkol edde ṭambu okkol mozin itara oilde baro guštir sordar okkolor nam okkol.<verse eid="GEN 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17"/>Ismailor zibonor bosoror din okkol oilde in: Hiba ekšo tiriš hãt bosor basi aššil. Bade hibaye šeš niyaš felaiye edde mori giyegoi, ar hibar nizor manuš loi dola oiyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18"/>Ar Ismaili okkol Havilattu Šur foijjonto, ziyan Mišorottu Asšuror mikka, ei zaga okkolot bošobaš goijje, edde hitara hitarar hár sordar okkole ekku fũwati taki no fare.<verse eid="GEN 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakub edde Iš</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19"/>In okkol oilde Ibrahimor fut Isakor bongšor kahani.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 25:19"/>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:19">Ibrahim Isakor baf oiye, <verse eid="GEN 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20"/>ar sališ bosor boyošot Isake Paddanor Aramiyo Betuelor zi edde Aramiyo Labonor boin Rebekare biya goijje.<verse eid="GEN 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21"/>Ar Isake hibar bouwolla <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> hãse duwa goijje, kiyollahoile hiba bázá aššil. <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hibar duware goisse, edde Rebekah hamil oiye. <verse eid="GEN 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22"/>Bade hibar gorbor butore fuwainde dora dori diye edde hibaye hodde, "Ãttu endilla ka or?" Toi hibaye <char style="nd">Mabudottu</char> fusar goitto giye.<verse eid="GEN 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23"/>
    <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hibare hodde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">"Tor gorbot dui zati ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">Tor udorottu loti dui zati alok oiya oibo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Ek zati ar ek zatittuwaro beši šoktiwala oibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">ḍõrguwa oibo šoṛowar gulam."<verse eid="GEN 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24"/>Bade zehon hibaye biyaibar ṭaim aišše, ar so, hibar górbot zoikka morod fuwain. <verse eid="GEN 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25"/>Ar foila niyoli aiššede hite lal, hitar hara ga kẽšša bazu ḍoilla, hetolla hitara hitar nam raikke Iš. <verse eid="GEN 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26"/>Tarfore hitar bái niyoli aišše hitar hate Išor formurit dori, hetolla hitar nam raka oiye Yakub. Isakor boyoš haiṭ bosor zẽtte Rebekaye itarare biyaiye.<verse eid="GEN 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27"/>Ei fuwain ḍõr oiye edde Iš ekzon maṛot takoya, ekzon beši bala šiyari goroya oiye, ar Yakub aššilde ekzon nizam manuš, ze ṭambut takito. <verse eid="GEN 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28"/>Isak šiyari gusto hána moza faito, hetolla Išore ador goijje, kintu Rebekaye Yakubore ador goijje.<verse eid="GEN 25:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29"/>Ekbar Yakube zul rãder, Iš horan ferešan oi maṛottu firi aišše. <verse eid="GEN 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30"/>Hite Yakubore hodde, "Toratori gor, oi lal zulottu ãre kissu haito de, kiyollahoile ãi horan oiyi." (Hetolla Išore Edom zar mani Lal o ḍakito.)<verse eid="GEN 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31"/>Kintu Yakube hodde, "Age tui ãre tor foila zormor odihargan besifela."<verse eid="GEN 25:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32"/>Išye hodde, "Sa, ãi mori zairgoi, foila zormor odihar loi ãi ki goijjium?"<verse eid="GEN 25:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33"/>Yakube hodde, "Tui aijja ãr loi hosom há." Henot hite hitar hãse hosom háiye, edde hitar foila zormor odihargan Yakubore besifelaiye.<verse eid="GEN 25:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34"/>Toi Yakube Išore ruṭi edde rainda mošorir ḍailor zul diye. Ar hite há fiya gori bade hentu giyegoi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:34">Endilla gori Išye hitar foila zormor odiharganore muillo sara goijje.<verse eid="GEN 25:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26"/>
  <para style="s">Isak edde Rebekah Gerarot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1"/>Ibrahimor ṭaimot ṛat oilde he foilawa bade ar ugguwa raṭ oiye. Toi Isak Gerarot Filistini okkolor badša Abimelekor hãse giye. <verse eid="GEN 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2"/><char style="nd">Mabude</char> Isakore deha diye edde hodde, "Tui entu Mišorot lami no zaisgoi, ãi tore ze zagar babute hoiyum tui he zagat bošoti gor. <verse eid="GEN 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3"/>Tui hotokkalolla ei zagat tak, edde ãi tor fũwati takiyore tore rahamot goriyum, kiyollahoile ãi tore edde tor bongšore ei zaga okkol diyum, edde tor baf Ibrahimor hãse ze hosom háiyi hiyan ãi furon goijjium. <verse eid="GEN 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4"/>Ãi tor bongšore asmanor tara zedun hedun goriyum edde ei zaga okkol hitarare diyum, ar tor bongšor duwara duniyair hár zatiye duwa faibo, <verse eid="GEN 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5"/>kiyollahoile Ibrahime ãr hota fuinne edde ãr hár dabi, ãr hokum okkol, ãr ain edde kanon okkol falon goijje." <verse eid="GEN 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6"/>Toi Isak Gerarot taigiyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7"/>Ar he zagar mainše hibar bouwore boute fusar goijje, hibaye hodde, "Hiba ãr boin." Hibaye "Hiba ãr bou" hoite ḍoraiye, kiyollahoile hibaye ḍoraiye ze "Rebekkalla boli hitara hibare mari felaibo, kiyollahoile hiba beši šundor."<verse eid="GEN 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8"/>Isake bout hal heṛe bošobaš gori bade, Filistini badša Abimaleke zanala bai dekedde, Isake hibar nizor bou Rebekah loi šuhag gorer. <verse eid="GEN 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9"/>Toi Abimaleke Isakore ḍaikke edde hodde, "Sa, hiba hameka tor bou! Tui kengori hiba 'Ãr boin' hoi faijjos?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Isake hitare zuwabe hodde, "Kiyollahoile ãi mone goijjilam ãi hiballa boli foran haraiyum."<verse eid="GEN 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10"/>Abimaleke hodde, "Tui ãrar loi endilla kiyolla goijjos? Ze hono mainše to tor bou loi gum zai farito, ar tui ãrare hosurbon banaifelaiti."<verse eid="GEN 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11"/>Toi Abimaleke hár manuš okkolore endilla hoi hokum zari goijje: "Ze honokiye ei manušwar berudde otóba hitar bouwor berudde za, hitare hameka marifela oibo."<verse eid="GEN 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12"/>Isake he dešot saš goijje edde he bosor hinot ek šot gun fošol faiye. <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hibare rahamot goijje. <verse eid="GEN 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13"/>Toi hiba ḍor owa šuru goijje, ar ekattu ekka bariuṛat takiyore beši ḍõr manuš boinne. <verse eid="GEN 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14"/>Ar hibattu goru sool edde beša beši gulam okkol oiye, ar Filistini okkole hibar loi riš goijje. <verse eid="GEN 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15"/>Henot hibar baf Ibrahim zinda taite hibar gulam okkole kujjilde hár kuwa okkolore Filistini okkole meṛi felaiyore búzaifeliye.<verse eid="GEN 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16"/>Bade Abimaleke Isakore hodde, "Tui ãrar hentu zagoi, kiyollahoile tui ãrattuwaro beši šoktiwala oiyos."<verse eid="GEN 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17"/>Toi Isak hentu giyegoi edde Geraror ḍeilot zai ṭambu gãijje edde heṛe taikke. <verse eid="GEN 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18"/>Toi hibar baf Ibrahim zinda taite kujjilde kuwa hinore Isake abar kuijje, zinore Ibrahim mori bade Filistini okkole búzaifelail, ar bafe hinore ze nam okkol dil hibaye hinore he ekkui nam okkol diye.<verse eid="GEN 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19"/>Isakor gulam okkole ḍeilot kuriyore heṛe ugguwa fanir nal faiye. <verse eid="GEN 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20"/>Kintu Geraror soolsoroya okkole Isakor soolsoroya okkol loi hoijja diye edde hodde, "Ei fani ãrar!" hetolla Isake he kuwar nam diye Ešek, kiyollahoile hitara hibar loi hoijja goijjil. <verse eid="GEN 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21"/>Bade hitara ar uggwa kuwa kuijje, kintu hiba loi o hitara hoijja goijje; hetolla hibaye hibar nam diye Sitnah. <verse eid="GEN 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22"/>Toi hiba hentu giyegoi edde ar uggwa kuwa kuijje, ar hiballa hitara hoijja no gore, ar hibaye hibar nam diye Rehobot edde hodde, "Šeš foijjonto <char style="nd">Mabude</char> ãrare farot zaga diye, ar ãra ei zagat fólwala oi faijjum."<verse eid="GEN 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23"/>Ar hentu hiba Beer-Šebat giye. <verse eid="GEN 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24"/>He raitta <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hibare deha diyore hodde, "Ãi tor baf Ibrahimor Allah, tũi no ḍorais; ãi tor fũwati asi, ãi tore rahamot goriyum; ar Ibrahimor hatire ãi tor bongšore baraidiyum."<verse eid="GEN 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25"/>Toi Isake heṛe ekkan kurbangah tiyar goijje edde <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> nam ḍaikke. Heṛe hibaye hibar ṭambu o maijje, edde hibar gulam okkole heṛe uggwa kuwa kuijje.<verse eid="GEN 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26"/>Bade Abimaleke hitar dusto Ahussat edde hitar foila šenafoti Fikolore loi Gerarottu Isakor hãse aišše. <verse eid="GEN 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27"/>Isake hitarare hodde, "Tũwara ãr hãse kiyolla aiššo, tũwara to hingša gori ãre hentu dũrai dila?"<verse eid="GEN 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28"/>Hitara hodde, "Ãra foriškar gori dekir ze <char style="nd">Mabud</char> tor fũwati ase; hetolla ãra baffilam ze 'tui edde ãrar maze uggwa wada sukti takon zoruri.' Aio, ãra tor loi hosom hái, <verse eid="GEN 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29"/>ãra zendilla šude tor balai bade hono hoti no gori edde tore šanti gori bidai dilam, hendilla tui o ãrar hono hoti no goribi. Ar ehon tore <char style="nd">Mabude</char> rahamot goijje."<verse eid="GEN 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30"/>Toi Isake hitaralla hánar entezam goijje, edde hitara há fiye goijje. <verse eid="GEN 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31"/>Tarfordin binna sore uṛi ekzon loi ekzone hosom háiye. Bade Isake hitarare bidai diye, ar hitara šanti gori hentu baisa diye.<verse eid="GEN 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32"/>He din Isakor gulam okkol aiyore hitarar kuijja uggwa kuwar babute Isakore hoiye. Hitara hodde, "Ãra fani faiyi!" <verse eid="GEN 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33"/>Hibaye hibare nam diye Šeba. Hetolla he šohoror nam aijo foijjonto Beer-Šeba.<verse eid="GEN 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34"/>Ar Išor boyoš sališ bosor oiyede šomot, Hetittiyo Beerir zi Yudit, edde Hetittiyo Elonor zi Bašmathore o, biya goijje. <verse eid="GEN 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35"/>Ar hitara Isak edde Rebekar zibonore tita gori tuillil.<verse eid="GEN 26:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27"/>
  <para style="s">Isakore Yakubor duwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1"/>Isak zẽtte bura oiye edde sukor zuti eto homi giyegoi hiba ar suke deki no farito, hibaye hibar ḍõr fut Išore ḍaikke edde hodde, "Ãr fut."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">Hite hodde, "Oto ãi eṛe."<verse eid="GEN 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2"/>Toi Isake hodde, "Sa, ãi bura oiyi ar hon din ãr moron o ãi no zani. <verse eid="GEN 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3"/>Tor zontrofati, tir edde hanḍa loi maṛot za edde ãlla kissu šiyar gori an. <verse eid="GEN 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4"/>Ãi foson goride hendilla kissu bana, edde ãlla an, ãi haiyum, toi zene ãi moribar age tore ãi duwa gori fari."<verse eid="GEN 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5"/>Isake hibar fut Iš loi hota hodde Rebekaye fuinne. Toi zehon Iše maṛottu šiyar gori anibolla giye, <verse eid="GEN 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6"/>Rebekaye hibar fut Yakubore hodde, "Sa, ãi tor bafe tor bái Išore endilla hodde funni, <verse eid="GEN 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7"/>'Ãlla kissu šiyar gori an edde ai foson goride hendilla kissu háibolla bana, toi zene ãi moribar age <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> sarme tore duwa di fari.' <verse eid="GEN 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8"/>Hetolla oh fut, ãi tore ehon zen goitto hoir hũšiyare fun: <verse eid="GEN 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9"/>Tui zai zakottu barik duwa soolor so ãre ani de, toi zene ãi tor bafe zendilla foson gore hendilla mozar kissu hána tiyar gori fari. <verse eid="GEN 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10"/>Tarfore tui hinore tor bafe háibolla hibar hãse loizabi, zene hiba moribar age tore hibar duwa di fare."<verse eid="GEN 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11"/>Yakube hibar ma Rebekare hodde, "So, ãr bái Iš ekzon kẽšša manuš, ar ãi kẽš sara. <verse eid="GEN 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12"/>Ãr bafe zodi ãre sue edde tuwai fa ze ãi hibare dúha dir, henoile ãi nizor uwore duwattuwaro bodduwa ḍaki aniyum."<verse eid="GEN 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13"/>Hibar maye hodde, "Oh fut, tor he bodduwa ãr uwore forok, bolke tui ãi ziyan hoir hiyan gor, zaiyore hingun ãlla ani de."<verse eid="GEN 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14"/>Tarfore Yakube zai hin loi mar hãse loigiye. Toi Yakubor bafe zendilla foson goitto, maye hendilla mozar hána tiyar goijje. <verse eid="GEN 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15"/>Ar górot hibar ḍõr fut Išor ze šundor horsuwor aššil, Rebekaye hin loi hibar šoṛo fut Yakubore findai diye. <verse eid="GEN 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16"/>Yakubor hatot edde golat zeṛe kẽš nuwaššil, heṛe hibaye soolor sam berai diye. <verse eid="GEN 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17"/>Tarfore nize banaiyede mozar hána edde ruṭi Yakubor hatot tulidiye.<verse eid="GEN 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18"/>Bade Yakube hibar bafor hãse zai hodde, "Baba!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Isake zuwabe hodde, "Oto ãi, oh fut, tui honnuwa?"<verse eid="GEN 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19"/>Yakube hibar bafore hodde, "Ãi tũwar foila zormo Iš. Tũi ãre hoilade hendilla goijji. Meherbani gori uṛi boiyo, ãr šiyari gusto ho, toi zene tũi ãre tũwar duwa di faro."<verse eid="GEN 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20"/>Zuwabe Isake hibar futore hodde, "Tui in eto toratori kengori faili, oh fut?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Zuwabe Yakube hodde, "Tũwar <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Allaye milai diye."<verse eid="GEN 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21"/>Isake Yakubore hodde, "Ãi tore sui farifan ãr ḍake ai, tui soyi ãr fut Iš oi ne no zani sai!"<verse eid="GEN 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22"/>Yakube hitar bafor ḍake aišše, toi hibaye suiye edde hodde, "Abaz to Yakubor abaz, ar hat to Išor hat." <verse eid="GEN 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23"/>Hibaye hitare sini no fare, kiyollahoile báiyor hator ḍoilla Yakubor hat o kẽšwala aššil; toi hibaye duwa diye, <verse eid="GEN 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24"/>edde hodde, "Tui ki soiyi ãr fut Iš oi?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Yakube hodde, "Oi baba."<verse eid="GEN 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25"/>Toi hibaye hodde, "Toile hin ãr hãse an, ãi ãr futor šiyaror gusto hái, toi zene ãi tore duwa di fari."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:25">Toi Yakube hin hibar hãse loigiye edde hibaye háiye; ar Yakube hibare kissu šoraf ani diye edde hibaye fiye. <verse eid="GEN 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26"/>Tarfore hibar baf Isake hodde, "Oh fut, ikka ai, ãre suma de."<verse eid="GEN 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27"/>Toi Yakub hibar ḍake giye edde suma diye. Ar Isake hitar fušak fũiye edde endilla hoi duwa diye edde hodde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:27">"Ãr futor šugondi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:27">oilde en ek maṭor ḍoilla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:27">ziyanore <char style="nd">Mabude</char> rahamot goijje.<verse eid="GEN 27:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28"/>Allaye zen tore asmanottu kúwa de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">ar tor zobinot bol de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">ar beša beši gĩyu edde noya šoraf de.<verse eid="GEN 27:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29"/>Zati okkole tor gulam ok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">ar hokkol mainše tor sarme mata zuhauk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Tor báiyaindor uwore tui malik o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">ar tor mar futainde tore mata zuhauk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Tore zara bodduwa dibo, hitarar uwore bodduwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">Tore zara duwa goribo, hitarar uwore rahamot."<verse eid="GEN 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30"/>Isake Yakubore duwa diya šeš gori bade Yakube hibar baf Isakor sarmottu zaigoi mottor hibar bái Iš šiyar gori aišše. <verse eid="GEN 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31"/>Hibaye o mozar ziniš okkol tiyar goijje edde bafor hãse ainne, toi bafore hodde, "Baba, uṛo, tũwar futor šiyaror gusto ho, toi zene tũi ãre duwa di faro."<verse eid="GEN 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32"/>Hibar baf Isake hibare hodde, "Tui honnuwa?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Hibaye hodde, "Ãi tũwar foila zormo, Iš."<verse eid="GEN 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33"/>Ei hota funi Isak beša beši hafa šuru goijje edde hodde, "Toile šiyar gori ãlla šiyaror gusto annilde hiba honnuwa? Ãi tui aibar age hin háiyi edde hitare duwa difelaiyi, ar ehon hite rahamot faigiyegoi!"<verse eid="GEN 27:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34"/>Išye zehon hitar bafor hota fuinne, hite õraguzori hainde edde hitar bafore hodde, "Baba, ãre o duwa goro!"<verse eid="GEN 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35"/>Kintu hibaye hodde, "Tor báiye dúha bazi gori aiyore tor duwa hite loi giyegoi."<verse eid="GEN 27:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36"/>Iše hodde, "Etolla no ne hitar nam Yakub? Ehon foijjonto hite ãre dui bar dúha diye: Hite ãr foila zormor odihar loiye, ar ehon hite ãr duwa loifelaye." Tarfore hibaye fusar goredde, "Tũi ãlla ki hono duwa no rako ne ki?"<verse eid="GEN 27:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37"/>Isake zuwabe Išore hodde, "Sa, ãi hitare tor uwore malik goijji edde hitar guštir beggunore hitar gulam goijji. Ãi hitalla gĩyu edde noya šorafolla bondobos goijji, ehon ãi tolla ar ki gori fariyum?"<verse eid="GEN 27:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38"/>Iše hitar bafore hodde, "Baba, tũwattu ki šude ekkan duwa aššilde ne ki? Baba, ãre o duwa goro!" Toi Iše guzori hainde.<verse eid="GEN 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39"/>Toi hitar baf Isake hitare zuwabe hodde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">"Sa, tor bošoti oibo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">bol sara zobinot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">zeṛe no foribo asmanottu kúwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40"/>Ar tui toluwar loi basibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">ar tui tor báiyor gulami goribi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Kintu tui zẽtte odoizzo oi uṛos,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">tui hitar zũwal,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">tor handottu felaidibi."<verse eid="GEN 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41"/>Ar Yakubore hibar bafe duwa dil boli Iše hibare hingša goijje. Ar Iše mone mone hodde, "Ãr bafolla šuk goribar ṭaim hãsaiyegai; tarfore ãi ar bái Yakubore marifelaiyum."<verse eid="GEN 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42"/>Toi Rebekaye zehon hibar ḍõr fut Išor hota zani faijje, hibaye hibar šoṛo fut Yakubor hãse hóbor defeṛaiye, hodde, "Fun, tor bái Iše tore marifelaibar ereda loi nizore šantona der. <verse eid="GEN 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43"/>Hetolla oh fut, tũi ãr hota fun: Uṭ, tui ehon Haranot ãr bái Labonor heṛe dái zagoi. <verse eid="GEN 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44"/>Hoto din tui heṛe takgoi, tor báiyor rag homi no zagoi foijjonto, <verse eid="GEN 27:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45"/>ar hitar rag gilegoi edde tui ziyan goijjos hiyan hite foraifelaile, ãi hóbor defeṛaiyum edde hentu tore loi aniyum. Ãi ekkui dinot tũwara dunizonore kiyolla haraitam?"<verse eid="GEN 27:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46"/>Bade Rebekaye Isakore hodde, "Ei Hetittiyo mayafuwaingunolla buli ãttu ar basi taito mone no hor. Heṛe uwore zodi Yakube o ei dešor hono Hetittiyo mayafuware biya gore toile ãi basi taki ki lab oibo?"<verse eid="GEN 27:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1"/>Toi Isake Yakubore ḍaikke edde duwa goijje, ar hibaye endilla hokum diye: "Tui Kenaniyo hono mayafuware biya no goribi. <verse eid="GEN 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2"/>Tui Paddan Aramot tor mar baf Betuelor górot za, heṛe tor mar bái Labonor hono ziyaindor butottu tolla ugguwa bou lo. <verse eid="GEN 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3"/>Šorbo-Šoktiwala Allaye tore rahamot gorok edde fólwala gorok edde barai tulok, toi zene tui ugguwa bout zatir šomaz os. <verse eid="GEN 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4"/>Ar hibaye Ibrahimor duwa tui edde tor fũwati tor bongšore dok, toi zene ze zagat tui ehon ekzon bidešitta hisabe takor, ziyanore Allaye Ibrahimore dil, hiyan tor šombotti oi fare." <verse eid="GEN 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5"/>Toi Isake Yakubore bidai diye, edde Yakube Paddan Aramot, Aramiyo Betuelor fut, Rebekar bái Labonor hãse giye, ze aššil Yakub edde Išor ma.<verse eid="GEN 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6"/>Iše zehon zanifaijje ze Isake Yakubore duwa goijje edde Paddan Aramottu hono ek maya fuwa biya goribolla heṛe defeṛaiye, edde hitare duwa goribar šomot hokum dil, "Tui Kenaniyo hono mayafuware biya no goribi." <verse eid="GEN 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7"/>Ar Yakube hitar baf edde mar hota mainne edde Paddan Aramot giyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8"/>Toi Išye buzi faijje ze Kenaniyo mayafuwain okkol hitar baf sukot hondilla horaf de hiyan. <verse eid="GEN 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9"/>Hetolla hite Ismailor heṛe giye, edde dui bou bade hite Ibrahimor fut Ismailor zi, Nebayotor boin, Mahalathore biya goijje.<verse eid="GEN 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakubor šoppon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10"/>Ar Yakub Beer-Šebattu niyoliyore Haranor mikka giye. <verse eid="GEN 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11"/>Ar hono ek zagat fõsi bade heṛe rait haṛaiye, kiyollahoile beil góillegoi. Toi hibaye hentu ugguwa fattor loiye, edde matar tole diyore gum zaibolla neiṭṭe. <verse eid="GEN 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12"/>Toi Yakube šopponot dekedde, duniyair uwore ekkan hãṭṭa uwa oi roiye, ar hiyanor uworor mata asman suiye, ar so, hiyan bai Allar firista okkol uṛa lama gorer. <verse eid="GEN 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13"/>Ar <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hiyanor uwore tiyaiye edde hodde: "Ãi <char style="nd">Mabud</char>, tor baf Ibrahimor edde Isakor Allah. Tui zeṛe neṛi roiyos he zaga hiyanore ãi tore edde tor bongšore diyum. <verse eid="GEN 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14"/>Tor bongšo okkol duniyair dúilor ḍoilla oibo edde fuk fosim edde uttor doine tor bongšo šiṛi zaiboi, edde tui edde tor bongšor duwara duniyair hár zatire duwa gora oibo. <verse eid="GEN 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15"/>Ar sa, ãi tor fũwati asi, tui zeṛe zaibi za, ãi tore rokka goriyum, edde ãi tore ei zagat loi aniyum; kiyollahoile ãi tore wada diyide hin goijja no oite ãi tore eri no zaiyumboi."<verse eid="GEN 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16"/>Bade Yakubor gum bainge edde hiba hodde, "Ei zagat hameka <char style="nd">Mabud</char> ase, ar ãi to iyan no zanitam." <verse eid="GEN 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17"/>Ar hibaye ḍoraiye edde hodde, "Ken ḍor lagede zaga iyan! Iyan ar kissu no, hameka Allar gór oibo, iyan oilde behostor geiṭ."<verse eid="GEN 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18"/>Tarfore Yakube binna sore uiṭṭe edde ze fattor hibaye matar tole dil hiba loi faiya ḍoilla gori buwaiye edde hibar uwore tel ḍaille. <verse eid="GEN 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19"/>Ar he zagar nam diye Betel, zodi o he šohorganor nam age Luz aššil.<verse eid="GEN 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20"/>Toi Yakube ek manoš goijje edde hodde, "Zodi Allah ãr fũwati take edde zeṛe zair he fõtot ãre rokka gore, edde ãre háibolla hána ar findibolla hoor de, <verse eid="GEN 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21"/>ar zodi šušondane ãi bafor górot firi aifari, toile ei <char style="nd">Mabud</char> ãr Allah oibo. <verse eid="GEN 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22"/>Ar ze fattor ãi eṛe faiyar ḍoilla tiya gorai raikki, hiyan Allar gór oibo, ar tũi za kissu ãre diba hinor doš bag ai tũware diyum."<verse eid="GEN 28:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29"/>
  <para style="s">Yakub Labonor górot fõisse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1"/>Bade Yakube zat roiye edde fuk mullukka okkolor dešot aišše. <verse eid="GEN 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2"/>Heṛe hibaye maṛot maze uggwa kuwa deikke, ar so, hibar ḍake tinnuwa berasoolor zãk luṛiroiye, kiyollahoile he kuwattu hinore fani fiyaito. Ar kuwawar mukot ekkan beši ḍõr fattor. <verse eid="GEN 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3"/>Ar heṛe zãk okkol beggun zẽtte dola oito, hitara kuwar mukor fattorguware algaiyore zãkore fani fiyaito. Tarfore hitara fattorguware abar uwafes loi kuwar mukot buwai dito.<verse eid="GEN 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4"/>Yakube soolsoroya okkolore fusar goredde, "Ãr báiyain okkol, tũwara hoṛiyar?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">"Ãra Harranottu" hoi hitara zuwab diye.<verse eid="GEN 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5"/>Yakube hitarare hodde, "Tũwara Nahuror nati, Labonore sino ne?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">"Oi, ãra sini," hoi zuwab diye.<verse eid="GEN 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6"/>Tarfore Yakube hitarare hodde, "Hiba bala asede no ne?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Toi hitara hodde, "Oi, bala ase, ar so, hibar zi Rahela berasoolor zãk loi aiyerwa."<verse eid="GEN 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7"/>Yakube hodde, "So, beil foitte ar bout deri ase, zanuwaror zãk okkolore ekottro goribar ṭaim aizo no o. Tũwara bolke tũwarar soolgunore fani fiyaiyore hinore abar soraito loizo."<verse eid="GEN 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8"/>Hitara zuwabe hodde, "Ãra hen gori no faijjum, zãk beggun ekottro no o foijjonto, toi kuwar mukottu fattorgan algaiyore ãra zãkore fani fiyai faijjumde."<verse eid="GEN 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9"/>Yakube ehono hitara loi hota hor, hen šomot Rahela hibar bafor berasoolor zãk loi heṛe aišše, kiyollahoile hiba aššilde soolsoroni. <verse eid="GEN 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10"/>Toi Yakube zehon hibar mamu Labonor zi Rahelare edde Labonor soolor zãkore deikke, hibaye ḍake zai kuwar mukottu fattorgan algaiye edde hibar mamu Labonor zãkore fani fiyaiye. <verse eid="GEN 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11"/>Bade Rahelare suma diye edde õraguzori handa šuru goijje. <verse eid="GEN 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12"/>Toi Yakube Rahelare hoil ze hiba hibar bafor egena edde Rebekar fut. Toi hibaye dũri giye edde hiyan bafore hoiye.<verse eid="GEN 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13"/>Ar Labone hitar boinor fut Yakubor babute funiyore, dũri hibar loi deha goitto giye, edde hibar loi ãzaãzi goijje, edde hibare suma diye, edde hibare hitar górot loi ainne, ar heṛe Yakube hitare in okkol beggun hoiye. <verse eid="GEN 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14"/>Bade Labone hibare hodde, "Soiyi tui ãr nizor ãḍḍi edde gusto."</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 29:14">Yakube Leah edde Rahelare biya goijje</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:14">Toi Yakub hitar górot ek maš taikke, <verse eid="GEN 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15"/>bade Labone Yakubore hodde, "Tui ãr egena buli ki bina muzoriye ãr ham goribi ne? Tore beton ki diya foribo ãre ho."<verse eid="GEN 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16"/>Labonottu duizon zi ase; ḍõrguwar nam Leah, ar šoṛowar nam Rahela. <verse eid="GEN 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17"/>Leattu aššilde šude duwa šundor suk, kintu Rahelar hara ga edde siyara, hár kissu šundor aššil. <verse eid="GEN 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18"/>Yakube Rahelare muhabbot goitto. Yakube hodde, "Tũwar šoṛo zi Rahelalla ãi hãt bosor tũwar gulami goijjium."<verse eid="GEN 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19"/>Labone hodde, "Ãi hibare oinno honokiyore diyattuwaro tor diya iyan ãlla aro bala oibo. Tui ãr hãse tak!" <verse eid="GEN 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20"/>Toi Yakube Rahelalla hãt bosor gulami goijje, ar hibattu hibar uwore muhabbotor zoriya hinore hibattu šude kissu dinor ḍoil laigge.<verse eid="GEN 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21"/>Tarfore Yakube Labonore hodde, "Ãr din šeš oiye, ehon ãr bou ãre do, ãi zene hiba loi taki fari."<verse eid="GEN 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22"/>Toi Labone heṛiyar manuš okkol beggunore ekkui fũwati goijje, edde ek hánar entezam goijje. <verse eid="GEN 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23"/>Ar hazinna zehon oiye, hite hitar zi Leare loi Yakubor hãse ani diye, toi Yakube hibar loi taikke. <verse eid="GEN 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24"/>Labone hitar bandi Zilpare hitar zi Lealla daima hisabe hibare diye.<verse eid="GEN 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25"/>Toi binna zehon oiye dekedde, hiba Leah! Toi Yakube Labonore hodde, "Tũi in ãr loi goijjode in ki? Ãi Rahelalla tũwar gulami goijjide, no ne? Tũi ãre dúha kene dila?"<verse eid="GEN 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26"/>Labone hodde, "Foila zormor age šoṛoware biya diya iyan ãrar ei zagar niyom no. <verse eid="GEN 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27"/>Tui ei biyar hãt dinna furon gor; bade aro hãt bosor gulamir bodole ãra tore šoṛoware o diyum."<verse eid="GEN 29:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28"/>Henot Yakube hendilla goijje, hãt dinna furon goijje, ar Labone hitar zi Rahelare o Yakubor bou oibolla diye. <verse eid="GEN 29:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29"/>Labone hitar bandi Bilhare Rahelalla daima hisabe hibare diye. <verse eid="GEN 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30"/>Yakube Rahela loi o taikke, ar hibaye Leattuwaro Rahelare beši ador goijje. Ar Yakube Labonor hãse aro hãt bosor gulami goijje.<verse eid="GEN 29:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakubor fuwain okkol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31"/>Bade <char style="nd">Mabude </char> zehon deikke ze Leare ador no gore, hibaye hibare hamil oi farefan gori diye, kintu Rahela baz oi roiye. <verse eid="GEN 29:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32"/>Leah hamil oiye edde ek futore biyaiye. Hibaye hitar nam raikke Ruben, kiyollahoile hibaye hodde, "<char style="nd">Mabude</char> ãr dukkore deikke; ebar ãr šuwamiye ãre hameka ador goribo."<verse eid="GEN 29:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33"/>Hiba abar hamil oiye, edde ek futore biyaiye, toi hibaye hodde, "Ãre ador no gorede hiyan <char style="nd">Mabude</char> funniye, hetolla hibaye ãre iba o diyede." Toi hibaye hitar nam raikke Simeon.<verse eid="GEN 29:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34"/>Hiba abar hamil oiye edde ek futore biyaiye, toi hibaye hodde, "Ebar ãr šuwami ãlloi bazi takibo, kiyollahoile ãi hiballa tin futore zormo diyi." Toi hibaye hitar nam raikke Levi.<verse eid="GEN 29:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35"/>Hiba abar hamil oiye edde ek futore biyaiye, toi hibaye hodde, "Ebar ãi <char style="nd">Mabudore</char> tarif goriyum." Toi hibaye hitar nam raikke Ehudah. Tarfore hibar fuwa biya bon oigiyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 29:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1"/>Rahelaye zehon deikke ze hibaye Yakubolla hono fuwain no biya, hibar boinor uwore hibattu hingša oiye. Hibaye Yakubore hodde, "Ãre fuwain do, ar no oile ãi moriyum."<verse eid="GEN 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2"/>Henot Yakubor gušša Rahelar uwore zoli uiṭṭe edde hodde, "Ãi ki Allar zagat ne, zibaye tor udorot fól diyare ošikar goijje?"<verse eid="GEN 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3"/>Toi hibaye hodde, "So, otiya, ãr bandi Bilhah hibar hãse zo, zene hibaye fuwa biyai ãr kulot de, toi zene ãi hibar duwara oile ãi o ma oi fari."<verse eid="GEN 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4"/>Toi hibaye hibar bandi Bilhare Yakubore ek bou hisabe diye. Yakube hibar hãse giye, <verse eid="GEN 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5"/>edde hiba hamil oiye, ar Yakubolla ek fut biyaiye. <verse eid="GEN 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6"/>Toi Rahelaye hodde, "Allaye ãr bisar goijje; hibaye ãr foriyad fuinne edde ãre ek fut diye." Hiyanor zoriya hibaye hitar nam raikke Ḍan.<verse eid="GEN 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7"/>Bade Rahelar bandi Bilhah abar hamil oiye edde Yakubolla dusora ek futore biyaiye. <verse eid="GEN 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8"/>Toi Rahelaye hodde, "Allar kutsi loi ãr boin loi kutsi doriyore ãi zitti." Hetolla hibaye hitar nam raikke Naftali.<verse eid="GEN 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9"/>Bade Leaye dekedde hibar fuwa owa bon oigiyegoi, hibaye hibar bandi Zilpare loi Yakubore ek bou hisabe diye. <verse eid="GEN 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10"/>Toi Lear bandi Zilpaye Yakubolla ek futore biyaiye. <verse eid="GEN 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11"/>Toi Leaye hodde, "Ki baggitta!" Toi hibaye hitar nam raikke Gad.<verse eid="GEN 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12"/>Bade Lear bandi Zilpaye Yakubolla dusora ek futore biyaiye. <verse eid="GEN 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13"/>Toi Leaye hodde, "Ãi hoto šuki! kiyollahoile zobuti okkole ãre šuki hoibo." Toi hibaye hitar nam raikke Ašer.<verse eid="GEN 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14"/>Ar gĩyu dade ṭaimot Rubene maṛot giye edde hodun dudim-sara faiye, zinore hite hitar ma Leare ani diye. Rahelaye Leare hodde, "Tor futor dudim-sarattu ãre olfo desena!"<verse eid="GEN 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15"/>Kintu Leaye hodde, "Tui ãr zamai hari loiyosde hiyane ki no o, ne? Ãr futor dudim-saragun o loifelaibi ne ki?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Zuwabe Rahelaye hodde, "Bala, tor futor dudim-sarar bodole Yakub aijja raitta tor loi takibo."<verse eid="GEN 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16"/>Toi Yakub zehon hazinna maṛottu górot aišše, Leaye bare niyoli hibar hãse zai hodde, "Tũi ãr hãse aiyo, kiyollahoile ãr futor dudim-sara loi tũware bara goijji." Toi he raitta Yakube hibar loi taikke.<verse eid="GEN 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17"/>Ar Allaye Lear foriyad fuinne, hibaye hamil oiye edde Yakubolla fãs lombor futore biyaiye. <verse eid="GEN 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18"/>Toi Leaye hodde, "Ãr šuwamire ãi bandi diyide hiyanor enam Allaye ãre diye." Toi hibaye hitar nam raikke Issakar.<verse eid="GEN 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19"/>Bade Leah abar hamil oiye, edde Yakubolla so lombor futore biyaiye. <verse eid="GEN 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20"/>Toi Leaye hodde, "Allaye ãre barik hadiya diye. Ehon ãr šuwamiye ãre šorman dibo, kiyollahoile ãi hiballa so futore zormo diyi." Toi hibaye hitar nam raikke Sebulun.<verse eid="GEN 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21"/>Bade hibaye ek zerfuwa biyaiye edde hibar nam raikke Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22"/>Allaye Rahelar mikka kiyal raikke; hibaye hibar foriyad fuinne edde hamil oi farefan gori diye. <verse eid="GEN 30:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23"/>Henot hiba hamil oiye edde hibaye ek futore biyaiye edde hodde, "Allaye ãr šorom loifelaye." <verse eid="GEN 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24"/>Hibaye hitar nam raikke Yusuf, ar hodde, "<char style="nd">Mabude</char> ãre aro ek fut dok."<verse eid="GEN 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakubor zanuwaror zãk bari uiṭṭe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25"/>Ar Rahelattu Yusuf zormo oi bade Yakube Labonore hodde, "Ãre bidai do, toi zene ãi ãr nizor dešor górot firizai fari. <verse eid="GEN 30:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26"/>Ar ãr bouwain edde fuwain zaralla ãi tũwar gulami goijji, hitarare ãre do, toi zene ãi zai fari; kiyollahoile tũi to zano ãi tũwalla hondilla haṛoni goijji."<verse eid="GEN 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27"/>Toi Labone hodde, "Ãi zodi tottu doyar nozor fai taki toile meherbani gori tak, kiyollahoile ãi goni sai zani faijji ze <char style="nd">Mabude</char> tor zoriya ãre rahamot goijje." <verse eid="GEN 30:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28"/>Hite aro hodde, "Tore beton hodun diya foribo tui ho, ãi tore diyum."<verse eid="GEN 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29"/>Kintu Yakube hitare hodde, "Tũi to nize zano ãi tũwalla hondilla ham goijji, ar ãr hatot tũwar zanuwaror zãkor abosta hondilla oiye. <verse eid="GEN 30:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30"/>Kiyollahoile ãi aibar age tũwattu ze hom šombotti aššil hin beša beši barigiyegoi, edde ãr zoriya <char style="nd">Mabude</char> tũware rahamot goijje, kintu ãr nizor gór okkololla hõtte hamai goriyum?"<verse eid="GEN 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31"/>Toi Labone fusar goredde, "Ãi tore ki diyum?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Yakube hodde, "Tũi ãre kissu no diyo; ãlla zodi ekkan ham goro, toile ãi tũwar zanuwaror zãk okkolore soraiyum edde hinore saiyum: <verse eid="GEN 30:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32"/>Aijja ãi tũwar hár zanuwar okkolor mazottu di zaiyum edde hinor butottu šoṛo ḍõr fuṛawala dag asede berasool edde sool, ar hala berasoolor so okkolore aleda gorito sai. Hin oibode ãr beton. <verse eid="GEN 30:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33"/>Tarfore zẽtte tũi ãre beton saibolla hazir oiba, hẽtte ãr soyiye ãr goba dibo. Toi šoṛo ḍõr fuṛawala dag naide hendilla hono berasoolor so zodi ãr zanuwaror zãkor butore fa gile, toile hin ãi suri goijji dora oibo."<verse eid="GEN 30:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34"/>Labone hodde, "Sa, toile tor hota mozin hendilla ok!" <verse eid="GEN 30:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35"/>Toi Labone hedin sitara faṛa soolgun edde dag asede faṛi sool okkol zedunor uwore dola aššil hin edde hala rongor berasool okkolore aleda goijje edde hinore hitar futaindor hãse zimma diye. <verse eid="GEN 30:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36"/>Ar Labone hite edde Yakubor maze tin dinor fõtor baisa foijjonto bebedan raikke, ar Labonor baki zãk okkolore Yakube lagar sorat roiye.<verse eid="GEN 30:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37"/>Bade Yakube liboni, luš edde armon gasor tottoza kẽsa ḍeila haṛi loiye edde hinor uwore sál tuliyore dag goijje, gasor ḍeila okkolor butoror dola deha zafan goriyore. <verse eid="GEN 30:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38"/>Toi hibaye he sál tuilla ḍeilagunore zanuwaror zãke fani fiyede zaga okkolot raikke, toi zene zãk okkol fani fito aile hin okkol šuza sarme fore. Zanuwar okkole fani fito aitode šomot zur zaito. <verse eid="GEN 30:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39"/>Ar hine ḍeilagunor sarme zur zaito, edde hine ze so okkol biyaito, hin sitara, ar no oile ḍõr otóba šoṛo dagwala oito. <verse eid="GEN 30:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40"/>Yakube soolor so edde berasoolor so okkolore aleda gori rakito, kintu faṛi sool okkolore Labonor boitta sitara edde hala sool okkolor mikka muk firabaito. Ebafe Yakube hiba nizolla ek soolor zãk gori felaiye, edde hinore Labonor zanuwaror zãk loi no miyaito. <verse eid="GEN 30:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41"/>Ar beši šoktiwala zanuwargune zene ḍeilar ḍake zur za, hiyanolla buli fani fiyede zagat maze zanuwar okkolor sarme he ḍeila okkol rakito, <verse eid="GEN 30:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42"/>kintu leṛa zanuwar okkol oile sarme no rakito. Henot leṛa zanuwar okkol Labonor, ar šoktiwala zanuwar okkol Yakubor oito. <verse eid="GEN 30:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43"/>Ar ei bafe Yakub kub beši tuwangor oiye edde hibattu zanuwar edde gulam bandi edde ũṭ gada beši oiye.<verse eid="GEN 30:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31"/>
  <para style="s">Yakub Labonor hentu dáigiyegoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1"/>Bade Labonor futainde endilla hodde Yakube fuinne, "Ãrar bafor hár kissu Yakube loifelaiye, ãrar baforgunottu hite ei šombotti okkol goijje." <verse eid="GEN 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2"/>Yakube Labonor siyarar mikka kiyal goijje, ar so, Labon Yakub loi agor ḍoilla nai.<verse eid="GEN 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3"/>Hetunot <char style="nd">Mabude</char> Yakubore hodde, "Tui tor bafor dešot tor egena okkolor hãse uwafes firizagoi, ar ãi tor fũwati takiyum."<verse eid="GEN 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4"/>Toi Yakube hóbor defeṛaiye edde Rahelare edde Leare maṛot hibar zanuwaror zãk asede heṛe ḍaikke. <verse eid="GEN 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5"/>Hitarare hodde, "Ãi tũwarar bafor siyarar sai buzi faijji ze ãr loi tũwarar baf agor ḍoilla nai, kintu ãr bafor Allah ãr fũwati ase. <verse eid="GEN 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6"/>Ar tũwara nize o zanode hota, ãi ãr hár bol šokti diyore tũwarar bafolla gulami goijji. <verse eid="GEN 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7"/>Tarfore o tũwarar bafe ãre ṭokaiye edde ehon foijjonto doš bar ãr beton bodol goijje, kintu Allaye hibare ãre hoti goitto no de. <verse eid="GEN 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8"/>Hibaye zodi hoito, 'dagwalagun oibo tor beton,' henot hár zãke dagwala so biyaito; ar zodi hoito, 'sitaragun tor beton oibo,' henot zãke sitara so biyaito. <verse eid="GEN 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9"/>Ei bafe Allaye tũwarar bafor zanuwaror zãkgun loifelaiye edde ãre diye.<verse eid="GEN 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10"/>"Zanuwaror zãk okkole zurzade musumot ãi ekbar šopponot suk tuli sailam ze sai sool okkolor uwore ze faṛa sool okkol uiṭṭe hin beggun sitara edde ḍõr šoṛo dagwala. <verse eid="GEN 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11"/>Tarfore Allar firistaye ãre šopponot hodde, 'Yakub.' Ar ãi hoidde, 'Oto, ãi eṛe asi.' <verse eid="GEN 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12"/>Toi hibaye hodde, 'Tor suk tuli sa, faṛa sool okkol zin zanuwaror zãkor uwore uṛer hin sitara, šoro ḍõr dagwala, kiyollahoile Labone tor loi goredde hin beggun ãi dekki. <verse eid="GEN 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13"/>Ãi he Betelor Allah, zeṛe tui ek kúṛar uwore tel ḍali diyore ãr hãse manoš goijjili. Uṭ, tui ehon ei deššanottu niyoli zagoi edde tui zormo oiyosde dešot uwafes firizagoi.'"<verse eid="GEN 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14"/>Toi Rahela edde Leaye hodde, "Ãrattu ki ãrar bafor góttu ehono mirazor bag ase ne? <verse eid="GEN 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15"/>Hibaye ki ãrare bidešitta hisabe no goner ne? Hibaye ãrare besifelaiye edde ãralla ze ṭiya diya oil hin hibaye háifelaiye. <verse eid="GEN 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16"/>Ei šombotti Allaye ãrar bafottu ãra edde ãrar futziyaindolla hari loiyede. Ar hetolla ehon Allaye tũware za kissu hoiye tũi hen goro."<verse eid="GEN 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17"/>Toi Yakube hibar fuwain edde bouwaindore ũṛor fiṛot tuli diye, <verse eid="GEN 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18"/>edde hibaye hibar hár zanuwar zãk šoho aro dusora dón šombotti zin Paddan Aramot hamail hin beggun o fũwati loiye, Kenanot hibar baf Isakor hãse zaiboilla.<verse eid="GEN 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19"/>Ar zẽtte Labone hitar berasoolor kẽš ãsaibolla gil, Rahelaye hibar bafor góror muttigunore suri goijje. <verse eid="GEN 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20"/>Ar Yakube Aramiyo Labonore dúha diye, kiyollahoile Yakube dái zargoide he babute o hoi no za. <verse eid="GEN 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21"/>Ar ebafe Yakubor za kissu aššil hin loi hiba hentu dái giyegoi, Fúrat hal farai giye edde Giliyad faharor mikka giye.<verse eid="GEN 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakubore Labone fisottu lorai giye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22"/>Ar tin din bade Labonore howa oiye ze Yakub dái giyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23"/>Toi hite hitar egena okkolore fũwati loiyore hãt dinor fõt foijjonto Yakubore lorai loigiye edde Giliyad faharot hibare lot faiye. <verse eid="GEN 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24"/>Kintu Allah raitta šopponot Aramiyo Labonor hãse ai hodde, "Hũšiyar, Yakubore bala horaf kissu no hois."<verse eid="GEN 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25"/>Ar zẽtte Labone Yakub loi dola oiye, hẽtte Yakube Giliyad faharor uwore ṭambu gãijjil, ar Labon edde hitar egena okkole o heṛe ṭambu gãijje. <verse eid="GEN 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26"/>Bade Labone Yakubore hodde, "Tui in ki goijjos? Tui ãre dúha diyos, ar ãr ziyaingunore larair bondir ḍoilla gori kiyolla loi aiššos? <verse eid="GEN 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27"/>Tui nizamot kiyolla dáiyos edde ãre dúha diyos? Tui ãre no hos kiyolla? Toi zene ãi tore kušir sãte gan, tobla edde bina bazaiyore bidai goritam. <verse eid="GEN 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28"/>Tui kene ãr nati edde ziyaindore suma dito foijjonto no dili? Tui endilla ham goriyore bekufai goijjos. <verse eid="GEN 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29"/>Tũwarar hoti goribar šokti ãr hatot ase, kintu gelde raitta tũwarar bafor Allaye ãre hodde, 'Hũšiyar, Yakubore bala horaf kissu no hois.' <verse eid="GEN 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30"/>Ar ehon tor bafor górot zaibolla oitofare tottu foran handedde hetolla tui ai giyosgoide, kintu ãr góror muttigun kiyolla sur goijjos?"<verse eid="GEN 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31"/>Yakube zuwabe hodde, "Ãi ḍorailam, kiyollahoile ãi baffilam, tũi zodi zurgori ãttu tũwar ziyaindore hari loi rakido. <verse eid="GEN 31:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32"/>Tũi zar hãse tũwar muttigun faiba, hitare marifela oibo. Ãr hár zinišfatir butore tũwar hono kissu takile tũwar egena okkolor sarme hin talaš gori loifelo." Asole Yakube no zanito ze, Rahelaye hin suri goijje.<verse eid="GEN 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33"/>Toi Labone Yakubor ṭambur butore edde Lear ṭambur butore ar dui bandir ṭambur butore góille, kintu kissu no fa. Bade hite Lear ṭambuttu niyoli aiyore Rahelar ṭambur butore góille. <verse eid="GEN 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34"/>Rahelaye kintu he muttigun loi zai ũṛor godir butore golai eriyore hibar uwore boi aššil. Labone hibar ṭambur hár zagat ataiye, kintu kissu no fa.<verse eid="GEN 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35"/>Rahelaye hibar bafore hodde, "Malik ãi tũwar sarme uṛi tiyai no farir boli tũi gušša no oiyo, kiyollahoile ãttu ehon mašik oiye." Hetolla Labone talaši gori bade o he muttigun tuwai no fa.<verse eid="GEN 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36"/>Iyanot Yakub naraz oiyore Labonore hosuri diyore hodde, "Ãr hosuri ki? Ar ãr oinnai o ba ki ze tũi ãre fise fise lorai aiššo? <verse eid="GEN 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37"/>Ar ãr hár zinišfati sai tũwar góror hono ziniš faiyo ne? Fai takile tũwar egena okkolor sarme rako, edde hitara ãra duni fokkor bisar gorok.<verse eid="GEN 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38"/>"Ei kuri bosor ãi tũwar hãse roiyi, eṛe butore bera sool ba soole hono so nošto no gore. Ar ãi tũwar soolor zakottu hono faṛa sool o no hái. <verse eid="GEN 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39"/>Enki fahari zanuware marifelaiyede hendilla hono zanuwarore o ãi tũwar hãse hono din no ani; edde he hoti ãi nize boššiyi. Ar hono zanuwar suri oigilegoi o hin din ok ba rait ok tũwara ãr hãsottu hotifuron loiyo. <verse eid="GEN 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40"/>Ãi dine fuijji ar raitta ṭanḍa faiyi, edde ãr sukottu gum zaitogoi. <verse eid="GEN 31:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41"/>Ei kuri bosor ãi tũwar górot roiyi, tũwar dui ziyolla soiddo bosor, ar so bosor tũwar zanuwarolla gulami goijji. Heṛe butore tũi doš bar foijjonto ãr beton bodolaiyo. <verse eid="GEN 31:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42"/>Ãr bafor Allah, ze Ibrahimor Allah edde Isakor Ḍor zodi ãr fokkiya no oito, toile tui ãre ehon hameka hali hate bidai goitta. Kintu Allaye ãr duk edde ãr hator mehennot deikke, ar hetolla hibaye gelde raitta tũware dõk diyede."<verse eid="GEN 31:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43"/>Toi Labone zuwabe Yakubore hodde, "Ei mayafuwain okkol ãr ziyain, ei fuwain okkol ãr fuwain, ei zanuwaror zãk oilde ãr zãk. Tui zin dehor in beggun ãr. Ehon ãr ei mayafuwain edde hitarattu oiyede fuwaindore ki goriyum? <verse eid="GEN 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44"/>Ai, tui loi ãi loi duni zone ekkan wadar sukti gori, ziyan tui edde ãr maze goba oi takibo."<verse eid="GEN 31:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45"/>Toi Yakube ugguwa fattor loiyore faiya ḍoilla gori tiya goraiye. <verse eid="GEN 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46"/>Toi Yakube egena okkolore hodde, "Tũwara o kissu fattor dola goro." Toi hitara fattor ani ugguwa ṭal banaiye, edde beggune hiyanor ḍake há fiya goijje. <verse eid="GEN 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47"/>Labone he fattoror ṭalguware nam diye Jegar-Šahaduta, ar Yakube hiyanor nam diye Gal-Ed.<verse eid="GEN 31:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48"/>Toi Labone hodde, "Ei ṭal oilde aijja tui edde ãr maze goba." Hetolla hiyanore Gal-Ed, <verse eid="GEN 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49"/>ar Mišfa nam raka oil, kiyollahoile hite hodde, "Ãra ekzon ar ekzonottu dure oiyumde hẽtte <char style="nd">Mabude</char> tor edde ãr uwore kiyal rake. <verse eid="GEN 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50"/>Zodi tui ãr ziyaindor loi horaf bebar goros otóba ãr ziyain takite oinno bou biya goros, zodi o hono manuš ãrar fũwati nai, kintu sais, ãi edde tui, ãrar maze Allah oilde goba."<verse eid="GEN 31:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51"/>Labone Yakubore aro hodde, "Ei ṭalguwa edde ei faiyawa, sa, ei tiya goraiya faiya, ziba ãi edde tor maze ãi buwailam. <verse eid="GEN 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52"/>Ei ṭal oilde ek goba edde faiya oilde ek goba, ze ãi ei ṭal farai tor hoti goitto no zaiyum, ar tui o ei ṭal edde faiya farai ãr hoti goitto no aibi. <verse eid="GEN 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53"/>Ibrahimor Allah edde Nahuror Allah edde hitarar bafor Allaye ãrar bisar gorok."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 31:53">Toi Yakube hibar baf Isakor Ḍor loi ek hosom háiye. <verse eid="GEN 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54"/>Bade Yakube he faharot ek kurbani diye edde hibar egena okkolore ek hánar dawat diye. Toi hitara hána háiye edde hitara heṛe rait haṛaiye.<verse eid="GEN 31:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55"/>Bade Labone binna sore uṛi nizor nati edde ziyaindore suma diye edde duwa goijje. Tarfore hite hentu giyegoi edde górot firi giyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 31:55"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32"/>
  <para style="s">Yakube Iš loi uwafes dola or</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1"/>Ar Yakube o nizor baisar uzu giye, edde Allar firista okkole hibar loi aiyore deha oiye. <verse eid="GEN 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2"/>Hitarare dekiyore Yakube hodde, "Itara Allar fouz okkol!" Hetolla he zagar nam diye Mahanaim.<verse eid="GEN 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3"/>Ar Yakube hibar ãgottu hóborguwa okkolore Seir elehat Edom maṛot Išor hãse defeṛaiye. <verse eid="GEN 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4"/>Yakube hitarare šikai diye, "Tũwara ãr malik Išore hoiye boli hoiba: 'Tũwar gulam Yakube hoiye: ãi Labonor hãse forbaš haiṭṭi edde etodin foijjonto heṛe aiššilam. <verse eid="GEN 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5"/>Ãttu goru gada sool berasool edde gulam edde bandi ase. Ar ãi ãr malike bala nozore saibo ei aša loi ãi ei hóborgan tũware hãse defeṛair.'"<verse eid="GEN 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6"/>Ar hóborguwa okkol Yakubor hãse firi aišše, hitara hodde, "Ãra tũwar bái Išor hãse gilam, ar hibaye o tũware fũwati sair šot manuš loi saito aiyer."<verse eid="GEN 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7"/>Toi Yakube beši ḍoraye edde dilot ouskus oiye, ar hibar fũwati aššilde hitarare edde hibar goru edde berasoolor zãk okkol, ũṭ okkolore dui grup goijje. <verse eid="GEN 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8"/>Toi hibaye hodde, "Iše zodi aiyore ek dolore hamela gore, ar ek dol ziba basi takibo hiba dái zaigoi faribo."<verse eid="GEN 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9"/>Toi Yakube hodde, "Oh <char style="nd">Mabud</char>, ãr fordada Ibrahimor Allah, ãr baf Isakor Allah, tũi zibaye ãre hoila, 'Tor dešot tor egena okkolor hãse tui firizagoi, ãi tor balai goijjium.' <verse eid="GEN 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10"/>Tũwar ei gulamor mikka ze hár rahamot edde imandari dehayo, hin hono kissur laikka ãi no, kiyollahoile uggwa hator laṛi loi ei Zordan farailam, kintu ehon ãttu dui dol oiye. <verse eid="GEN 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11"/>Aroz gori, ãr bái Išor hatottu ãre uddar goro, kiyollahoile ãi hitare ḍorai, ar zodi hite aiyore ãre edde ma-fuwaindore marifele. <verse eid="GEN 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12"/>Ar tũi to hoila, 'ãi tore balai goriyum edde tor bongšore doriyar balur renir ḍoilla beši goriyum, zin goni šeš gora no zaibo.'"<verse eid="GEN 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13"/>Toi Yakub he raitta heṛe rait haṛaiye, ar hibattu aššilde hinottu ek hadiya hisabe hibar bái Išolla loiye: <verse eid="GEN 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14"/>Dui šot sai sool edde kuriwa faṛa sool, dui šot miyala berasool edde kuriwa modda berasool, <verse eid="GEN 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15"/>so šoho dud dede hendilla tirišwa ũṭ, sališwa gai goru edde došwa bolod goru, ar kuriwa gadi edde došwa modda gada. <verse eid="GEN 32:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16"/>Bade hibaye hinore ek ekzon gulam okkolor hatot diye, toi hibar gulam okkolore hodde, "Tũwara ãr agottu farai zogoi, ar zãkor maze maze hoddur dur zaga farot raikko."<verse eid="GEN 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17"/>Bade hibaye foila zãkor hitare hokum diye: "Ãr bái Iš zodi tui loi deha o, edde fusar gore, 'Tui har gulam, hoṛe zodde, edde tor sarme asede in har?' <verse eid="GEN 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18"/>Toi tui hoibi, 'In tũwar gulam Yakubor, inore ek hadiya hisabe ãr malik Išor hãse faṭa oiye, so, hiba o ãrar fisottu ase.'"<verse eid="GEN 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19"/>Hibaye, dusora, tisera, edde aro oinno zara zãk loi zat aššil, hitara beggunore o hokum diye: "Iš loi deha oile tũwara o ekkui bafe ei hota hoiba. <verse eid="GEN 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20"/>Tũwara aro hoiba, 'So, tũwar gulam Yakub ãrar fisottu ase.'" Haron hibaye hodde, "Ãi ãr age ei hadiya okkol defeṛaiyore hibare šanto goijjium; toi bade ãi hibar siyara saiyum, oitofare hibaye ãre gosibo." <verse eid="GEN 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21"/>Toi hadiyagun hibar sarmottu fargora oil, kintu hiba nize he raitta dolor fũwati rait haṛaiye.<verse eid="GEN 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakubor kutsi edde hibar noya nam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22"/>Bade hiba he raitta uiṭṭe edde hibar dui bou, dui bandi edde hibar egaro futore loiye edde Jabbok gáṭ bai faraiye. <verse eid="GEN 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23"/>Hibaye hitarare hal fargorabai bade hibaye hibattu aššilde hár kissure far gorabaiye. <verse eid="GEN 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24"/>Toi Yakub heṛe eka roiye, edde ek zone hiba loi binna dol fohor ofan foijjonto kutsi doijje. <verse eid="GEN 32:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25"/>Kintu Yakubore hõṛai no farede dekiyore hibaye Yakubor kiyailor sunuti sai hamela goijje, ar henot hibar loi kutsi dorat Yakubor kiyailor sunuti zurattu niyoli giyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26"/>Toi hibaye hodde, "Binna dol fohor oiye, ebar ãre eride."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Kintu Yakube hodde, "Ãre rahamot no goro foijjonto ãi tũware zaito no diyum."<verse eid="GEN 32:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27"/>Toi hibaye hodde, "Tor nam ki?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Hibaye hodde "Yakub."<verse eid="GEN 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28"/>Toi hibaye hodde, "Tore ar Yakub ḍaka no oibo, Israil ḍaka oibo, kiyollahoile tui Allah edde manuš loi zuddo goijjos edde tui zittos."<verse eid="GEN 32:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29"/>Hetunot Yakube fusar goredde, "Meherbani gori, õnor namman ho."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Kintu hibaye hodde, "Ãr nam kiyolla fusar goror?" Toi hibaye hibare rahamot goijje.<verse eid="GEN 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30"/>Toi Yakube he zagar nam raikke Peniel, edde hodde, "Kiyollahoile ãi Allare sarma sarmi oi dekilam, tarfore o ãr foran baisse."<verse eid="GEN 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31"/>Bade hiba Peniel farai giyegoide šomot beil uiṭṭe edde hibar kiyailor sunutilla buli lenga šuru goijje. <verse eid="GEN 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32"/>Etolla iyan ehono foijjonto endilla ze Israili okkole kiyailor sunutir uwore ze gusto ase hin no há, kiyollahoile Yakubor kiyailor sunutir gusto sai hamela gora oil.<verse eid="GEN 32:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33"/>
  <para style="s">Išye Yakub loi deha goitto aišše</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1"/>Bade Yakube suk tuli saiye, ar so, Iš aiyer edde hibar fũwati sair šot manuš ase; hetunot hibaye fuwaingunore Leah, Rahela edde dui bandir hãse bag gori diye. <verse eid="GEN 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2"/>Ar hibaye age bandi edde hitarar fuwaindore agottu diye, tarfore fisottu Leah edde hibar fuwaindore, bade šešottu Rahela edde Yusufore diye. <verse eid="GEN 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3"/>Ar hiba nize hitarar agottu giye edde meṛit hãt bar mata niyuraiyore ijjot gori gori hibar báiyor hãse hazir oiye.<verse eid="GEN 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4"/>Toi Iše Yakubor loi dola oibolla dũri aišše edde Yakub loi ãzaãzi goijje, edde golat dori suma diye, ar hitara hainde. <verse eid="GEN 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5"/>Bade Iše suk tuli mayafuwain okkol edde fuwain okkolore deki fusar goredde, tor fũwati itara hontara?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yakube hodde, "Allar rahamote õnor gulamore ei futziyain okkol diye."<verse eid="GEN 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6"/>Toi bandi okkol edde hitarar fuwain okkole sarme zaiyore Išore mata niyuraiyore ijjot goijje. <verse eid="GEN 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7"/>Bade Leah edde hibar fuwain okkole sarme aišše edde mata niyuraiyore ijjot goijje. Ar šešottu Yusufe edde Rahela sarme giye, ar hitara o mata niyuraiyore ijjot goijje.<verse eid="GEN 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8"/>Toi Iše hodde, "Ãi ze dol okkol dekilam in kiyolla?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Hibaye hodde, "In ãr malikor nozorottu doya faibolla."<verse eid="GEN 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9"/>Kintu Iše hodde, "Ãttu beši ase, oh bái. Tottu zin ase hin tottu takok."<verse eid="GEN 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10"/>Yakube hodde, "No, ãi foriyad gori hoir, zodi ãi tũwar nozorottu doya faiyide o, toile tũi ãr ei hadiya goso, kiyollahoile ãi tũwar muk sa ãlla hiyan ãi Allar siyara saiyifan, ze tũi ãre kuši mone goisso. <verse eid="GEN 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11"/>Meherbani gori tũwar hãse ana oiyede ei hadiyagun goso, kiyollahoile Allaye ãre rahamot goijje, edde ãttu hár kissu ase." Ar Yakube beši foriyad goijje buli Iše hin goisse.<verse eid="GEN 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12"/>Toi Iše hodde, "Aio, ãra baisa di edde zai, ar ãi tor agottu zaiyum."<verse eid="GEN 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13"/>Yakube hodde, "Ãr malike to zano, ei fuwain okkol aizo gura, ar dudor sai sool edde faṛi berasool edde goru in okkololla o ãttu bafa foribo, ekdin o zodi itarare zoltigori loigile zanuwaror zãk okkol beggun morizaiboi. <verse eid="GEN 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14"/>Hetolla foriyad gorir, oh ãr malik, tũi tũwar gulam okkolore loi age zogoi, ar ãi ãr malikor hãse Seirot no fõsigoi foijjonto sarmor zanuwaror zãk edde fuwain okkolor ãṛar goti buzi aste aste aiššum."<verse eid="GEN 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15"/>Hetunot Iše hodde, "Toile ãr fũwati asede hentu manuš hodunore tor hãse raki zaito de."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Yakube hodde, "Hin kiyolla? Ãr malikor hãsottu ãi doya faiyi iyan ãlla beši."<verse eid="GEN 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16"/>Toi Iše he din Seiror mikka hibar baisar uzu firi giyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 33:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17"/>Ar Yakube baisa di Sukkotot zai nizolla gór edde zanuwar okkololla ho ekkan ura bainde, hetolla he zagare Sukkot ḍaka oiye.<verse eid="GEN 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18"/>Ar Yakub Paddan Aramottu niyoli aiyore hiba aramor sãte Kenanor Šekim šohorot aišše edde šohoror barkule ṭambu maijje. <verse eid="GEN 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19"/>Bade hibaye ze zagat ṭambu gãijje hiyanore ekšot rufar foiša diyore Šekimor baf, Hamoror futaindottu kini loiye. <verse eid="GEN 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20"/>Heṛe hibaye ekkan kurbangah tuille edde hiyanore El-Elohe Israil nam diye.<verse eid="GEN 33:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34"/>
  <para style="s">Šekim edde Dina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1"/>Ar Lear zi Dina, zare hibaye Yakubolla biyail, hibaye dešor mayafuwain okkol loi dola oibolla baire gil. <verse eid="GEN 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2"/>Ar he elehar šašon goroya, Hibbi Hamoror fut Šekime hibare deikke, hite hibare loi zaiyore hiba loi neiṭṭe edde hibar ijjot hani goijje. <verse eid="GEN 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3"/>Ar hitar dil Yakubor zi Dinar uwore foijje; hite hibare ador goijje edde hibar loi ador muhabbotor hota okkol hoiye. <verse eid="GEN 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4"/>Toi Šekime hitar baf Hamorore hodde, "Ei mayafuware ãr bou hisabe ani do."<verse eid="GEN 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5"/>Yakube fuinne ze hite hibar zi Dinar ijjot hani goijje, ar hibar futain okkol zanuwaror zãk loi maṛot aššil; hetolla Yakube hitara górot firi no aiye foijjonto nizam mari taikke.<verse eid="GEN 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6"/>Bade Šekimor baf Hamor šohorottu niyoli zai Yakub loi hota hoito aišše. <verse eid="GEN 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7"/>Ar Yakubor futain okkole oi hóbor funi mottor hitara maṛottu firi aišše, ar hitarar dile beši duk faiye edde guššaye oin oiye, kiyollahoile Yakubor ziyor ijjot hani goriyore Šekime Israilor loi ekkan ofomanor ham goijje, ziyan hitattu muṭe o goron nuwaššil.<verse eid="GEN 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8"/>Kintu Hamore hitarare hodde, "Tũwar he ziyor uwore ãr fut Šekimor foran fori taikke. Meherbani gori hitalla hibare hitar bou hisabe do. <verse eid="GEN 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9"/>Ar ãrar loi biya dola goro, tũwarar ziyain okkolore ãrare do, ar ãrar ziyain okkolore tũwaralla lo. <verse eid="GEN 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10"/>Tũwara ãrar fũwati bošoti goro; deš tũwarar sarme fori roiye, tũwara eṛe šodori goro edde dón šombottir malik o."<verse eid="GEN 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11"/>Ar Šekime Dinar baf edde báiyaindore hodde, "Ãr mikka tũwara rahamotor nozore so, ar tũwara ãttu ziyan saiba ãi hiyan diyum. <verse eid="GEN 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12"/>Ei bouwor mohorana edde hadiya tũwara zedun dabi goitto so goro, tũwara hodde mozin ãi diyum, to ei zuwan mayafuwaware bou hisabe do."<verse eid="GEN 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13"/>Šekime hitarar boin Dinar ijjot hani goijjilde hetolla, Yakubor futainde hitare edde hitar baf Hamorore dúha loi zuwab diye. <verse eid="GEN 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14"/>Hitara hitarare hodde, "Ãra ei ham gori no faijjum, ekzon azomi agoraiya manušore ãrar boinore diya iyan ãralla ekkan beši šoromor ham oibo. <verse eid="GEN 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15"/>Bolke ei ekkan ham gorile ãra tũwarar loi razi oi fariyumde: tũwara o zodi ãrar ḍoilla, tũwarar furuš okkole azomi gorao, <verse eid="GEN 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16"/>toi ãra tũwarare ãrar ziyaindore diyum, ar tũwarar ziyaindore o ãralla loiyum, ãra tũwar fũwati bošoti goijjum edde ek zati oiyum. <verse eid="GEN 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17"/>Ar zodi ãrar hota no funo edde azomi goraiya no o, toile ãra ãrar ziyore loi zaiyumboi."<verse eid="GEN 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18"/>Hitarar hota Hamor edde hitar fut Šekimor nozorot bala laigge. <verse eid="GEN 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19"/>Toi ei zuwan ze hitar bafor góror beši ijjotwala, hite hitara hoiyede hiyan furon goitte deri no gore, kiyollahoile Yakubor ziyor uwore hitattu beši mon foijje. <verse eid="GEN 34:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20"/>Bade Hamor edde hitar fut Šekime hitarar šohor geiṛot aišše, ar hitara šohoror manuš okkol loi hota hoiye. <verse eid="GEN 34:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21"/>Hitara hodde, "Ei manušgun ãra loi šanti, itarare ei dešot bošoti goitto do edde šodori goitto do, dešot to hitaralla o bout zaga ase. Ãra hitarar ziyaindore ãralla bouwain hisabe loi, ar ãrar ziyain okkol hitarare di. <verse eid="GEN 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22"/>Kintu ei ekkan ham gorile manuššune ãrar fũwati bošoti goribo edde ek zati oibo. hiyan oilde zodi ãrar fotti furuše hitarar ḍoilla azomi goraiya oi. <verse eid="GEN 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23"/>Ar hitarar zanuwaror zãk edde hitarar dón šombotti edde hár kissu ki ãrar no oibo ne? Hetolla aiyo ãra hitarar hotat razi oi, toi hitara ãrar fũwati bošobaš goribo."<verse eid="GEN 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24"/>Ar he šohor geiṛot gilde hár manuš okkole Hamor edde hitar fut Šekimor hota fuinne, toi šohoror hár furuš okkolore azomi gora oiye.<verse eid="GEN 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25"/>Tin din bade zẽtte hitarattu biš oiye, Dinar báiyain Yakubor dui fute Simeon edde Leviye hitara zar zar toluwar loi zai baza sara šohorot hamela goijje, hár furuš okkolore marifelaiye. <verse eid="GEN 34:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26"/>Hitara Hamor edde hitar fut Šekimore toluwar loi haṛifelaiye bade hitara Dinare Šekimor górottu bair goijje edde niyoli giyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 34:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27"/>Yakubor futainde mora okkolor heṛe aišše edde šohor luṭfat goijje, kiyollahoile hitara itarar boinor ijjot hani goijjil. <verse eid="GEN 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28"/>Hitarar goru, sool edde gada, aro za kissu šohoror butore edde maṛot aššil hin beggun itara loiainne. <verse eid="GEN 34:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29"/>Ar hitarar hár gura fuwain edde hitarar hár bouwain okkolore bondi goriyore, hitarar hár šombotti edde góror hár kissu luṭ goijje.<verse eid="GEN 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30"/>Toi Yakube Simeon edde Levire hodde, "Tũwara ei dešor bašinda Kenaniyo edde Perišiyo okkolor hãse ãttu bašfuṛefan goijjo edde ãre bifodot felaiyo. Ãttu manuš hom, ar hitara zodi ãr berudde ekottro oiyore ãre hamela gore, ãi edde ãr góror gušṭi ṭiya dongšo oiyum."<verse eid="GEN 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31"/>Ar hitara hodde, "Ãrar boinore hite beiššar ḍoil bebar kiyolla goijje?"<verse eid="GEN 34:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35"/>
  <para style="s">Yakub Betelot uwafes firi zargoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1"/>Bade Allaye Yakubore hodde, "Uṭ, Betelot zaiyore heṛe bošoti gor, ar tui tor bái Išor sarmottu dáigiligoide ṭaimot ze tore deha dil, heṛe he Allalla ekkan kurbangah tiyar gor."<verse eid="GEN 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2"/>Toi Yakube hibar foribar okkol edde hibar fũwati zara aššil beggunore hodde, "Tũwarar hãse ze hár bezatir mutti okkol ase hinore dur goro, tũwara paksaf o edde hoor bodolo. <verse eid="GEN 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3"/>Ar ãra uṛi, Betelot zai, ar ze ãr mosibotor dinot ãre zuwab diye edde ze ãi zeṛe giyi ãr fũwati taikke ãi he Allalla heṛe ekkan kurbangah tiyar goriyum." <verse eid="GEN 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4"/>Toi hitarar hatot aššilde hár bezatir mutti okkol edde hanor guwana okkol beggun hitara Yakubore diye, edde Yakube hinore Šekimot elun gasor tolat gãraifelaiye. <verse eid="GEN 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5"/>Tarfore hitara hentu baisa diye, ar heṛiyar sairo mikkar šohoror okkolot Allar torfottu ḍor lami aišše, hetolla Yakubor futaindore honokiye fisottu lorai no za.<verse eid="GEN 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6"/>Yakub edde hibar fũwati aššilde beggune Kenan dešot Lušot (ziyan Betel) aišše. <verse eid="GEN 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7"/>Heṛe hibaye ekkan kurbangah tiyar goijje, edde he zagar nam diye El-Betel, kiyollahoile báiyor hãsottu dáizaibar šomot Allaye Yakubore he zagat deha dil.<verse eid="GEN 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8"/>Ar Rebekar daima, Deborah entehal oiye edde Betelor baire elun gasor tole dohon gora oiye, hetolla he zagar nam diya oiye Allon Bakuth (handibar-elun gas).<verse eid="GEN 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9"/>Yakube Paddan Aramottu aizaigoi bade Allaye hibare abar deha diye edde rahamot goijje. <verse eid="GEN 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10"/>Allaye hibare hodde, "Tor nam Yakub, kintu tore ar Yakub no ḍaka no oibo. Tor nam oibo Israil;" ar hibaye hibar nam raikke Israil.<verse eid="GEN 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11"/>Toi Allaye hibare hodde, "Ãi Allah, he Šorbo-Šoktiwala; fólwala o edde bari uṭ. Tor butottu ek zati, oi, bout zati okkol aibo, ar tor bongšottu badša okkol oibo. <verse eid="GEN 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12"/>Ze deš ãi Ibrahim edde Isakore dilam hiyan ãi tore o diyum, ar tui bade tor bongšore diyum." <verse eid="GEN 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13"/>Toi Allah hibar hentu uwor mikka uṛi giyegoi, zeṛe hibaye hiba loi hota hoil hentu.<verse eid="GEN 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14"/>Toi Yakube ze zagat hibaye hibar loi hota hoiye hiyanot ugguwa fattoror faiya buwaiye, toi hibar uwore šoraf edde tel ḍaille. <verse eid="GEN 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15"/>Allaye ze zagat hiba loi hota hoil Yakube he zagar nam raikke Betel.<verse eid="GEN 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rahela edde Isakor moron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16"/>Tarfore hitara Betelottu baisa diye edde Efratot gólite ehono hoddur dure ase, hen šomot Rahelaye ek fuwa biyaiye, ar hibattu fuwa halasi oite beši hošṭo oil. <verse eid="GEN 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17"/>Hibaye fuwa biyar biš zehon aro beši oiye, hibar daimaye hibare hodde, "No ḍorais, ebar o tottu ek fut oibo." <verse eid="GEN 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18"/>Kintu hiba šeš niyaš felai mori zargoide šomot, hibaye hibar futor nam raikke Ben-Oni, kintu hitar bafe nam raikke Benyamin.<verse eid="GEN 35:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19"/>Toi Rahela mori giyegoi, edde Efrator (ziyan Betlehemor) fõtor hãsat hibare dohon gora oiye. <verse eid="GEN 35:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20"/>Yakube hibar hoboror uwore ugguwa fattor faiya buwaiye, ar hiyan ehono foijjonto Rahelar hoboror faiyar sinno ase.<verse eid="GEN 35:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21"/>Tarfore Israile baisa diye edde Migdol Edaror oḍakottu ṭambu gãijje. <verse eid="GEN 35:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22"/>Israil he dešot bošobaš goredde ṭaimot, Rubene zai hitar bafor bandi bou Bilhah loi gum giye, ar Israile hiyan fuinne.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 35:22"/>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakubor futain okkol</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakubottu baro fut aššil.<verse eid="GEN 35:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23"/>Lear futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:23">Yakubor foila zormo Ruben,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:23">Simeon, Levi, Ehudah, Issakar edde Sebulun.<verse eid="GEN 35:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24"/>Rahelar futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:24">Yusuf edde Benyamin.<verse eid="GEN 35:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25"/>Rahelar bandi Bilhar futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:25">Dan edde Naftali.<verse eid="GEN 35:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26"/>Lear bandi Zilpar futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:26">Gad edde Ašer.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 35:26"/>
  <para style="lf" vid="GEN 35:26">Itara aššilde Yakubor futain okkol zarare hiballa Paddan Aramot biyail.<verse eid="GEN 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27"/>Bade Yakube Mamre Kiryat-Arbat (hiyan oilde Hebronot) ze zagat Ibrahim edde Isak takito heṛe hibar baf Isakor hãse aišše. <verse eid="GEN 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28"/>Isak ekšo aši bosor basi aššil. <verse eid="GEN 35:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29"/>Tarfore hiba šeš niyaš felaiye edde morigiyegoi. Hiba furafuri zibon haṛaiyore edde bura boyošot entehal goriyore hibar fordada okkolor loi dola oiyegoi. Ar hibar futain Iš edde Yakube hibare dohon goraiye.<verse eid="GEN 35:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36"/>
  <para style="s">Išor bongšo okkol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1"/>In oilde Išor (mani Edomor) bongšor kahani.<verse eid="GEN 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2"/>Iše Kenanor ziyain okkolore hibar bouwain hisabe loilde oilde: Hetittiyo Elunor zi, Adah, Hibbi Šibiyonor natini edde Anar zi, Oholibamah, <verse eid="GEN 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3"/>ar Ismailor zi edde Nebayotor boin Bašemat.<verse eid="GEN 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4"/>Ar Išolla Adaye Eliphazore, Bašmathe Reuelore, <verse eid="GEN 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5"/>Oholibamaye Jeušore, Jalamore edde Korare biyaiye. Itara aššilde Išor futain okkol, zarare hiballa Kenanot zormo dil.<verse eid="GEN 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6"/>Bade Iše hibar bouwain, futain edde hibar góror hár kiyore, ar hibar goru sool edde hibar hár zanuwar okkol edde Kenan dešot hamaiyede hár kissure loiyore hibar bái Yakubottu dure ar ekkan dešot hãr oigiyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7"/>Hitarar šo šombotti eto beši aššil, hitara ekku fũwati taki no fare; hitara bidešitta hisabe takitode he zaga hiyane hitaralla fodai gori no fare, kiyollahoile hitarattu beši zanuwar zãk okkol aššil. <verse eid="GEN 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8"/>Hetolla Iše (mani Edome) Seiror fahari elehat bošobaš goijje.<verse eid="GEN 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9"/>In oilde Seiror fahari elehat asede Edomiyo okkolor fordada Išor bongšo kahani.<verse eid="GEN 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10"/>In oilde Išor futaindor nam okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:10">Eliphaz, Išor bou Adar fut, ar Ruyel, Išor bou Bašemator fut.<verse eid="GEN 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11"/>Eliphazor futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:11">Teman, Omor, Zepho, Gatam edde Kenaz. <verse eid="GEN 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12"/>Ar Timnah ze Išor fut Eliphazor bandi bou, hibaye Eliphazolla Amalekore zormo dil. In okkol aššilde Išor bou Adar natiyain okkol.<verse eid="GEN 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13"/>In okkol oilde Reuelor futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:13">Nahath, Serah, Šammah edde Mizzah. In okkol aššilde Išor bou Bašemator natiyain okkol.<verse eid="GEN 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14"/>Ar Šibiyonor natini edde Anar zi, Išor bou Oholibamar futain okkol oilde in okkol, zarare hibaye Išolla biyaiye:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:14">Zeuš, Zalam edde Korah.<verse eid="GEN 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15"/>In okkol aššilde Išor bongšor sordar okkol:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 36:15">Išor foila zormo Eliphazor futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:15">Sordar Teman, Omor, Sefu, Kenaz, <verse eid="GEN 36:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16"/>Korah, Gatim edde Amalek. In okkol aššilde Edomor Eliphazor bongšottu; hitara oilde Aadar natiyain okkol.<verse eid="GEN 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17"/>Ar Išor fut Reuelor futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:17">Sordar Nahath, Serah, Šammah edde Mizzah. In okkol aššilde Edomor Reuelor bongšottu; hitara aššilde Išor bou Bašemator natiyain okkol.<verse eid="GEN 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18"/>Ar itara oilde Išor bou Oholibamar futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:18">Sordar Zeuš, Zalam edde Korah. In okkol aššilde Išor bou Anar zi Oholibamar bongšottu sordar okkol.<verse eid="GEN 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19"/>Itara aššilde Išor (ziba oilde Edom) futain okkol, ar Itara aššilde hitarar sordar okkol.<verse eid="GEN 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20"/>Itara aššilde Horittiyo Seiror futain okkol, zara he eleha okkolot aššil:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:20">Lotan, Šobal, Šibeon, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21"/>Dišon, Ezer edde Dišan. Edomot Seiror ei futain okkol oilde Horittiyo okkolor sordar okkol.<verse eid="GEN 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22"/>Lotanor futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:22">Hori edde Hemam, ar Lotanor ek boin oilde Timnah.<verse eid="GEN 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23"/>Šobalor futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:23">Alvan, Manahath, Ebal, Šefu edde Onam.<verse eid="GEN 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24"/>Ar Šibeonor futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:24">Aiya edde Ana. Ite oilde he Ana, ze bošoti sara elehat hitar bafor gada soradde šomot he gorom fanir nal fail.<verse eid="GEN 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25"/>Anar fuwain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:25">Dišon edde zi Oholibamah.<verse eid="GEN 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26"/>Ar Dišonor futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:26">Hemdan, Ešban, Jitran edde Keran.<verse eid="GEN 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27"/>Ar Ezeror futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:27">Bilhan, Zavan edde Akan.<verse eid="GEN 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28"/>Ar Dišanor futain okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:28">Uz edde Aran.<verse eid="GEN 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29"/>In okkol oilde Horittiyo okkolor sordar okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:29">Lotan, Šobal, Šibeon, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30"/>Dišon, Ezer edde Dišan.</para>
  <para style="lf" vid="GEN 36:30">Itara oilde Seirot hitarar dol okkol mozin Horittiyo sordar okkol.<verse eid="GEN 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Edomot badša okkolor šašon</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31"/>Israili okkolore hono badšaye šašon goribar age itara oilde he badša okkol, zara Edomot šašon goijje:<verse eid="GEN 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32"/>Beuror fut Belaye Edomot šašon goitto, hitar šohoror nam oil Dinhabah.<verse eid="GEN 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33"/>Bela mori bade hitar zagat Bozrattu Serar fut Jobabe šašon goijje.<verse eid="GEN 36:33"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34"/>Jobab mori bade hitar zagat Temanottu Hušame šašon goijje.<verse eid="GEN 36:34"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35"/>Hušam mori bade hitar zagat Bedador fut Hadad, ze Muwabor maṛot Midiyaniyo okkolore hõṛaifelail, hite šašon goijje. Hitar šohoror nam oil Avith.<verse eid="GEN 36:35"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36"/>Hadad mori bade hitar zagat Masrekattu Samlaye šašon goijje.<verse eid="GEN 36:36"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37"/>Samlah mori bade hitar zagat hal hãsar Rehabotittu Šaule šašon goijje.<verse eid="GEN 36:37"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38"/>Šaul mori bade hitar zagat Akboror fut Baal-Hanane šašon goijje.<verse eid="GEN 36:38"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39"/>Ar Akboror fut Baal-Hanan mori bade hitar zagat Hadade šašon goijje. Hitar šohoror nam oil Pai, ar hitar bouwor nam aššil Matredor zi Mehetabel, ze Mesahabor natini.<verse eid="GEN 36:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40"/>In okkol aššilde Išor bongšottu sordar okkol, hitarar gušti mozin, hitara takitode zaga mozin, hitarar nam okkol oilde:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 36:40">Timna, Alvah, Jetheth,<verse eid="GEN 36:40"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41"/>Oholibamah, Elah, Pinon,<verse eid="GEN 36:41"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42"/>Kenaz, Teman, Mibsar,<verse eid="GEN 36:42"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43"/>Magdiel edde Iram.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 36:43"/>
  <para style="lf" vid="GEN 36:43">Itara aššilde Edomor sordar okkol (Edom oilde Iš, Edomiyo okkolor baf) ze deš okkolot ze zar zar bošoti mozin.<verse eid="GEN 36:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37"/>
  <para style="ms1">Yusuf edde hitar báiyain</para>
  <para style="s">Yusufor šoppon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1"/>Yakub Kenan dešot taka šuru goijje, ze dešot hibar baf bidešitta hisabe takkil.<verse eid="GEN 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2"/>In oilde Yakubor bongšor kahani.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 37:2"/>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Yusuf, ek hõtoro bosojja zuwan, báiyaindor fũwati soolor zãk okkol soraito; hiba gura bafor bouwain Bilhah edde Zilpar futaindor fũwati takito, edde hitarar ku-asaror babute hóbor bafor hãse anito.<verse eid="GEN 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3"/>Israile hibar fuwain beggunottuwaro Yusufore beši ador gorito, kiyollahoile hite aššilde hibar bura halor fut; hitare ugguwa lamba kuruta banai dil. <verse eid="GEN 37:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4"/>Hitarar bafe Yusufore hitarattuwaro beši ador gorede dekiyore, hitare ingša gorito edde hitar loi hono hota šundor gori hoi no farito.<verse eid="GEN 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5"/>Bade Yusufe ek šoppon deikke, edde hin zehon hitar báiyaindore hoiye, hitara Yusufore aro beši ingša goijje. <verse eid="GEN 37:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6"/>Hibaye hitarare hodde, "Funo, ãi ekkan šoppon dekki: <verse eid="GEN 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7"/>So, ãra gĩyũ kũṛat tara bandir, ar so, ãr tarawa uṛi tiyaiye, ar tũwarar taragune ãr tarawar sairo ḍakottu tiyaiyore hibare soida goijje."<verse eid="GEN 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8"/>Toi hitar báiyainde hitare hodde, "Tui ki hãsa ãrar uwore razagiri goribi? Tui ki hãsa ãrar uwore šašon solaibi?" Hitar šoppon edde hotalla buli hitara hitare aro beši ingša goijje.<verse eid="GEN 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9"/>Bade Yusufe aro ekkan šoppon deikke, edde hiyanore hitar báiyaindore hoiye. Hite hodde, "So, ãi aro ekkan šoppon dekilam, ar so, beile, sande edde egarowa taraye ãre soida goredde dekilam."<verse eid="GEN 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10"/>Hite zehon hitar bafore edde báiyaindore hoiye, bafe hitare dõk diye edde hodde, "Tui in hondilla šoppon dekkili? Ãi, tor ma edde tor báiyain okkol, beggune aiyore ki hãsa tor sarme meṛit soida foijjum?" <verse eid="GEN 37:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11"/>Hitar báiyainde hitar loi riš gora šuru goijje, kintu hitar bafe he hota monot rakidiye.<verse eid="GEN 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufore báiyainde besifelaiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12"/>Ek bar Yusufor báiyainde Šekimot hitarar bafor soolor zãk soraito giye, <verse eid="GEN 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13"/>toi Israile Yusufore hodde, "Tor báiyainde Šekimot soolor zãk soradde no ne? Ikka ai, ãi tore hitarar hãse defeṛai."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Yusufe hodde, "Oto, ãi aišši."<verse eid="GEN 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14"/>Toi bafe hodde, "Tui zaiyore tor báiyain edde soolor zãkgun ken ase nai sagoi, edde aiyore ãr hãse zanais." Toi hibaye hitare Hebronor ḍeilottu defeṛaiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Yusuf Šekimot fõsiyore, <verse eid="GEN 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15"/>ekzon manuše hitare lot faiye, ar so, maṛot gura fira goredde dekiyore he manušwaye fusar goredde: "Tui kiyor talaš gorodde?"<verse eid="GEN 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16"/>Yusufe hodde, "Ãi ãr báiyaindor talaš goridde, meherbani gori ãre ekka ho, hitara goru sool hoṛe sorar?"<verse eid="GEN 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17"/>Manušwaye hodde, "Hitara entu giyegoi. Ãi hitara 'Aio, ãra Dotanot zai' hen hodde funnilam."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:17">Toi Yusufe báiyaindor talašot Dotanot giye, heṛe hitarar lot faiye. <verse eid="GEN 37:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18"/>Hitara Yusuf aiyedde durottu loti deikke edde hitarar hãse no fõsibar agottu, hitara hitare marifelaibolla felain goijje.<verse eid="GEN 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19"/>Hitara ekzonore ekzone hodde, "Oi so, šoppon dekoya aiyer! <verse eid="GEN 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20"/>Aio, ãra hitare mari felai, bade hono ek faṭkuwat felai di, bade hoiyum, hitare hono fahari zanuware hái felaiye. Tarfore hitar šopponor doša ki o saiyum."<verse eid="GEN 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21"/>Kintu Rubene zehon ei hota funniye, hitarar hatottu Yusufore basaito saiye. Hite hodde: "No, ãra hitare zane mari no felai, <verse eid="GEN 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22"/>lou no bayo; hitare eṛe bošotisara elehar ei faṭkuwat maze felai do, kintu hitar uwore hat no tuillo." Rubene endilla hoiyede oilde Yusufore hitarar hatottu basaibolla edde hitare bafor hãse uwafes firai loizai faribolla.<verse eid="GEN 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23"/>Toi Yusuf zehon báiyaindor hãse fõisse, hitar gat finda aššilde he šundojja lamba kurutawa faṛi kuli loifelaye. <verse eid="GEN 37:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24"/>Toi hitara hibare dori faṭkuwawat felai diye. Faṭkuwawa hali aššil, ar heṛe hono fani no aššil.<verse eid="GEN 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25"/>Tarfore hitara hána haito boišše, hen šomot hitara suk tuli saiye, ar so, Giliyad name ek zagattu ek dol Ismaili šodori goroya aiyer. Hitara ũṛor fiṛot gori kušbo mosolla, rezom edde duf, hin okkol loi Mišor dešot zadde.<verse eid="GEN 37:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26"/>Toi Ehudaye hitar báiyaindore hodde, "Báiware marifelaiyore lukai erile ãrar ki lab oibo? <verse eid="GEN 37:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27"/>Aio, ãra hitare ei Ismaili okkolor hãse besifelai, hitar gat hat no di, kiyollahoile hite to ãrar nizor bái, ek lou-gustor." Ar hitar báiyainde he hota fuinne.<verse eid="GEN 37:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28"/>Toi Midiyaniyo šodori goroya okkol zehon hitarar ḍake aišše, hitara Yusufore faṭkuwattu tuille ṭani tuille edde kuriwa rufar ṭiyar bodole hitare he Ismaili okkolor hãse besifelaiye, ar hitara Yusufore Mišorot loiainne.<verse eid="GEN 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29"/>Bade Rubene faṭkuwar ḍake firi giye edde dekedde Yusuf heṛe nai, henot hite nizor hor faiṭṭe, <verse eid="GEN 37:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30"/>hitar báiyaindor hãse firi giye edde hodde: "Fuwawa to nai, ãi hoṛe zaiyum?"<verse eid="GEN 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31"/>Bade hitara Yusufor kurutawa loiye, ar uggwa soolor so zorgorai he kurutaware louwot buraiye. <verse eid="GEN 37:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32"/>Toi hitara he lamba kurutaware hitarar bafor hãse defeṛaiye edde hodde: "Ãra iba faiyi. Tũi bala gori so iba tũwar futor kuruta oi ne naki no?"<verse eid="GEN 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33"/>Hibaye kurutawa sini faijje edde hodde, "Iba to ãr futor kuruta, hitare hono fahari zanuware hái felaiye. Yusufore hameka hanhan gorifelaiye."<verse eid="GEN 37:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34"/>Toi Yakube hibar nizor hoor faiṭṭe, kĩyailot salar šoṭ berai bout din foijjonto fuwalla šuk goijje. <verse eid="GEN 37:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35"/>Hibar hár futain edde ziyainde hibare šantona dito saiye, kintu hiba hono bote šanti no o, aro hodde, "Ãi šuk goitte goitte ãr fuwar hãse fatalot zaiyumboi." Ar bafe futolla handat roiye.<verse eid="GEN 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36"/>Ar eṛe Midiyaniyo okkole Yusufore Mišor dešot Feruwanor ofisar okkolor butore Putifar name ekzon fahardar okkolor soddaror hãse besifelaiye.<verse eid="GEN 37:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38"/>
  <para style="s">Ehudah edde Tamar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1"/>He šomot Ehudah hitar báiyaindor hentu zaigoiyore Odullom farat Hira name ekzonor hãse taka šuru goijjil. <verse eid="GEN 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2"/>Heṛe Ehudaye ek Kenaniyor zi loi deha oiye, zar nam aššil Šuah. Hite hibare biya gori hibar loi milon oiye; <verse eid="GEN 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3"/>ar hiba hamil oiye edde ek futore zormo diye, zare nam diye Er. <verse eid="GEN 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4"/>Tarfore hiba abar hamil oiye edde ek futore zormo diye, hitar nam diye Onan. <verse eid="GEN 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5"/>Hibaye abar ek futore zormo diye edde hitar nam diye Šela. Hite zormo odde šomot Ehudah Kasibot takito.<verse eid="GEN 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6"/>Bade Ehudaye hitar foila fut Erolla bou ainne, ar hibar nam aššil Tamar. <verse eid="GEN 38:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7"/>Kintu Ehudar ei foila fut <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> nozorot en horaf aššil; <char style="nd">Mabude</char>hitare mari felaiye.<verse eid="GEN 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8"/>Toi Ehudaye Onanore hodde: "Tor bái-bou loi milon gor edde hibar loi diyoror zimma fura goriyore tor báiyolla bongšo barai tul." <verse eid="GEN 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9"/>Kintu Onane zainto ze, he bongšo hitar nizor no oibo; hetolla hite zetobar hitar bái-bou loi milon goijje, hetobar hite hitar birz baire felai diye. <verse eid="GEN 38:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10"/>hitar ze ham goijje hiyan <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> nozorot horaf, hetolla <char style="nd">Mabude</char> hitare o mari felaiye.<verse eid="GEN 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11"/>Toi Ehudaye hitar futor bou Tamarore hodde: "Ãr fut Šela zuwan no o foijjonto, tui tor bafor górot zai rari hisabe takgoi." Kiyollahoile hite baiffe, "hitar báiyaindor ḍoilla morizaiboi." Toi Tamar hibar bafor górot takibolla giyegoi goijje.<verse eid="GEN 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12"/>Iyar bout din bade Ehudar bou, Šuar zi, mori giyegoi. Ehudaye hiballa šuk gorattu aram oi bade, hitar Odullom farar bondu Hirar fũwati Timnah farat soolor kẽš ãsoya okkolor heṛe giye.<verse eid="GEN 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13"/>Hono ekzone Tamarore hoiye, "Sa, tor houre hitar soolore kẽš ãsaibolla Timnah fara zar." <verse eid="GEN 38:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14"/>Henot hibaye hibar rarir hoor kulifelaiyore mukot guwaṛa diye edde gat hoor beraiyore hiba Enaim golede rastar muk, ziyan Timnah fara za rastat, heṛe boi taikkegoi, kiyollahoile hibaye deikke ze, Šela zuwan oiye, tarfore o kintu hibare hitalla bou no bana.<verse eid="GEN 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15"/>Toi Ehudaye hibare deikke edde hite hiba ek beišša maya fuwa mone goijje, kiyollahoile hibar muk guijja aššil. <verse eid="GEN 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16"/>Toi hite rastar hãsat hibar ḍake giye edde hodde: "Ai, ãi tor hãse zai" kiyollahoile hite no zanito ze hiba hitar futor bou.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Hibaye: "Ãr hãse zaito dile tũi ki diba?"<verse eid="GEN 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17"/>Toi hite hodde: "Ãi tolla zakottu uggwa soolor so defeṛaiyum."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Hibaye, "Hiba no defeṛo foijjonto ki tũi ãr hãse hono kissu bondok hisabe diba ne?"<verse eid="GEN 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18"/>Hite hodde, "Ãi tor hãse bondok ki ditam?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Hibaye hodde: "Fũta šoho ei silmohor edde tũwar hator ašawa." Toi hite hin hibare diyore hibar hãse giye edde hiba hamil oiye. <verse eid="GEN 38:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19"/>Tarfore hiba uiṭṭe edde giyegoi, bade hibaye hibar gũwaṛa loifelaiye edde abar hibar rarir fušak finde.<verse eid="GEN 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20"/>Toi oi mayafuwar hatottu bondok surai anibolla Ehudaye hitar Odullom farar bondur di uggwa soolor so defeṛaiye, kintu hite hibare tuwai no fa. <verse eid="GEN 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21"/>Hite heṛiyar manuš okkolottu fusar goijje: "Enaimor fõtor hãsat ze mondir-beišša aššil, hiba hoṛe?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Hitara hodde, "Eṛe heṛiyar hono mondir-beišša nu aiye."<verse eid="GEN 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22"/>Toi hite Ehudar hãse uwafes firigiye edde hodde, "Ãi hibare tuwai no fai, ar heṛiyar mainše o hoiye, 'Eṛe heṛiyar hono beišša mayafuwa nu aššil.'"<verse eid="GEN 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23"/>Toi Ehudaye hodde: "Hibar hãse zin ase hin hibaye lok, ar no oilede ãra šormot foriyum, sa, ãi to hiballa ei soolor sowa defeṛailam, kintu tui hibare tuwai no faili."<verse eid="GEN 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24"/>Onumanik tin maš bade Ehudare howa oiye, "Tor futor bou Tamar beiššagiri gorer, ar so, hiyanor zoriya hiba ehon hamil"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Ehudaye hodde, "Hibare baire ano edde hibare furaidifelo."<verse eid="GEN 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25"/>Hibare baire ana odde šomot, hibaye hibar houror hãse endilla hoi defeṛaiye, "Ei zinišgun zar, he manušwar duwara ãi hamil oiyi," hibaye aro hodde, "Fũta, silmohor edde laṛi in okkol har so."<verse eid="GEN 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26"/>Ehudaye hinore sini faijje edde hodde, "Hiba ãttuwaro beši forhesgar, kiyollahoile ãi hibare ãr fut Šelare no di." Ar Ehudah dusorabar honodin hibar hãse no.<verse eid="GEN 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27"/>Ar hibaye fuwa biyaibar šomoi zehon aišše, ar so, hibar feṛot zoikka fuwain. <verse eid="GEN 38:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28"/>Hibaye biyadde šomot hitarar butottu ekzone hitar niyolai diye; henot daimaye dori hitar hatot lal rongor fũta bandi di hodde, "Ite foila niyoli aišše." <verse eid="GEN 38:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29"/>Kintu hite hitar hat butore ṭani loifelaye, ar so, hitar bái niyoli aišše, toi hibaye hodde, "Tui kene band bangi niyoli aili!" Ar hitar nam raka oiye Perez. <verse eid="GEN 38:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30"/>Tarfore hitar bái, zar hatot lal rongor fũta banda aššil, hite zormo oiye, hitar nam raka oiye Zerah.<verse eid="GEN 38:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39"/>
  <para style="s">Yusuf edde Putifaror bou</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1"/>Ehon Yusufore Mišorot loiza oiye, ar Putifar, ekzon Mišoriyo ze aššil razar hormosarir okkolor butottu ek hormosari, faharadar okkolor boro, hite Ismaili okkol zara Yusufore heṛe ainnil, hitarattu kiniloiye.<verse eid="GEN 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2"/>
    <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Yusufor fũwati aššil, ar hibaye hibare kamiyaf goijje, edde hiba hibar Mišoriyo munifor górot roiye. <verse eid="GEN 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3"/>Ar hibar munife dekedde <char style="nd">Mabud</char> Yusufor fũwati ase, ar hár kissu zin gorer hinot <char style="nd">Mabude </char> kamiyafi der. <verse eid="GEN 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4"/>Yusufe hibar munifor bala nozorot foijje edde hitar hãsor šeba goroya oiye. Ar Putifare Yusufore hitar gór edde hitar hár kissur uwore dehašunar bar diye. <verse eid="GEN 39:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5"/>Ar endilla oile, zẽtte oite hite gór edde hitar hár kissur uwore dehašunar bar Yusufore diye, Yusufor zoriya he Mišoriyowar górore <char style="nd">Mabude</char> rahamot goijje. Ar <char style="nd">Mabudor</char> rahamot Putifaror górot edde ketot, hár kissur uwore oiye. <verse eid="GEN 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6"/>Hetolla Putifare hitar hár kissur bar Yusufor uwore diye, šude hite háitode hánagun bade ar hono kissur babute sinta no goitto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yusuf aššilde sina ṭan edde siyara šundor zuwan, <verse eid="GEN 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7"/>Ar hoto din farai zai bade endilla oiye, hibar munifor bouwe Yusufor mikka kiya goijje edde hodde: "Ai, ãr bisanat ai."<verse eid="GEN 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8"/>Kintu hiba razi no o edde hibar munifor bouwore hodde: "So, ãr malikottu ei góror hono kissulla sinta gora no forer; hibar hár kissur bar ãr uwore saridiye. <verse eid="GEN 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9"/>Ei górot hiba udda ãttuwaro ḍõr no, hibaye šude tũi bade ar hono kissure mana no gore, kiyollahoile tũi hibar bou. Hen abostat maze ãi ken gori ettor ḍõr ekkan horaf ham goriyore Allar berudde guna gori faijjum?" <verse eid="GEN 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10"/>Hibaye Yusufore hendilla din bade din hendilla howat taikke, kintu Yusufe hibar hãse za otóba hibar fũwati owa hiyanot razi no o.<verse eid="GEN 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11"/>Ekdin endilla oiye, Yusuf hibar nizor hame góror butore giye, ar he šomot góror hono gulam goror butore nu aššil. <verse eid="GEN 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12"/>Toi hibaye Yusufor zubba sai doijje edde hodde: "Ai, ãr bisanat ai!" Kintu Yusufe hibar zubbawa hibar hatot raki dũri góror bair kule dáigiyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13"/>Ar hibaye zehon deikke ze Yusufe zubbawa hibar hatot raki dũri góror bair kule dáigiyegoi, <verse eid="GEN 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14"/>hibaye hibar góror gulam okkolore ḍaikke edde hodde: "So, hibaye ei Ibroni manušware ãrar loi tõša goribolla ainne! Ite ãr loi neṛibolla eṛe butore aišše, kintu ãi zure kiskisa maijji. <verse eid="GEN 39:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15"/>Ar hite ãr kiskisani funi hite hitar zubbawa ãr hãse raki dũri baire dáigiyegoi."<verse eid="GEN 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16"/>Toi hibaye Yusufor munif górot nu aiye foijjonto hibar zubbawa hibar hãse raki diye. <verse eid="GEN 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17"/>Bade hibaye hitare ei kahanigan buzaiye, hodde: "He Ibroni gulam zare tũi ãralla ainno, hite ãr hãse aišše ãr loi tõša goribolla. <verse eid="GEN 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18"/>Ar ãi zehon ãi zure kiskisa maijji hite hitar zubbawa ãr hãse raki dũri bair kule dáigiyegoi."<verse eid="GEN 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19"/>Yusufor munife hitar bouwor hota, zin hibaye hoiye, "Endilla ham tũwar gulame ãlloi goijje" funi guššaye oin oiye. <verse eid="GEN 39:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20"/>Toi Yusufor munife hibare loizaiyore ziyolot raikke, ze zagat raz bondi okkolore raka oito, heṛe, hiba he ziyolot bondi roiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:20">Ar Yusuf ziyolot roiyede šomot o, <verse eid="GEN 39:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21"/><char style="nd">Mabud </char> hibar fũwati aššil; ar hibaye Yusufore doya dehaiye edde ziyolaror bala nozorot forefan goijje. <verse eid="GEN 39:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22"/>Toi ziyolare ziyolot asede hár hodi okkolor bar Yusufor hatot gosaidiye, edde heṛe hitara hár has harbar zin gora oito, hin goroya aššilde hiba. <verse eid="GEN 39:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23"/>ar hibar hatot zimma aššilde hinor hono kissur mikka ziyolare no saito, kiyollahoile <char style="nd">Mabud</char> hibar fũwati aššil, ar hibaye zin gorat aššil, hinore <char style="nd">Mabude</char> kamiyaf ofan goitto.<verse eid="GEN 39:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufe hodi okkolor šoppon bangi der</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1"/>Iyar bade zai, Mišoror razar šoraf baṛidoya okkolor maziye edde ruṭibanoya okkolor maziye hitarar malik, Mišoror razar berudde hosuri goijje. <verse eid="GEN 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2"/>Feruwan šoraf baṛidoya okkolor mazi edde ruṭibanoya okkolor mazi, ei dui hormosarir uwore gušša oiye, <verse eid="GEN 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3"/>edde hitarare faharadar okkolor boror górot, zeṛe Yusufore bondi gori raka oiye, heṛe bondi gori rakkiye. <verse eid="GEN 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4"/>Faharadar okkolor boroye hitarare Yusufor hatot diye, ar Yusufe hitarar kermos goijje.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:4">Hitara bout din heṛe bondi taki bade, <verse eid="GEN 40:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5"/>Razar šoraf baṛidoya edde ruṭibanoya ze duizonore ziyolot raikke, hitara dunizone ekkui raitta ekzone ekkan ekkan šoppon deikke, ar hitarar ek ekkan šopponor ek ekkan mani aššil.<verse eid="GEN 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6"/>Tarfordin binna Yusuf hitarar hãse aiyore dekedde, ar so, hitarar nak muk beši andar. <verse eid="GEN 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7"/>Toi Yusufor fũwati Feruwanor ze dui hormosari hibar fũwati hibar munifor górot ziyolot bondi aššil, hitarare hibaye fusar goredde, "Õnorare saite aijja nak muk eto andar kiyolla lager?"<verse eid="GEN 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8"/>Hitara zuwab diye, "Ãra dunizone šoppon dekki, kintu hinor mani buzai dibolla hono kiye nai"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Yusufe hitara dunizonore hodde, "Mani buzai dibar šokti Allattu no o ne? meherbani gori šoppongun ãre ho."<verse eid="GEN 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9"/>Toi oi mazi šoraf baṛidoyaye Yusufore hitar soppongan funaiye, hite hibare hodde, "Ãr šopponot dekidde, so, ãr muntu ekkan ãngur lota, <verse eid="GEN 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10"/>ar hiyanot tinnwa ḍeila aššil. Ar hinot holi ai mottor ful fuiṭṭe edde hinot tũka tũka oiyore fona ãngur oiye. <verse eid="GEN 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11"/>Ar Feruwanor fiyalawa ãr hatot aššil edde ãi he ãngurgun loiyi, hinore Feruwanor fiyalat roš sibi loi fiyalawa Feruwanor hatot dilam."<verse eid="GEN 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12"/>Yusufe hitare hodde: "Iyanor mani oilde endilla, tinnuwa ḍeila oilde tin din. <verse eid="GEN 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13"/>Tin dinor butore Feruwane õnore šormane entu eri dibo edde õnor agor hamot õnore uwafes dibo, ar õne age zendilla hibar šoraf baṛidoya aššila, hendilla tũi Feruwanor hatot fiyala tuli diba. <verse eid="GEN 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14"/>Kintu zẽtte õnor balai oibo, foriyad gorir õne ãre monot raikko edde ãr uwore doya dehaiyo; ãr babute Feruwanore hoiba edde õne ãre ei górottu niyolaiba. <verse eid="GEN 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15"/>Kiyollahoile ãre Ibroni okkolor dešottu sur gori ana oiye, ar eṛe o ãi en hono kissu no gori ze hitarattu ãre gãtot raka fore."<verse eid="GEN 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16"/>Ruṭibanoya okkolor maziye zehon dekilo ze Yusufe šopponor bala mani hoiye, toi hite Yusufore hodde, "Ãi o ekkan šoppon dekkilam: So, ãr matar uwore tin ṭuri fiṛa ase. <verse eid="GEN 40:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17"/>Uoror ṭurit Feruwanolla banaiya hãr ḍoilla hana, ar faik okkole ãr matar uwore ṭurittu hinore hát roiye."<verse eid="GEN 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18"/>Yusufe hodde, "Iyanor mani oilde endilla, tinnuwa ṭuri oilde tinnwa din. <verse eid="GEN 40:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19"/>Tin dinor butore Feruwane õnor holla loibo edde gagan gasot zulai rakibo, ar faik okkole gusto háibo."<verse eid="GEN 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20"/>Bade tin dinor din Feruwan zormo dinot, hite hitar hormosari okkololla ek mela goijje. Hite he mazi šoraf baṛidoya edde mazi ruṭibanoyare hormosari okkolor sarme hazir goijje: <verse eid="GEN 40:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21"/>Hite mazi šoraf baṛidoyaware hitar agor hamot uwafes diye, toi hite abar Feruwanor hatot fiyala tulidiya šuru goijje. <verse eid="GEN 40:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22"/>Kintu he mazi ruṭibanoyare faši diye, zendilla Yusufe hitarare mani bangidil.<verse eid="GEN 40:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23"/>He mazi šoraf baṛidoyawaye tarfore o Yusufore monot no rake, hibare foraifelail.<verse eid="GEN 40:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufe Feruwanor šoppon bangi der</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1"/>Dui bosor farai zai bade Feruwane ek šoppon deikke: So, hite Nil doriyar farot tiyaiye, <verse eid="GEN 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2"/>ar so, doriyattu hãttuwa šundor edde boli goru uṛi aišše edde hóir bonot sora šuru goijje. <verse eid="GEN 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3"/>Hin bade aro hãttuwa bissiri edde leṛa goru doriyattu uṛi aišše, edde hine farot oinno goru okkolor ḍake tiyaiye. <verse eid="GEN 41:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4"/>Ar bissiri edde leṛa gorugune he šundor edde boli gorugunore háifelaiye. Toi Feruwan gumottu seton oiye.<verse eid="GEN 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5"/>Bade hite abar gumot foijje edde dusora bar šoppon deikke: Ar so, hãttuwa fuiṭṭa edde taza gĩyur sóra ekkan narat gozaiye. <verse eid="GEN 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6"/>Hin bade aro hãttuwa gĩyur sóra gozaiye, hin hĩṛa edde fukali bataše fúwaigilgoi. <verse eid="GEN 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7"/>Ar he hiṛa gĩyur sóra okkole oi hãttuwa fuiṭṭa edde taza sóragunore gilifelaiye. Toi Feruwan gumottu seton oiye. Hite buijjede hin šude šoppon.<verse eid="GEN 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8"/>Kintu binna razar monot ouskus oiye. Hite manuš defeṛaiyore Mišoror hár zadugor edde giyani okkolore ḍaki ainne. Feruwane hitar šoppon okkolore hitarare buzaiye, kintu honokiye hinor mani bangidi no fare.<verse eid="GEN 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9"/>Hetunot mazi šoraf baṛidoyaye Feruwanore hodde: "Aijja, ãr ekkan hosurir hota ãttu monot foijje. <verse eid="GEN 41:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10"/>Feruwan ekbar hibar gulam okkolor uwore ragigilgoi, edde hibaye ãre edde mazi ruṭibanoyare faharadar okkolor boror górot bondi gori rakkil. <verse eid="GEN 41:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11"/>Ek raitta ãra ekzone ekkan ekkan šoppon dekkilam, ek ekkan šopponor ek ekkan mani aššil. <verse eid="GEN 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12"/>Ehon heṛe ek Ibroni zuwan, faharadar okkolor boror gulam ãrar fũwati aššil. Ãra hitare ãrar šoppongun buzailam, ar hite ãrar šoppongun ãrare bangidil, ar zar zar šoppon hitare bangi dil. <verse eid="GEN 41:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13"/>Hite ãrare zendilla mani bangi dil ṭik hendilla goṭṭil: Ãre ãr hamot uwafes diya oil, ar utare faši diya oil."<verse eid="GEN 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14"/>Henot Feruwane Yusufore ḍaki anibolla defeṛaiye, ar hitara Yusufore toratori ziyolor gãtottu niyolai ainne. Hibaye sul dari hamaiye edde hoor bodoille, bade hiba Feruwanor sarme hazir oiye.<verse eid="GEN 41:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15"/>Feruwane Yusufore hodde, "Ai ekkan šoppon dekilam, honokiye hiyanor mani bangidi no farer. Kintu ãi funni, tore šoppon funaile tui hiyanor mani bangi di faros."<verse eid="GEN 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16"/>Toi Yusufe zuwabe hodde, "Ãi no, Allaye Feruwanore hiba šanti ode zuwab dibo."<verse eid="GEN 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17"/>Toi Feruwane Yusufore hodde, "Ãr šopponot maze, ãi Nil doriyar farot tiyai roiyi, <verse eid="GEN 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18"/>ar so, doriyattu hãttuwa šundor edde boli goru uṛi aišše edde hóir bonot sora šuru goijje. <verse eid="GEN 41:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19"/>Hin bade aro hãttuwa bissiri edde leṛa goru doriyattu uṛi aišše, ãi endilla bissiri goru okkol Mišorot ãi ar hono din no deki. <verse eid="GEN 41:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20"/>Tarfore he bissiri edde leṛa gorugune foilar boli gorur hãtoware háifelaiye. <verse eid="GEN 41:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21"/>Tarfore o hinore saite he boli gorugunore háiyefan no lage, hin agor ḍoilla bissiri taigiyegoi. Hetunot ãi gumottu seton oiyi.<verse eid="GEN 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22"/>"Šopponot ãi aro dekilam, hãttuwa fuiṭṭa edde taza gĩyur sóra ekkan narat gozaiye. <verse eid="GEN 41:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23"/>Hin bade aro hãttuwa gĩyur sóra gozaiye, hin hĩṛa edde fukali bataše fúwaigilgoi. <verse eid="GEN 41:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24"/>Ar he hiṛa gĩyur sóra okkole oi hãttuwa fuiṭṭa edde taza sóragunore gilifelaiye. Ãi in zadugor okkolore hoilam, kintu hitara honokiye inor mani ãre hoi no fare."<verse eid="GEN 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25"/>Toi Yusufe Feruwanore hodde, "Feruwanor šoppon duniyan asole ekkan, Allaye ziyan goribo hiyan Feruwanor hãse batelai diyede. <verse eid="GEN 41:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26"/>He hãttuwa šundor boli goru mani hãt bosor, ar hãttuwa fuiṭṭa edde taza gĩyur sóra mani o hãttuwa bosor; šoppon oilde ekkan. <verse eid="GEN 41:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27"/>Hin bade ze hãttuwa bissiri edde leṛa goru doriyattu uṛi aišše oilde hãttuwa bosor, ar fukali bataše fuwai gilgoide he hiṛa gĩyur sóra oilde o hãttuwa raṭor bosor.<verse eid="GEN 41:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28"/>"Ai Feruwanore iyan endilla hoilam: Allaye ziyan goribo hiyan Feruwanor hãse dehaiye. <verse eid="GEN 41:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29"/>So, Mišor agagura hãttuwa beša beši fošol oibode bosor aibo. <verse eid="GEN 41:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30"/>Ar tarbade aibo hãttuwa raṭor bosor. Toi Mišorot beša beši oilde hin forai zaiboi, edde ei raṭe dešore šeš gorifelaibo. <verse eid="GEN 41:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31"/>Ar beša beši oilde hin ar monot no takibo, kiyollahoile hiyar bade ze raṭ oibo, hiba beši boiyanok oibo. <verse eid="GEN 41:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32"/>Feruwanore dui ḍoilla gori šoppon deha oiyede haron oilde, iyan Allaye faisala gori felaiye, ar Allaye iyan hára goribo.<verse eid="GEN 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33"/>"Ar ehon, Feruwane ekzon manuš zuhar goro, ze buddiwala edde giyani, ar hitar uwore Mišorot bar do. <verse eid="GEN 41:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34"/>Feruwanottu dešolla aro hormosari okkol tula foribo, oi hãt bosorot beša beši oibode hẽtte hitara hinor fãs bagor ek bag tulibolla. <verse eid="GEN 41:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35"/>Hitarattu ei bala bosor okkolor aiyedde hinor hár haiddo okkole dola gora foribo, ar gĩyu okkol Feruwanor anḍare šohor okkolor haiddo hisabe dola gora foribo edde sõli raka foribo. <verse eid="GEN 41:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36"/>Ei haiddo dešolla zoma raka foribo, toi zẽtte raṛor hãt bosor Mišorot oibo, hẽtte zene raṭe dešore dongšo gori felai no fare."<verse eid="GEN 41:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yusuf Mišor dešor šašongoroya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37"/>Ei mošora Feruwanor edde hitar hormosari okkol nozorot beggunottu bala laigge. <verse eid="GEN 41:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38"/>Feruwane hitar hormosari okkolore hodde, "Endilla ekzon manuš ãra ar hare faiyum, zar butore ase Allar Ruh?"<verse eid="GEN 41:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39"/>Toi Feruwane Yusufore hodde, "In okkol zehon Allaye tore dehaiye, tor ḍoilla buddiwala edde giyani ar honokiye nai. <verse eid="GEN 41:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40"/>Tui ãr razbarir hár kissure solaibi, ar tor mukor hokum ãr hár manuš okkole mani solibo, šude šingašonot ãi tottuwaro ḍõr takiyum."<verse eid="GEN 41:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41"/>Toi Feruwane Yusufore hodde, "Sa, ãi šara Mišoror hár zagar uwore tore buwailam." <verse eid="GEN 41:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42"/>Bade Feruwane hitar silmohor-õṛiwa hitar hatottu kuli loi Yusufor hatot findai diye. Hite Yusufore šundor hoor findai diye edde golat ekkan šunar hãr diyai diye. <verse eid="GEN 41:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43"/>Ar hite Yusufore hitar dui lombor gũra garit buwagaraiye. Ar hitara hibar age elan goijje, "Ãṛu nise goro!" Endilla gori hite Yusufore Mišoror hár zagar uwore buwaiye.<verse eid="GEN 41:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44"/>Bade Feruwane Yusufore hodde, "Ãi Feruwan, kintu tor hokum sara fura Mišorot honokiye, no hat tulibo, otóba hãi maribo." <verse eid="GEN 41:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45"/>Feruwane Yusufore nam diye Safenat-Paneh, ar On šohoror imam, Putiferar zi Asenatore Yusufore hibar bou oibolla diye. Bade Yusuf Mišor deš guri aibolla niyoli giye.<verse eid="GEN 41:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46"/>Yusufe Mišoror Feruwanor anḍare hamot góillede he šomot hibar boyoš oilde triš bosor. Toi Yusuf Feruwanor sarmottu niyoli giyegoi edde Mišor zaga beggulla sofor goijje. <verse eid="GEN 41:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47"/>Toi foilar he hãt bosorot dešot beša beši haiddo oiye. <verse eid="GEN 41:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48"/>Mišorot ei hãt bosorot hár haiddo okkolore Yusufe dola goijje edde šohor okkolot mojud gori rakkiye. Ek ekkan šohorot hiyanor sairo ḍakor maṭ okkolor haiddore rakkiye. <verse eid="GEN 41:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49"/>Yusufe doriyar balu zedun hedun haiddo dola goijje; ar eto beši haiddo oiye hinore ar mafiyore lowa šombob no o, hetolla hibaye mafi lowa bondo gori diye.<verse eid="GEN 41:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50"/>Raṭor bosor aibar age, On šohoror imam Putiferar zi Asenator feṛottu Yusufor dui fut zormo oil. <verse eid="GEN 41:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51"/>Yusufe foila futor nam raikke Manessa, ar hodde, "Kiyollahoile Allaye ãr hár duk hošto edde ãr bafor góror hár kissure foraifelabaye." <verse eid="GEN 41:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52"/>Bade dusora futor nam raikke Efraim, ar hodde, "Allaye ãre hošṭo bugor dešot fólwala goijje."<verse eid="GEN 41:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53"/>Tarfore Mišorot beša beši haiddo oiyede he hãt bosor šeš oiye, <verse eid="GEN 41:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54"/>raṭor hãt bosor šuru oiye, ode ode Yusufe hoilde mozin. Raṭ oinno hár deš okkolot šuru oiye, kintu Mišoror hár zagat haiddo ase. <verse eid="GEN 41:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55"/>Mišorot beggulla bukkor zala šuru oiye, manuš okkole Feruwanor hãse zai haiddolla handahaṛi goijje. Feruwane hár Mišoriyo okkolore hoiye, "Yusufor hãse zo, ar hibaye tũwarare zen goitto ho hen goro."<verse eid="GEN 41:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56"/>Dešor beggulla ei raṭ sorai foijjil, toi Yusufe gudam gór okkol beggun kulidiye edde Mišoriyo okkolore gĩyu beisse; kiyollahoile Mišorot raṭ beši hora oi uṭṭil. <verse eid="GEN 41:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57"/>Ar hár dešottu Mišorot, Yusufottu gĩyu kinito aišše, kiyollahoile hár zagat raṭ beši hora oil.<verse eid="GEN 41:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufor báiyain okkol Mišor dešot zar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1"/>Yakube Mišorot gĩyu asede zani fariyore hibaye nizor futaindore hodde, "Tũwara ekzone ar ekzonor mukor uzu kiya sai taikko?" <verse eid="GEN 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2"/>Hibaye aro hodde, "So, ãi Mišorot gĩyu asede fuinni, tũwara heṛe lamat zo edde henttu ãralla gĩyu kini anogoi, zene ãrar basai fari edde no mori."<verse eid="GEN 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3"/>Toi Yusufor doš báiye Mišorottu gĩyu kinibolla lamat giye. <verse eid="GEN 42:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4"/>Kintu Yakube Yusufor bái Benyaminore hitar báiyaindor fũwati no defeṛa, kiyollahoile hibaye hodde, "Oitfare hitar uwore hono bifod goṭibo." <verse eid="GEN 42:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5"/>Toi zara gĩyu kinito aišše hitarar fũwati Israilor futain okkol o heṛe aišše, kiyollahoile Kenanot o raṭ oil.<verse eid="GEN 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6"/>Ehon Yusuf oiyede dešor šašongoroya, ar iba oilde hiba ze he dešitta okkol beggunore gĩyu bessil. Toi Yusufor báiyain okkol aišše edde hitara hibar sarme meṛir uzu uite foijje. <verse eid="GEN 42:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7"/>Yusufe báiyaindore deikke edde hibaye hitarare sini faijje, kintu hibaye hitara loi osinor ḍoil goijje edde hora gori hota hoiye, hodde, "Tũwara hontu aiššode?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Hitara hodde, "Kenan dešottu, haiddo kinibolla aššide."<verse eid="GEN 42:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8"/>Yusufe báiyaindore sini faijje, kintu hitara Yusufore sini no fare. <verse eid="GEN 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9"/>Ar Yusufe hitarar babute ze ze šoppon okkol dekkil, hin okkol hibattu monot foijje; toi hitarare hodde, "Tũwara spai, dešot uidda zaga hoṛe ase saito aiššode."<verse eid="GEN 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10"/>Hitara zuwabe hodde, "No, malik, õnor gulam okkole haiddo kinto aiššede. <verse eid="GEN 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11"/>Ãra beggun ekzonor futain ãra šada dilla manuš, spai no."<verse eid="GEN 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12"/>Yusufe hitarare hodde, "No, tũwara dešot uidda zaga hoṛe ase saito aiššode."<verse eid="GEN 42:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13"/>Kintu hitara hodde, "Õnor gulam okkol baro bái aššilam, ãra oilamde Kenanor ekzonor futain okkol. Ar šoṛo bái ehon ãrar bafor fũwati ase, ar ekzon nai."<verse eid="GEN 42:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14"/>Yusufe hitarare hodde, "Iyan ãi tũwarare hoiyide hendilla, tũwara spai. <verse eid="GEN 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15"/>Ar tũwarare iyan loi forikka gora oibo: Ãi Feruwanor zanor hosom gori hoir, tũwarar šoṛo bái eṛe no aile, tũwara ei zagattu bair oi no fariba. <verse eid="GEN 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16"/>Tũwarar ekzonore defeṛao, edde tũwarar he báiyore anao, ar tũwara eṛe bondi tako, ar ei bafe tũwarar hota forikka gora oibo, tũwara hãsa hota hor ne. Zodi no oile, ãi Feruwanor zanor hosom gori hoir, tũwara spai okkol." <verse eid="GEN 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17"/>Toi hibaye hitarare tin din hazotot rakkiye.<verse eid="GEN 42:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18"/>Tin dinor din Yusufe hitarare hodde, "Ek ham goro, toi tũwara basi fariba, kiyollahoile ãi Allare ḍorai: <verse eid="GEN 42:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19"/>Tũwara zodi šada dilla manuš o toile tũwarar báiyaindor butottu ekzon hazotot bondi tako, ar baki beggune tũwarar bukalo góror manuš okkololla gĩyu loi zogoi. <verse eid="GEN 42:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20"/>Tarfore tũwara tũwarar šoṛo báiyore ãr hãse ano, toi tũwarar hota formanito oibo, edde tũwara no moriba." Toi hitara hendilla goijje.<verse eid="GEN 42:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21"/>Ar hitara ekzonore ekzone hodde, "Soiyi ãra ãrar báiyor babute hosurbon, kiyollahoile hite ãrar hãse minnoti goijje, edde ãra hitar foranor hošto dekiyore hin no funi; etolla ãrar uwore ei mosibot hazir oiye."<verse eid="GEN 42:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22"/>Hetunot Rubene hodde, "Ãi no ne tũwarare hoilamde, fuwawar berudde guna no goijjo? Kintu tũwara no funo, ar ehon hitar louwor hisab diya forer." <verse eid="GEN 42:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23"/>Hitara ṭer no ze Yusufe hitarar hota buzi farer, kiyollahoile hibaye hota buzaidoya bebar goijje.<verse eid="GEN 42:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24"/>Toi hiba hitarar hãsottu dure ator oi zaiyore hainde edde uwafes firi aišše. Toi hiba abar firi aišše edde hitara loi hota hoiye, Ar hitarar butottu Simeonore dori hitarar šaikkat bainde.<verse eid="GEN 42:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25"/>Bade Yusufe hitarar bosta okkolot gĩyu bori dibolla, ar hitara fotti ek ekzonor ṭiya zar zar bostat ferot dibolla, edde baisalla hána dibolla hokum diye. Toi hitaralla hendilla gora oiye. <verse eid="GEN 42:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26"/>Tarfore hitara hitarar gĩyur bosta okkol hitarar gada okkolor fiṛot loiye edde henttu giyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 42:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27"/>Ar fõtot rait haṛaibolla taimmede heṛe hitarar butottu ekzone hitar gadare adar dibolla hitar gĩyur bosta kuille. Toi hite bostar mukot hitar ṭiyagun deikke. <verse eid="GEN 42:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28"/>Henot hite báiyain okkolore hodde, "So, ãr ṭĩya firaidiye, hin ãr bostar butore."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:28">Henot ḍore hitarar foran uri giyegoi edde hafi hafi ekzonore ekzone hodde, "Allaye ãrare in ki goijje?"<verse eid="GEN 42:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29"/>Bade hitara Kenan dešot hitarar baf Yakubor hãse aišše, edde hitarar uwore zen zen goiṭṭe hin okkol beggun hibar hãse hoi funaiye. Hitara hodde, <verse eid="GEN 42:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30"/>"Ze manušwa he dešor uwore malik, hibaye ãra loi hora bafe hota hoiye, ar ãrare dešor uidda zaga tuwoya spai mone goijje. <verse eid="GEN 42:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31"/>Kintu ãra hibare hoiyi, 'Ãra šada dilla manuš, spai no. <verse eid="GEN 42:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32"/>Ãra baro bái, ek bafor futain, kintu ekzon nai, edde šoṛo bái Kenanot ehon ãrar bafor fũwati ase.'<verse eid="GEN 42:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33"/>"Henot he deš šašongoroya manušwaye ãrare hodde, 'Iyan loi ãi tũwara šada dilla manuš oi ne zani fariyum: Tũwarar ek báiyore ãr hãse raki zo, edde tũwarar bukalo góror manuš okkololla haiddo loizo. <verse eid="GEN 42:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34"/>Ar tũwarar šoṛo báiyore ãr hãse ainno, henot ãi buzifariyum ze tũwara spai no, kintu šada dilla manuš. Toi ãi tũwarar bái tũwarar hãse firai diyum, edde tũwara ei dešot besa kina gori fariba.'"<verse eid="GEN 42:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35"/>Toi hitara zẽtte bostattu haiddo ḍaille, ar so, hitara fottizonor bostar butore hitarar fottizonor ṭiyar bunda! Ei ṭiyar bunda okkol hitara edde hitarar bafe deki, beggune ḍoraiye. <verse eid="GEN 42:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36"/>Ar hitarar baf Yakube hodde, "Tũwara ãre fuwain hara goijjo. Yusuf nai, Simeon o nai, abar Benyaminore loizaito sor. In beggun ãr uwottu guzori zar!"<verse eid="GEN 42:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37"/>Hetunot Rubene hitar bafore hodde, "Ãi zodi tũwar hãse itare firai no ani, toile tũi ãr dui futore kun goijjo. Hitare ãr hatot do, ãi hitare tũwar hãse uwafes firai aniyum."<verse eid="GEN 42:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38"/>Kintu Yakube hodde, "Na, ãr fut tũwarar fũwati no zaibo; hitar bái mori giyegoi edde šude hite basi ase. Tũwara ze fõt bai zaiba, heṛe zodi hitar hono bifod o, toile hitar šukke ei fona sule ãre fatalot lamai diba."<verse eid="GEN 42:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43"/>
  <para style="s">Benyamin Mišor dešot zar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1"/>Ehon o dešot raṭ beši hora. <verse eid="GEN 43:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2"/>Toi hitara Mišorottu ze gĩyu annil, hin beggun zehon haiya šeš oiye, hitarar bafe hitarare hodde, "Tũwara abar zo, edde ãralla aro olfo haiddo kini ano."<verse eid="GEN 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3"/>Toi Ehudaye hibare hodde, "Kintu he manušwaye ãrare hũšiyari diye edde hoiye, 'Tũwarar bái fũwati no takile tũwara ãr sarme no aiššo.' <verse eid="GEN 43:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4"/>Tũi zodi ãrar fũwati ãrar báiyore zaito do, ãra lamat zaiyum edde tũwalla haiddo kini aniyum. <verse eid="GEN 43:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5"/>Ar zodi no defeṛo, ãra no zaiyum, kiyollahoile he manušwaye ãrare hoiye, 'Tũwarar bái fũwati no takile tũwara ãr sarme no aiššo.'"<verse eid="GEN 43:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6"/>Toi Israile hodde, "Tũwara he manušware tũwarattu ar ek bãi ase hoiyore kiyolla tũwara ãr loi endilla bura ham gorila?"<verse eid="GEN 43:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7"/>Hitara hodde, "Manušwaye ãrar babute edde ãrar foribaror babute zora zori gori endilla hoi fusar goijje. 'Tũwarar baf ki ehono zinda ne? Tũwarattu ki aro ek bái ase?' Ar ãra hibare ei suwal okkol mozin zuwab diyi. Henot ãra ken gori zaniyum ze hite hoibo, 'Tũwarar báiyore eṛe ano?'"<verse eid="GEN 43:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8"/>Toi Ehudaye hibar baf Israilore hodde, "Fuwaware ãr fũwati defeṛo, ãra uṛi edde baisa di, toi zene ãra, tũi edde ãrar fuwain šoho, ãra forane basi edde no mori. <verse eid="GEN 43:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9"/>Ãi nize hitar zabin roilam; hitare tũi ãr hatottu gosi loiyo. Ãi zodi hitare tũwarar hãse uwafes firai no ani toile ãi hara zibon tũwar hãse hosurbon oi takiyum. <verse eid="GEN 43:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10"/>Ãra eto deri no goritam boli etone hameka ãra dui bar zaiyore uwafes ai faittam."<verse eid="GEN 43:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11"/>Toi hitarar baf Israile hodde, "Zodi hen gora fore, toile endilla goro: Manušwalla ek hadiya hisabe tũwarar bosta okkolot dešor nam gora ziniš okkolottu kissu lo, olfo duf, olfo rezom, olfo modu, kušbo mosolla, pistašo dana edde badam. <verse eid="GEN 43:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12"/>Ar tũwara fũwati ḍabol ṭĩya lo, kiyollahoile bostar mukot ze ṭĩya firi aišše, hin firai diya foribo. Oitfare hiyan ekkan hono bul oiye. <verse eid="GEN 43:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13"/>Tũwarar báiyore lo edde zolti he manušwar hãse uwafes zo. <verse eid="GEN 43:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14"/>Šorbo Šoktiwala Allaye gorok zene he manušwaye tũwarare doya gore, toi hite tũwarar dusora bái edde Benyaminore tũwarar fũwati defeṛa. Ar ãttu zodi fuwain hara owa forile o, fuwain hara oilam."<verse eid="GEN 43:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15"/>Toi manušgunore he hadiya, hatot ḍabol ṭĩya edde Benyaminore loiyore hitara uiṭṭe edde Mišorot lami giye edde Yusufor sarme hazir oiyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 43:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16"/>Yusufe hitarar fũwati Benyaminore dekiyore hibaye hibar gór sõloya ze, hitare hodde, "Ei manuššunore góror butore loiza, ar ek zanuwar zorgorao edde hanar bondobos goro; itara dũijja ãr fũwati hána háibo."<verse eid="GEN 43:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17"/>Manuššuwaye Yusufe hoilde hendilla goijje, hitarare Yusufor górot loigiye. <verse eid="GEN 43:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18"/>Kintu hitarare Yusufor górot loizarbar, hitara ḍoraiye, ar hitara hodde, "Agor baror ze ṭĩya ãrar bostat gori firigilgoi hinor befare ãrare eṛe ana oiye. Ehon itara ãrare duš dehai akromon gori faribo. Ãrar gadagun hari loifelaibo edde ãrare gulam banaifelibo."<verse eid="GEN 43:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19"/>Toi hitara Yusufor gór sõloyar hãse giye edde hitar loi goror dorozar ḍake hitar loi hota hoiye, <verse eid="GEN 43:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20"/>edde hodde, "Oh malik, ãra iyar age o ek bar haiddo kinto aiššilam. <verse eid="GEN 43:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21"/>Kintu ãra zẽtte fõtot rait haṛaibolla tiyaiyi, edde ãrar bosta kuilli, ar so, fotti ek ekzon zar zar ṭĩya bostar mukot, ãrar nizor ṭiya furafuri uzon mozin, ar ehon hin ãrar fũwati anni. <verse eid="GEN 43:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22"/>Hin bade o haiddo kinibolla fũwati ãra aro ṭĩya anni. Ãrar ei ṭiya ãrar bostat hone di rakkil hiyan ãra no zani."<verse eid="GEN 43:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23"/>Toi hite hodde, "Tũwarar balai ok, no ḍoraiyo. Tũwarar Allah edde tũwarar bafor Allaye tũwarar bostat gayebi dón diyede; tũwarar ṭĩya ãi failam." Bade hite Simeonore hitarar hãse ainne.<verse eid="GEN 43:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24"/>Bade manuššuwaye hitarare Yusufor góror butore ainne, fani diye toi hitara hitarar ṭeng duiye, ar hite hitarar gadagunore adar diye. <verse eid="GEN 43:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25"/>Yusuf dujja aibo boli hitara hadiyagunore tiyar gori raikke, kiyollahoile hitara funnil ze hitarar há fiya heṛe oibo.<verse eid="GEN 43:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26"/>Tarfore Yusuf górot aišše, toi hitara ze hadiya okkol ainne hinore góror butore loi zaiyore hibar sarme raikke edde hitara hibar sarme meṛir uite foijje. <verse eid="GEN 43:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27"/>Hibaye hitara ken ase he hóbor loi bade hibaye hodde, "Tũwarar ze burá bafor babute ãre hoila hiba bala ase ne? Hiba ki ehono basi ase?"<verse eid="GEN 43:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28"/>Hitara hodde, "Õnor gulam ãrar baf ehono basi ase, ar hiba ehono basi ase." Toi hitara meṛit uite foijje edde Yusufore ijjot dehaiye.<verse eid="GEN 43:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29"/>Ar Yusufe suk tuli saiye edde hibar nizor mar fut, afon bái Benyaminore deikke, "Ite ne tũwarar he šoṛo bái, zar hota tũwara ãre hoila?" Ar hibaye hodde, "Allaye tore rahamot gorok, oh fut!" <verse eid="GEN 43:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30"/>Toi Yusufe toratori goijje, kiyollahoile báiyore dekiyore hibar foran hainde. Yusufe ekkan handibar zaga tuwaibolla henttu niyoli giyegoi, ar hiba nizor kamerat góille edde hainde.<verse eid="GEN 43:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31"/>Bade hibaye muk dúi bade abar baire niyoli aišše, edde nizore sõli loi, ar hána bari dibolla hokum diye. <verse eid="GEN 43:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32"/>Toi hitara hiballa, edde hibar báiyain okkololla, edde hibar fũwati Mišoriyo okkol zara hána hóya, hitara beggunore aleda gori hána bari diya oiye, kiyollahoile Mišoriyo okkole Ibroni okkolor fũwati hafiya no gorito, haron hiyan aššilde hitarar hãse ekkan hingšar ham. <verse eid="GEN 43:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33"/>Yusufor sarme báiyain okkolore hitarar boyoš mozin buwaiye. Henot hitara tajjuf oi ekzone oinno zonor uzu sa šuru goijje. <verse eid="GEN 43:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34"/>Yusufe hitar nizor ṭebilottu kissu kissu hána báiyaindore dibolla bebosta goijje. Kintu oinno báiyain beggunottuwaro Benyaminore fãs gun beši diya oiye. Ar hitara Yusufor fũwati beša beši há fiya goijje edde beši kuši goijje.<verse eid="GEN 43:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44"/>
  <para style="s">Bostat rufar fiyala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1"/>Tarfore Yusufe hibar gór sõloyare endilla hokum diye: "Ei manuššune zedun boi loizai fare, hedun gĩyu hitarar bostat okkolot bori do, ar hitara fotti zonor ṭĩya hitara fotti zonor bostar mukot di diyo. <verse eid="GEN 44:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2"/>Ze beggunor šoṛo hitar bostar mukot ãr rufar fiyalawa edde hitar gĩyu kinibar ṭiya di diyo." Toi hite Yusufe hoiyede mozin goijje.<verse eid="GEN 44:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3"/>Tarfordin binna fohor zehon oiye manuššunore hitara gadagun loi hentu faṭai diya oiye. <verse eid="GEN 44:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4"/>Hitara šude šohorottu niyoli beši dure no zaite Yusufe hibar gór sõloyare hodde, "Uṭ, manuššunore fisottu lorai za, ar tui zẽtte hitare doribigoi, hitarare hoibi, 'Tũwara balair bodole burai ka goijjo? <verse eid="GEN 44:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5"/>Iba loi no ne ãr munife fiyede edde gonafora gorede? Tũwara iyan ziyan goijjo, ek horaf ham goijjo!'"<verse eid="GEN 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6"/>Gór sõloyaye hitarare doijjegoi edde he hota okkol hitarare hoiye. <verse eid="GEN 44:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7"/>Kintu hitara hitare hodde, "Ãr malike endilla hota okkol kiyolla hor? Õnor gulam okkole endilla ham hono din no goribo! <verse eid="GEN 44:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8"/>So, ãra bostar mukot ze ṭĩya failam hin ãra Kenan dešottu uwafes tũwar hãse firai anni, hen abostat ãra õnor munifor góror šuna rufa kiyolla sur goriyum? <verse eid="GEN 44:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9"/>Õnor ei gulam okkol zar hãse iba fazaibo, hite moribo; ar ãra o ãr malikor gulam oiyum."<verse eid="GEN 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10"/>Toi hite hodde, "Bala, tũwara hodde mozin oibo; zar hãse fa zaibo, hite ãr gulam oibo, ar baki tũwarar hosuri sara oiba."<verse eid="GEN 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11"/>Toi hitara toratori goijje edde ek ekzone hitar nizor bosta meṛit lamaiye, edde zar zar bosta te kuille. <verse eid="GEN 44:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12"/>Toi hite ḍõr báiyor bostattu loti šuru gori šoṛo báiyor bosta foijjonto tuwaiye. Ar Fiyalawa Benyaminor bostat fa giye. <verse eid="GEN 44:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13"/>Toi hitara hitarar nizor hor faiṭṭe, edde zar zar bosta gadar fiṛot bandi loi uwafes šohorot firi giye.<verse eid="GEN 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14"/>Ehudah edde hitar báiyain okkol Yusufor górot aišše, ar Yusuf hehono heṛe aššil; toi hitara Yusufor sarme meṛit ũite foijje. <verse eid="GEN 44:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15"/>Yusufe hitarare hodde, "Tũwara goijjode in ki goijjo? Ãr ḍoilla manuše ze goni fare, hiyan ki tũwara no zano?"<verse eid="GEN 44:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16"/>Ehudaye hodde, "Ãr malikore ãra ki hoi faijjum? Ki hota hoiyum? Ãra nidušide hiyan ken gori dehai faijjum? Õnor gulam okkolor hosuri Allaye tuwai bair goijje. So, zar hãse fiyala fa giye hite edde ãra ãr ehon malikor gulam."<verse eid="GEN 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17"/>Kintu Yusufe hodde, "Endilla ham ãi hono din gori no faijjum! Zar hãse he fiyala fa giye lehar te ãr gulam oibo. Ar tũwara šanti bafe tũwarar bafor heṛe firizaigoi fariba."<verse eid="GEN 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18"/>Tarfore Ehudaye Yusufor ḍake zai hodde: "O ãr malik, foriyad gorir, õnor ei gulamore ekkan hota hoibolla ejazot do. Õnor gulamor uwore gušša no goijjo, õne, Feruwanor fuwainna. <verse eid="GEN 44:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19"/>Ãr malike hibar gulam okkolore fusar goijjila, 'Tũwarar baf bái ase ne?' <verse eid="GEN 44:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20"/>Ar ãra malikore zuwab dilam, 'Ãrattu ek burá baf ase, ar hibattu burá halor ek fut ase; ar hitar bái mora giye, ar hite ekela ek mar ek fut, hitar bafe hitare beši ador gore.'<verse eid="GEN 44:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21"/>"Toi õne õnor gulam okkolore hoila, 'Tũwara hitare eṛe anogoi, ãi hitare niz suke saiyum.' <verse eid="GEN 44:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22"/>Ar ãra ãr malikore hoilam, 'He zuwan bafore eri ai no faribo; hite hitar bafore eri aile, hitar baf mori zaiboi.' <verse eid="GEN 44:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23"/>Kintu õne ei gulam okkolore hoila, 'Tũwarar šoṛo báiyore zodi tũwarar fũwati no ano, tũwara ãr sarme ai no fariba.' <verse eid="GEN 44:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24"/>Toi ãra õnor gulam ãr bafor górot uwafes zaiyore, ãra ãr malikor hár hota hibare zanailam.<verse eid="GEN 44:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25"/>"Toi ãrar bafe hodde, 'Tũwara abar zo, ãralla hodun haiddo kini anogoi.' <verse eid="GEN 44:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26"/>Ãra hoilam, 'Ãra lamat zai no farir; zodi ãrar šoṛo bái ãrar fũwati take, toile ãra zai faridde, kiyollahoile ãrar šoṛo bái fũwati no takile, ãra manušwar muk sai no faijjum.' <verse eid="GEN 44:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27"/>Toi õnor gulam, ãrar bafe ãrare hodde, 'Tũwara zano ze ãr bouwe ãlla dui futore biyaiye, <verse eid="GEN 44:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28"/>henttu o ekzon ãttu giyegoi, ar ãi hoilam, "hite hameka hanhan oi giyegoi" hiyattu loti ãi hitare ar no dekilam. <verse eid="GEN 44:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29"/>Ehon ãttu itare o zodi loizogoi, edde hitar hono bifod goṭe, toile tũwara hitar dukke ei burá boyošot ãre fatalot lamai diba.'<verse eid="GEN 44:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30"/>"Ar ehon, õnor gulam ãr bafor munttu ãi hazir oile, edde fuwawa ãrar fũwati no takile, (zar foranor hitar foran loi gãta), <verse eid="GEN 44:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31"/>zuwannuwa ãrar fũwati naide dekile hiba mori zaibogoi, endilla gori õnor gulam okkole õnor gulam ãrar bafore šukke ei burá boyošot fatalot lamai dibo. <verse eid="GEN 44:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32"/>Ar õnor gulam ãrar bafor hãse ãi ei zuwanor zabin oi hoilam, 'Ãi zodi hitare tũwar hãse firai no ani, toile ãi ãr bafor hãse zibonbor hosurbon takiyum!'<verse eid="GEN 44:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33"/>"Hetolla aroz gorir, ei fuwawar bodole ãre õnor gulam hisabe rako, edde ei fuwaware hitar báiyaindor fũwati firi zaito do. <verse eid="GEN 44:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34"/>Ei fuware no loi zaiyore ãi ken gori ãr bafor hãse firizai faijjum? Edde bafor ze bifod goṭibo hin o ken gori sai faijjum?"<verse eid="GEN 44:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufe báiyaindore sin diye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1"/>Toi Yusuf nizor ḍake tiyat aššilde hitarar sarme nizore ar sõli raki no fare, edde guzori hodde, "Ãr sarmottu beggunore niyolai do!" Henot hibar ḍake ar kiye tiyat no aššil. Toi hetunot Yusufe báiyaindor hãse nizor foriso diye. <verse eid="GEN 45:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2"/>Ar hibaye eto ḍõr gori guzori hainde ze Mišoriyo okkole hin funniye, edde Feruwanor góror ma he babute funniye.<verse eid="GEN 45:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3"/>Bade Yusufe hibar báiyaindore hodde, "Ãi Yusuf; ãr baf ki ehono basi ase?" Kintu hibar báiyainde hibare zuwab di no fare, kiyollahoile hitara hibar sarme ḍoraye.<verse eid="GEN 45:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4"/>Yusufe hibar báiyaindore hodde, "Meherbani gori tũwara ãr ḍake aiyo." Hitara hibar ḍake giye, toi hibaye hodde, "Ãi tũwarar bái Yusuf, zare tũwara Mišorot beisso. <verse eid="GEN 45:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5"/>Ar tũwara ãre eṛe beissode hiyanolla ehon tũwarar monot duk no ainno otóba nizor uwore rag no goijjo; foran okkol basaibolla Allaye tũwarar age ãre eṛe defeṛaiye. <verse eid="GEN 45:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6"/>Kiyollahoile dešot raṭ soledde ehon dui bosor oiye, ar aro fãs bosor saš ba fošol da no oibo. <verse eid="GEN 45:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7"/>Kintu Allaye tũwarar bongšore duniyait basai rakibolla edde moha uddaror duwara tũwarare basaibolla, tũwarar age ãre defeṛaiye.<verse eid="GEN 45:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8"/>"Hetolla, ãre eṛe tũwara defeṛaiyo no, kintu Allaye. Hibaye ãre Feruwanor bafor zagat, edde hibar hár góror malik, edde šara Mišor dešor uwore šašongoroya goijje. <verse eid="GEN 45:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9"/>Tũwara toratori uwore ãr bafor hãse zo edde hibare ho: 'Tũwar fut Yusufe endilla hoiye: Allaye ãre šara Mišor dešor malik goijje; tũi eṛe lamat ãr hãse aiyo, deri no goijjo. <verse eid="GEN 45:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10"/>Tũi, tũwar futziyain edde natifuti, tũwar goru sool, ar za kissu ase beggun loi Gušen elehat takifariba; ar ãr ḍake ogai, <verse eid="GEN 45:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11"/>Ar heṛe ãi tũwarare deha funa goriyum, kiyollahoile raṭ aro fãs bosor ase. Ar no oilede tũi edde tũwarar góror guštiṭiya, zin ase beggune hošto faiba.'<verse eid="GEN 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12"/>"Ar so, tũwara edde ãr bái Benyamin, tũwara nizor suke dekor, ze ãi nizor muke tũwarar loi hota hoidde; <verse eid="GEN 45:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13"/>Mišorot ãr hondilla ijjot, edde zaha kissu tũwara deikko, beggun ãr bafore hoiba, ar hibare hara eṛe lamat loianogoi."<verse eid="GEN 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14"/>Toi hibaye hibar bái Benyaminor golat dori hainde, ar Benyamine o hibar golat dori hainde. <verse eid="GEN 45:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15"/>Ar hibaye báiyain beggunore suma diye edde hitarar golat dori hainde. Tarfore hibar báiyainde hibar loi hotabattara hoiye.<verse eid="GEN 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16"/>Yusufor báiyain aiššede, ei hóbor Feruwanor górot fõsiyore, Feruwan edde hitar gulam okkol beggune kuši oiye. <verse eid="GEN 45:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17"/>Feruwane Yusufore hodde, "Tui tor báiyain okkolore ho, 'Tũwara endilla goro: Tũwarar zanuwargunor fiṛot haiddo lo edde Kenanot baisa do, <verse eid="GEN 45:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18"/>ar tũwarar bafore edde tũwarar nizor nizor góror manuš okkolore loi ãr hãse aiyogoi. Ãi tũwarare Mišoror uttom zaga diyum, edde tũwara dešor barik ziniš okkol hái fariba.'<verse eid="GEN 45:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19"/>"Tui hitarare hokum dibi, 'Tũwara endilla goro: Tũwarar bou fuwaindolla Mišorottu gũra gari okkol loizo, ar hitarare edde tũwarar bafore loi aiyogoi. <verse eid="GEN 45:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20"/>Ar tũwarar malamalolla no bafiyo, kiyollahoile fura Mišoror uttom ziniš tũwarar oibo.'"<verse eid="GEN 45:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21"/>Toi Israilor futain okkole hendilla goijje. Yusufe razar hokum mozin hitarare gũra gari diye, ar hibaye hitarare fõtolla hána o diye. <verse eid="GEN 45:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22"/>Hibaye fotti zonore noya hor diye, kintu Benyaminore tin šot rufar ṭĩya edde fãs zura hor diye. <verse eid="GEN 45:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23"/>Ar bafolla hibaye in okkol defeṛaiye: došwa modda gadar fiṛot gori Mišoror barik ziniš okkol, ar došwa miyala gadar fiṛot gori gĩyũ edde ruṭi ar bafor baisalla haiddo. <verse eid="GEN 45:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24"/>Tarfore hibaye báiyaindore bidai goijje, ar hitara baisa diyar šomot hibaye hodde, "Fõtot hoijja-hanḍal no goijjo!"<verse eid="GEN 45:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25"/>Toi hitara Mišorottu niyoliyore uwore Kenanot hitarar baf Yakubor hãse aišše. <verse eid="GEN 45:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26"/>Edde hitara bafore hoiye, hodde, "Yusuf ehono zinda ase, ar šara Mišor dešor uwore hite šašongoroya oiye." Kintu bafor dil sorot taigiyegoi, kiyollahoile hitara hota hibattu biššaš no lage. <verse eid="GEN 45:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27"/>Ar Yusufe hitarare hoilde he hár hota okkol zehon hitara hibare hoiye, edde hibare boiloizaibolla Yusufe gũra gari okkol defeṛaiyede hin zehon deikke, henot hitarar baf Yakubor ruh uwafes zinda oi uiṭṭe. <verse eid="GEN 45:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28"/>Toi Israile hodde, "Iyan beši oiye! Ãr fut Yusuf ehono zinda ase; Ãi zaiyore moribar age hitare saiyum."<verse eid="GEN 45:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46"/>
  <para style="s">Yakub Mišorot zar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1"/>Tarfore Israile hibar hár kissu loi baisa diyore Beer-Šebat aišše, edde hibaye hibar baf Isakor Allar mutallek kurbani okkol diye.<verse eid="GEN 46:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2"/>Allaye raitta Israilore deha diyore hodde, "Yakub, Yakub!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">hibaye hodde, So, oto ãi.<verse eid="GEN 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3"/>Toi hibaye hodde, "Ãi Allah, tor bafor Allah; Lamat Mišorot zaite tui no ḍorais, kiyollahoile heṛe ãi tore ek ḍõr zati goriyum. <verse eid="GEN 46:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4"/>Ãi tor fũwati lamat Mišorot zaiyum, edde hentu ãi tore abar uwafes firai o loi ainnum, ar tor sukor fata Yusufor nizor hate bandi dibo."<verse eid="GEN 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5"/>Toi Yakube Beer-Šebattu baisa diye. Israilor futainde hitarar baf Yakubore, edde hitara nizor nizor futziyain okkolore, edde bouwain okkolore, oi gũragari okkol, zin Feruwane hibare boiloizaibolla defeṛail, hinot gori loi giye. <verse eid="GEN 46:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6"/>Ar hitara hitarar zanuwar okkol edde Kenanot hamailde hár šombotti okkol fũwati loi, Yakub edde hibar fura bongšo ṭiya hibar fũwati, Mišorot aigiyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 46:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7"/>Yakube hibar futain, futaindor fuwain, ziyain, ziyaindor ziyain, hibar gũṛa bongšo ṭiyare hibar fũwati Mišorot loi anniye.<verse eid="GEN 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8"/>In okkol oilde Israilor futain okkol nam okkol (Yakub edde hibar bongšo okkol) zara Mišorot aišše:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 46:8"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 46:8">Yakubor foila zormo Ruben.<verse eid="GEN 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9"/>Rubenor futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:9">Hanok, Pallu, Hešron edde Karmi.<verse eid="GEN 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10"/>Simeonor futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:10">Jemuwel, Jamin, Ohad, Jakin, Sohar edde Šaul he Kenaniyo mayafuwar fut.<verse eid="GEN 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11"/>Levir futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:11">Geršon, Kekat edde Merari.<verse eid="GEN 46:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12"/>Ehudar futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:12">Er, Onan, Šela, Feroš edde Šerah. (Er edde Onan Kenan dešot entehal goijje.)</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:12">Ferošor futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="GEN 46:12">Hešron edde Hamul.<verse eid="GEN 46:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13"/>Issakaror futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:13">Tola, Puvah, Job ar Šimron.<verse eid="GEN 46:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14"/>Sebulunor futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:14">Serod, Elun ar Jahalel.<verse eid="GEN 46:14"/></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15"/>Itara oilde Lear futain okkol, zarare hibaye Paddan-Aramot Yakubolla biyail, fũwati hibar zi Dina šoho. Hitara mayafuwain edde morod fuwain beggune muṭ triš tinzon.<verse eid="GEN 46:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16"/>Gador futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:16">Sifiyon, Haggi, Šuni, Esbon, Eri, Arodi edde Areli.<verse eid="GEN 46:16"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17"/>Ašeror futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:17">Jimna, Jišba, Jišbi, Beriyah, edde hitarar boin Serah.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:17">Beriyar futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="GEN 46:17">Heber edde Malhiyel.<verse eid="GEN 46:17"/></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18"/>Itara he Zilpar fuwain zare Labone nizor ziyore bandi hisabe dil, hibaye Yakubolla itarare biyaiye. Itara beggune šullo zon.<verse eid="GEN 46:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19"/>Yakubor bou Rahelar futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:19">Yusuf edde Benyamin.<verse eid="GEN 46:19"/></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20"/>Ar Mišorot, Manessare edde Efraimore On šohoror imam Putiferar zi Asenate Yusufolla biyaiye.<verse eid="GEN 46:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21"/>Benjaminor futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:21">Bela, Beker, Ašbel, Gera, Naman, Ehi, Ruš, Muffim, Huffim edde Ard.<verse eid="GEN 46:21"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22"/>Itara aššilde Rahelar futain okkol, zarare Yakubolla biyaiye. Hitara muṭ soiddo zon.<verse eid="GEN 46:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23"/>Danor fut:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:23">Hušim.<verse eid="GEN 46:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24"/>Naftalir futain okkol:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:24">Zahšiyel, Guni, Jezer edde Šillem.<verse eid="GEN 46:24"/></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25"/>Itara aššilde Bilhar futain, zare Labone nizor ziyore bandi hisabe dil. Hibaye Yakubolla itarare biyaiye. Hitara muṭ hãt zon.<verse eid="GEN 46:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26"/>Hitara zarare loi Yakube Mišorot aiyat aššil, zara hibar nizor bongšottu, Yakubor futaindor bouwain okkol sara, hitara muṭ haiṭ so zon. <verse eid="GEN 46:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27"/>Mišorot Yusufottu ze dui fut zormo oiye, edde Yakubor gušṭi zara Mišorot aišše hitara beggune muṭ hoittor zon.<verse eid="GEN 46:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28"/>Bade Yakube hibar age Ehudare Yusufor hãse defeṛaiye, zene hibaye hitare Gušenot zaibar fõt dehai de, toi hitara Gušen elehat aišše. <verse eid="GEN 46:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29"/>Toi Yusufe hibar nizor gũra garire hãzaiyore Gušenot hibar baf Israil loi deha goitto giye. Toi bafore zehon deikke, golat dori bout hotun hainde. <verse eid="GEN 46:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30"/>Hetunot Israile Yusufore hodde, "Ãi ehon moribolla tiyar! Tui zinda asos, ãi tor siyara dekilam."<verse eid="GEN 46:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31"/>Toi Yusufe hibar báiyain okkol edde hibar bafor góror manuš okkolore hodde, "Ãi Feruwanor hãse zai ei hóborgan hoigoi, hibare hoiyum, 'Ãr báiyain edde bafor góror manuš okkol zara Kenanot takito, hitara ãr hãse aišše. <verse eid="GEN 46:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32"/>Hitara soolsoroya okkol; hitara goru sool faloya okkol. Hitara hitarar goru, sool, edde hitarar nizor hár kissu fũwati loi aišše.' <verse eid="GEN 46:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33"/>Ar Feruwane tũwarare zẽtte ḍakibo edde fusar goribo, 'Tũwarar feša ki?' <verse eid="GEN 46:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34"/>Tũwara hoiba, 'Õnor ei gulam okkol edde hitarar baf dada okkole šoṛo halottu loti ehon foijjonto goru sool fali aiyer.' toi zene tũwara Gušenot takifariba, kiyollahoile soolsoroya okkol mani Mišoriyo okkolor hingšar ziniš."<verse eid="GEN 46:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1"/>Toi Yusuf giye edde Feruwanore ei hóborgan diye, hodde, "Ãr baf báiyain okkole hitarar goru sool edde hitarar nizor hár kissur loi Kenan dešottu aigiyegoi, ar ehon hitara Gušenot." <verse eid="GEN 47:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2"/>Ar hibaye hibar báiyain okkolor butottu fãs zonore loiyore hitarare Feruwanor sarme hazir goijje.<verse eid="GEN 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3"/>Feruwane báiyain okkolore fusar goijje, "Tũwarar feša ki?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Hitara Feruwanore hodde, "Õnor ei gulam okkol hitarar baf dada okkolor ḍoil, soolsoroya. <verse eid="GEN 47:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4"/>Ãra ei dešot forbaš goribolla aiššide, kiyollahoile õnor gulam okkole hitarar zanuwar okkol sori háibolla hono zaga no fail, kiyollahoile Kenanot raṭ beši hora oiye ar etolla aroz gorir, õnor gulam okkolore Gušenot takito do."<verse eid="GEN 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5"/>Toi Feruwane Yusufore hodde, "Tor baf edde tor báiyain okkol tor hãse aišše, <verse eid="GEN 47:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6"/>Mišoror deš tor sarme ase; ar dešor uttom zagat tor baf edde báiyaindore bošoti goraba; hitara Gušen elehat bošoti gorok; ar hitarar butore has laikka manuš asede tor zana takile, hitarar uwore ãr nizor zanuwar zãkor zimma de."<verse eid="GEN 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7"/>Bade Yusufe hibar nizor baf Yakubore ainne edde Feruwanor sarme hazir goijje; toi Yakube Feruwanore duwa goijje, <verse eid="GEN 47:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8"/>toi Feruwane Yakubore fusar goredde, "Tũwar boyoš ho bosor oiye?"<verse eid="GEN 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9"/>Toi Yakube Feruwanore hodde, "Ãr forbaš hal ekšo triš bosor; ãr aiur ei olfo din, hin o hoštot haiṭṭiye. Ar hin ãr baf dada okkolor forbaš halor aiuror fuwainna no o." <verse eid="GEN 47:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10"/>Bade Yakube Feruwanore duwa goijje edde hitar sarmottu bidai oiye.<verse eid="GEN 47:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11"/>Toi Feruwanor hokum mozin, Yusufe Mišor dešor uttom zagat, Rameses elehat, šombotti hisabe di, hibar baf edde hibar báiyain okkolore bošobaš goribolla buwai diye. <verse eid="GEN 47:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12"/>Yusufe hibar baf báiyain edde hibar bafor hár góror manuš okkolore, hitarar fuwain mozin haiddo zuhai diye.<verse eid="GEN 47:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Raṭ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13"/>Dešor hono mikka haiddo no aššil, kiyollahoile heṛe raṭ beši boiyanok oiye; Mišor edde Kenan raṭor zoriya toba oi giyegoi. <verse eid="GEN 47:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14"/>Ar Mišorot edde Kenanot zeto ṭiya aššil hin loi mainše haiddo kinat maze, Yusufe he šomosto ṭĩya dola gori loi Feruwanor górot ainne. <verse eid="GEN 47:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15"/>Mišor edde Kenan dešor manuš okkolor ṭĩya zehon šeš oi giyegoi, Mišor beggune Yusufor hãse aiyore hodde: "Ãrare haiddo do! Ãrattu ar hono ṭĩya nai boli ki ãra õnor sukor sarme moriyum ne?"<verse eid="GEN 47:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16"/>Yusufe hodde, "Tũwarattu ṭĩya šeš oigilegoi tũwarar goru sool do, toi ãi tũwarar zanuwaror bodole tũwarare haiddo diyum." <verse eid="GEN 47:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17"/>Toi hitara hitarar zanuwar okkol Yusufor hãse ainne, toi Yusufe gũra, soolor zak, gorur zak, edde gada, hin okkolor bodole tarare haiddo diye. Ebafe Yusufe hitarar hár goru sool okkolor bodole hitarare haiddo diye edde he bosor lalon falon goijje.<verse eid="GEN 47:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18"/>He bosor haṛi zaigoi bade hitara dusora bosor aiyore hodde, "Ãra ãrar malikor hãse kissu gufon no goriyum, ãrar ṭĩya beggun furaigiyegoi, ar goru sool o õnor oiye; ar ãrar ga edde zobin sara malikore sarme rakibolla ãrattu ar kissu nai. <verse eid="GEN 47:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19"/>Õnor sukor sarme ãra edde zobin šoho kiyolla moritam? Ãrare edde ãrar zobingunore haiddor bodole kini lo, ar ãra ãrar zobin šoho Feruwanor gulam oiyum. Ãrare bizor dana do, toi zene ãra zane basi fari edde no mori, ar zobingun o beabadi oi no zagoi."<verse eid="GEN 47:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20"/>Toi Yusufe Mišoror hár zobin Feruwanolla kini loiye, kiyollahoile Mišoriyo okkol fotti ekzone hitarar zaga besi felaiye, kiyollahoile hitarar uwore raṭ beši hora oil. Ei bafe Mišoror hár zaga Feruwanor oiye. <verse eid="GEN 47:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21"/>ar Yusufe Mišoror ek šimattu loti oinno šima foijjontor manuš okkol beggunore šohorot lari loi ainne. <verse eid="GEN 47:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22"/>hibaye šude šadu okkolor zobingun kini no lo, kiyollahoile hitara Feruwanottu bata faito, ar ze bata hitarare Feruwane dito hin loi hitara solito. Hetolla hitara hitarar zobin no bese.<verse eid="GEN 47:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23"/>Toi Yusufe mainšore hodde, "So, aziya ãi tũwara edde tũwarar zobin Feruwanolla kiniloilam. Ei bizor dana in lo, zobinot šiṛogoi. <verse eid="GEN 47:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24"/>Hinot folibode hinor fãs bagor ek bag Feruwanore diba, ar baki sair bagottu bizor dana edde tũwara edde tũwarar góror manuš okkol edde tũwarar fuwaindolla haiddo oibo."<verse eid="GEN 47:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25"/>Toi hitara hodde, "Õne ãrar foran rokka goilla, ãrar uwore õnor rahamotor nozor ok; ãra Feruwanor gulam oiyum."<verse eid="GEN 47:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26"/>Yusufe Mišoror zobinor babute ei ain ze goijjil hiyan aizo foijjonto zari ase. Zendilla neki, hár fošolor fãs bagor ek bag Feruwanor. Šude šadu okkolor zobin Feruwanor no o.<verse eid="GEN 47:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27"/>Toi Israili okkol Mišoror Gušen elehat bošoti goijje. Hitara heṛe šombotti fail edde hitara fólwala oiye edde manušor zono šoinka beši oi uiṭṭe.<verse eid="GEN 47:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakubor šeš din okkol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28"/>Yakub Mišor dešot hõtoro bosor basi aššil, ar Yakubor boyoš ek šo sališ hãt bosor oiye. <verse eid="GEN 47:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29"/>Bade zehon Israil moribar ṭaim hãse aišše, hibaye hibar fut Yusufore ḍakaiyore hodde: "Ãi zodi tor doya fai taki, toile aroz gorir, tui ãr kulot hat de edde ãre hota de ze tui ãre doya dehaibi edde he mozin wada ṭik rakibi. Tũi ãre Mišorot no gãraibi, <verse eid="GEN 47:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30"/>Ãi zehon ãr baf dada okkolor hãse ziraiyum, tui ãre Mišorottu niyolai loi zaiyore hitarar hoborstanot ãre gãraibi."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Yusufe hodde: "Tũi zen hor, ãi hen goijjum."<verse eid="GEN 47:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31"/>Toi hibaye hodde, "Tui ãr loi hosom gor." Toi hibaye hosom goijje, toi Israile bisanar šitanor mikka sojida foijje.<verse eid="GEN 47:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48"/>
  <para style="s">Yakube Manessa edde Efraimore duwa goijje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1"/>Iyar hoto din bade ekzone Yusufore hodde, "So, õnor bafottu ošuk." Henot hibaye hibar dui fut, Manessa edde Efraimore, hibar fũwati loiye. <verse eid="GEN 48:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2"/>Toi ekzone Yakubore hóbor hoiye, hodde, "So, tũwar fut Yusuf aišše." Henot Israile hibar gar hár bol diyore uiṭṭe edde bisanat uṛi boišše.<verse eid="GEN 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3"/>Yakube Yusufore hodde, "Kenan dešor Lušot maze Šorbo-Šoktiwala Allaye ãre deha dil edde duwa goijjil. <verse eid="GEN 48:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4"/>Hibaye ãre hoil, 'Sa, ãi tore beši fólwala goijjum edde tor bongšo barai diyum, ar ãi tore uggwa bout zatir šomaz goriyum, ar ãi tui bade tor bongšo okkolore ei dešgan sirohalolla šombotti hisabe diyum.'<verse eid="GEN 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5"/>"Ar ehon, tor dui fut, zara ãi eṛe Mišorot aibar age zormo oiye, hitara ãr; Ruben edde Simeonor ḍoilla Efraim edde Manessa o, hitara ãr. <verse eid="GEN 48:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6"/>Kintu itara bade zarare zonom dibi, hitara tor oibo; hitara hitarar báiyaindor name ei zagat šombottir miraz faibo. <verse eid="GEN 48:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7"/>Ar ãi Paddanottu aibar šomot Kenan dešor Efratot fõsite olfo fõt baki takite, Rahela ãr hãsottu mara giye. Henot ãi heṛe Efrator (hiyan oilde Betlehem) fõtor ḍake hibare dohon gorailam."<verse eid="GEN 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8"/>Toi, Israile Yusufor dui futore dekiyore hibaye fusar goredde, "Itara hontara?"<verse eid="GEN 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9"/>Yusufe hibar bafore hodde, "Itara ãr futain, zarare Allaye ei dešot ãre diye."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Toi Israile hodde, "Hitarare ãr hãse an, ãi hitarare duwa gori."<verse eid="GEN 48:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10"/>Burá boyoše suke dekibar šokti homi zagoinor zoriya Yakube bala gori no dekito. Yusufe hibar dui futore hibar hãse ainne, ar hibar bafe hitarare suma diye edde ãzamari doijje.<verse eid="GEN 48:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11"/>Toi Israile Yusufore hodde, "Ãi baffilam, tor muk ar no dekiyum; kintu sa, Allaye ãre tor bongšo udda dehaiye."<verse eid="GEN 48:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12"/>Tarfore Yusufe hitarare Yakubor kulottu lamai diye edde meṛir uzu oi holla zuhaiore bafore salam goijje.<verse eid="GEN 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13"/>Bade Yusufore dunizonore loi zai, Efraimore ḍen hate dori Israilor bame edde Manessare bam hate dori Israilor ḍene, hibar ḍake ainne. <verse eid="GEN 48:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14"/>Kintu Israile hibar ḍen hattan barai di Efraimor matat rakkil, zodi o hite šoṛo fut. Ar bam hattan Manessar matat rakkil, zodi o hite foila fut.<verse eid="GEN 48:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15"/>Toi hibaye Yusufore duwa goijje edde endilla hoiye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">"Ãr baf dada, Ibrahim edde Isak, Allar issa mozin solito,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">ãr zibonor foila loti aijja foijjonto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">he Allah ze ãre soolsoroyar ḍoilla gori sõli aiyer.<verse eid="GEN 48:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16"/>he firista ze ãre hár mosibotottu uddar goijje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">Hibaye ei zuwan okkolore duwa gorok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Itarar duwara ãr edde ãr baf dada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">Ibrahim edde Isakor nam basi takok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">ar itarar bongšo ei zobinot beša beši bari uṛok."<verse eid="GEN 48:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17"/>Hetunot Efraimor matat bafe ḍen hat raikkede deki Yusuf naraz oiye; toi hibaye Efraimor matattu bafor hattan loi Manessar matat dibolla saiye. <verse eid="GEN 48:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18"/>Yusufe bafore hodde, "Baba, hendilla no, foila zormo iteya; itar matat tũwar ḍen hat rako."<verse eid="GEN 48:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19"/>Kintu bafe na monzur oi hodde, "Ãi zani, o fut, ãi zani. Hitar butottu o uggwa zati oibo, edde hite o mohan oibo, kintu hitar šoṛo bái hitattuwaro aro beši mohan oibo. Hitar bongšor manuš okkolor butottu beši zati okkol oibo." <verse eid="GEN 48:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20"/>Toi hibaye hitarare he din duwa goijje edde hodde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:20">"Israili zati okkole honokiyore duwa dibar šomot hitara en hok:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:20">'Allaye tore Efraim edde Manessar ḍoilla gorok.'"</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 48:20">Endilla hoiyore hibaye Efraimore Manessare ḍõr banaiye.<verse eid="GEN 48:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21"/>Tarfore Israile Yusufore hodde, "Sa, ãi moribar ṭaim aišše, kintu Allah tũwarar fũwati takibo edde tũwarare tũwarar baf-dadar dešot firai loizaiboi. <verse eid="GEN 48:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22"/>Ãi tore tor báiyaindottuwaro ek bag miraz beši dilam, ze beši bag ãi tore diyum, hiyan oilde he zaga ziyan ãi toluwar edde silhanḍa loi zuddo gori Amorittiyo okkolor hatottu loilam."<verse eid="GEN 48:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49"/>
  <para style="s">Yakubor šeš hota edde entehal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1"/>Bade Yakube hibar futaindore ḍaikke edde hodde, "Beggune fũwati aiyo, sarme tũwarar uwore zin goṭibo hin ãi tũwarare hoi:<verse eid="GEN 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2"/>"Beggune fũwati aiyo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">Funo, Yakubor futain okkol,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">tũwarar bab Israilor hota funo.<verse eid="GEN 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3"/>"Ruben, tui ãr foila zormo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">Tui ãr bol, ãr juwanir foila fól,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">tui beggunor uwore šommani edde šoktidar.<verse eid="GEN 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4"/>Tui fanir ḍoilla ũtari foror, tor he usol tokka ar no takibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">kiyollahoile tui tor bafor bisanat giyos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">tui napak ham goijjos, hite ãr bisanat giye.<verse eid="GEN 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5"/>"Simeon edde Levi bái bái</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:5">hitarar horafir zontro oilde toluwar.<verse eid="GEN 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6"/>Hitarar gufon mošorat ãr hono ongšo nai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">ãi hitarar dolot no!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">kiyollahoile hitara guššae manuš kun gore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">nizor issa mote gorur ṭengor šiṛa haṛe.<verse eid="GEN 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7"/>Bodduwa hitarar gušša edde gumanore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">haron hin bišon edde beši zalemi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Ãi hitarare Yakubor bongšottu bag goriyum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">edde Israilor butore hitarare šiṛašitta goriyum.<verse eid="GEN 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8"/>"Ehudah, tor báiyainde tor tarif goribo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">dušmon okkolor geṛir uwore tor hat oibo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">tor bafor futain okkole tor sarme mata zuhaibo.<verse eid="GEN 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9"/>Ãr fut Ehudah, tui šingor so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">tui šiyaror gusto há šeš gori uṛi aili.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">Šingor ḍoilla neṛili edde uite fori roili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">honokiye tor ḍake aibar šahoš no gorer.<verse eid="GEN 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10"/>Ekdin Ehudar bongšor butottu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">ekzon šašongoroya aibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">zar hokum hár zatiye manibo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">Ehudattu razar aša no zaibogoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">no zaibogoi bisaror aša hibar dui ṭengor mazottu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">Ze foijjonto šilo no aiye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">ar zati okkolor baiddota hibar oibo.<verse eid="GEN 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11"/>He ãngur lotat hibare gadawa bandibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">ar ãngur gasor he barik ḍeilat bandibo, gadar soware,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">hibaye šorafot duiye hibar fušak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">ãnguror louwot duiye hibar hoor.<verse eid="GEN 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12"/>Hibar suk oibo šorafottuwaro lal,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:12">hibar dat dudottuwaro dola.<verse eid="GEN 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13"/>"Sebulun doriyar farot bošot goribo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">hiyan zahaz biraibar bondor oibo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">Sidon foijjonto hitar dešor šima oibo.<verse eid="GEN 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14"/>"Issakar oilde ek boli gada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:14">ze dui soolor urar mazottu neṛer.<verse eid="GEN 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15"/>hite dekilo ze ziranir zagagan bala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">ar deššan šundor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">hetolla hite bár boibolla hand lagai dilo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">ar ek bondi gulam oigiyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16"/>"Dane hitar mainšor bisar goribo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:16">Israilor guštir ek bongšor ḍoilla gori.<verse eid="GEN 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17"/>Dan ek haf, fõtor ḍake ek bišdor haf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">siyon rastat ze gũrar kuri sai kuṭmare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">ar gũrar suwari uldi fis mikka fori zagoi.<verse eid="GEN 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18"/>"O <char style="nd">Mabud </char> ãi tũwar uddaror ofekkat asi.<verse eid="GEN 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19"/>"Gadore ḍahaitor dole hamela goribo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">kintu te o ulda falda hamela goribo.<verse eid="GEN 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20"/>"Ašerottu barik haiddo fodai oibo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:20">hite razalla mozar hana zuhaibo.<verse eid="GEN 49:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21"/>"Naftali melá horinni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:21">hite šundojja baša ho.<verse eid="GEN 49:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22"/>"Yusuf oilde ek gulawala gas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">zonnar ḍake ek gulawala gas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">ze gasor ḍeila okkol ḍebal ḍiyai giye.<verse eid="GEN 49:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23"/>Tir maroya okkole hitare beši hošṭo der,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:23">hitara hitare tir marer edde hamela gorer.<verse eid="GEN 49:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24"/>Kintu hitar silhanḍa zendilla mojbut,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">hitar hator bayerat roiye hendilla bol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">kiyollahoile Yakubor Šoktiwalar hat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">ze Israilor falok edde he ḍõr fattor,<verse eid="GEN 49:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25"/>tor bafor Allah, ze tore modot gorer,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">he Šoktiwala, ze tore rahamot gorer,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">asmanor uworor rahamot loi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">nisor zobinor rahamot loi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">bukor dud edde gorbor rahamot loi.<verse eid="GEN 49:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26"/>Tor bafor rahamot aro barik</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">sirohailla faharottu rahamotottuwaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">sirohailla parbotottu bala zinišottuwaro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Hin okkol Yusufor matar uwore forok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">forok hitar matar širot, ze báiyain okkolor maze razfut.<verse eid="GEN 49:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27"/>"Benyamin oilde ek šiyari gendabag,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">binna hite šiyar háibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">ar hazinna hite luṭ baṛe."<verse eid="GEN 49:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28"/>Itara beggun oilde Israilor baro bongšo, ar in oilde zin hitarar bafe hitarare hoil zẽtte hibaye hitarare rahamot goijje. Hibaye rahamot goijje edde hitara fotti ekzon ze zar laikka mozin duwa diye.<verse eid="GEN 49:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakubor moron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29"/>Bade Yakube hitarare hokum diye edde hitarare hodde, "Ãi ãr baf dada okkolor hãse dola oirgoi. Hetittiyo Efronor maṛor hoboror gãtot, ãr baf dada okkolor fũwati ãre hobor diyo. <verse eid="GEN 49:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30"/>Ei gãt iba oilde Kenanot Mamrer muwamui Mokfelar maṛot, ziyan Ibrahime Hetittiyo Efronor hãsottu maṭ šoho hoborstan banaibolla kini loil. <verse eid="GEN 49:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31"/>Heṛe Ibrahim edde hibar bou Sarare o hobor diya oiye, ar Isak edde hibar bou Rebekare o heṛe hobor diya oiye, ar ãi Leare o heṛe hobor diyi. <verse eid="GEN 49:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32"/>He maṭ edde heṛe asede gãt šoho hiyan Hetittiyo okkolottu kini lowa oiye."<verse eid="GEN 49:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33"/>Yakube hibar futaindore hokum diya šeš gori bade bisanar uwore dui ṭeng ek hatar goijje, bade niyaš felaiye edde hibar baf dada okkol loi dola oiyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 49:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1"/>Hetunot Yusufe hibar bafor mukor uwore muk diyore hainde, edde hibare suma diye. <verse eid="GEN 50:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2"/>Bade Yusufe hibar bafor gat kušbo mosolla makidibolla, hibar gulam okkol edde ḍakṭor okkolore hokum diye, henot ḍakṭor okkole hibare kušbo mosolla makidiye, <verse eid="GEN 50:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3"/>Hitara he ham sališ din dori goijje, kiyollahoile kušbo mosolla maki dite sališ din lage. Ar Mišoriyo okkole hiballa hoittor din foijjonto šuk goijje.<verse eid="GEN 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4"/>Šukor din okkol faraizaigoi bade, Yusufe Feruwanor hormosari okkolore hodde, "Zodi ãi tũwarar nozorottu doya fai taki, toile Feruwanor hanot ei hotagun hogoi, <verse eid="GEN 50:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5"/>'Ãr bafe ãre hosom goraiye edde hoiye, "Sa, ãi morizairgoi, Kenanot ãi ãlla ze hobor kuri raikki, tui ãre hibat gãrais." Hetolla foriyad gorir, ãre heṛe uwore zaito do; ãi bafore gãrai bade abar firi aiššum.'" <verse eid="GEN 50:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6"/>Feruwane hodde, "Za, tor bafe tore zendilla hosom goraiye, tui he mozin hibar hobor degoi."<verse eid="GEN 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7"/>Toi Yusufe hibar bafore gãraibolla uwor mikka baisa diye, Feruwanor gulam okkol beggun, hitar góror hár murubbi okkol edde dešor hár murubbi okkol, beggune hibar fũwati uwore giye. <verse eid="GEN 50:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8"/>Ar Yusufor fura gór, edde hibar báiyain okkol, edde hibar bafor gór okkol giye; šude hitarar gura fuwain okkol edde goru soolor zãkgunore Gušenot eri giye. <verse eid="GEN 50:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9"/>ar hibar fũwati uwore gũragari edde gũrar suwari okkol o giye. Hitara beggune ḍõr ek dol oiye.<verse eid="GEN 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10"/>Toi hitara Zordan halor oinno faror Atador hõlat fõisse, heṛe beša beši bilag dori handa haṛi goijje. Ar Yusufe o hãt din dori bafolla šuk goijje. <verse eid="GEN 50:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11"/>Ar Kenanor bašinda okkole Atador hõlat Mišoror mainšor šuk falon šoba deki hodde, "Mišoriyo okkololla iyan ekkan beši muilliyoban šuk šoba oibo." Hetolla Zordanor oinno ḍakottu asede zaga hiyanor nam Abel-Mišraim nam oiye.<verse eid="GEN 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12"/>Toi hibar futaindore hokum dilde mozin hitara goijje. <verse eid="GEN 50:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13"/>Hitara hibare Kenanot loigiye, edde Mamrer muwamui Mokfelar maṛor gãtot hobor diye, ziyan Ibrahime Hetittiyo Efronor hãsottu hoborstan banaibolla kiniloil. <verse eid="GEN 50:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14"/>Bafore dohon gorai bade Yusufe báiyain okkol, aro zara hibar fũwati hibar bafore dohon goraito gil, hitara beggun šoho Mišorot firi aigiyegoi.<verse eid="GEN 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufe hibar báiyaindore maf gori der</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15"/>Yusufor báiyainde zehon deikke ze hitarar baf morigiyegoi, hitara hodde, "Otfare Yusufe ãrare hingša goribo, edde ãra hitar uwore ze burai goijjilam, hin beggunor bodola uwafes ãrattu loibo." <verse eid="GEN 50:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16"/>Hetolla hitara Yusufor hãse en hoiyore hóbor defeṛaiye, "Tor bafe moribar age ãrare endilla hokum dil: <verse eid="GEN 50:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17"/>'Tũwara Yusufore ei hota hoiyo: Tor báiyainde tor berudde oinnai goriyore ze nasoyi edde guna goijje meherbani gori tui hitarar onnaire edde gunare maf goride.' Etolla ehon ãra foriyad gorir, tor bafor Allar ei gulam okkolor onnaire edde gunare maf goride." Hitarar ei hotat Yusufe hainde.<verse eid="GEN 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18"/>Bade hibar Báiyain okkol o aišše edde hibar sarme meṛit ũite foijje edde hodde, "Sa, ãra tor gulam okkol."<verse eid="GEN 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19"/>Toi Yusufe hitarare hodde, "No ḍoraio! Ãi hon Allar zagat tiyoya? <verse eid="GEN 50:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20"/>Tũwara ãr berudde horafi goribolla baffila hiyan ṭik, kintu Allaye balar mikka baiffe. Ei bafe Allaye beši mainšor foran rokka goribar issa goijje, zendilla tũwara aziya dehor. <verse eid="GEN 50:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21"/>Hetolla no ḍoraiyo! Ãi tũwara edde tũwarar fuwaindore falizaiyum." Ei bafe hibaye hitarare dilot šanti edde buz diye.<verse eid="GEN 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufor moron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22"/>Bade Yusuf hibar bafor gór šoho beggun loi Mišorot bošoti goijje; Hiba ekšo doš bosor zinda aššil, <verse eid="GEN 50:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23"/>ar Yusufe Efraimor fuwain edde Efraimor natiyain okkol foijjonto dekkil. Ar Manessar fut Makiror fuwain okkol o Yusufor kulot zormo oil.<verse eid="GEN 50:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24"/>Bade Yusufe báiyaindore hodde, "Ãi morizairgoi, kintu Allaye hameka tũwarar uzu nozor rakibo, edde Ibrahim, Isak edde Yakubor hãse ze deš dibar wada goijjil, tũwarare ei dešottu he dešot loizaibo." <verse eid="GEN 50:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25"/>Yusufe Israili okkolore ek hosom goraiye edde hodde, "Allaye hameka tũwarar uzu saibo, ar tũwara entu ãr ãḍḍigun tuli loizaiyogoi."<verse eid="GEN 50:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26"/>Toi Yusuf ekšo doš bosor umorot mori giyegoi. Ar mainše hibare kušbo mosolla maki diye edde hibare Mišorot ek tabutot raki diya oiye.<verse eid="GEN 50:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50"/>
</usx>
